    ('Bound fast in hexed wrappings.', '被施咒的裹布紧紧束缚。'),
    ('Bound with a Felforged Aura this Shaft can be combined to create a weapon of mass-destruction.', '这根杖柄被邪能锻造光环所束缚，可与其他部件组合成一件大规模毁灭性武器。'),
    ('Bound with a Felforged Aura, this Glaivehead was once used with a weapon capable of reaching Limitless Power.\n\nI should try attaching this to something that could support it.', '这块刃首带有邪铸光环，曾与一件能达到无限力量的武器配合使用。\n\n我该试着把它装到能承受它的东西上。'),
    ('Bound with a Felforged aura that must be cleansed through combination of Spellcloth and Primal Might.', '被邪能锻造光环所束缚，需通过法术布与原始之力的组合来净化。'),
    ('Breaded, bite-sized, and mechanically inclined. I mean, processed!', '裹了面包屑、一口大小、机械倾向。我是说，加工过的！'),
    ('Bring enough for the arch geomancer to perform his ritual.', '带上足够的东西让大地理术士完成仪式。'),
    ('Brrrrr!', '好冷啊！'),
    ('Burning remnant of a wrathful guardian. Can be used to light ritual braziers and awaken its brethren.', '一位愤怒守卫的燃烧残骸。可用于点燃仪式火盆并唤醒它的同胞。'),
