    ('Can be turned in near your Capital Cities\' Commendation Exchanges! \n\nYou will find Markus at the Alliance Throne Room or Mar\'toge at the Horde Throne Room.', '可在主城的嘉奖兑换处附近上交！ \n\n你可以在暴风城王座厅找到马库斯，或在奥格瑞玛王座厅找到玛尔托格。'),
    ('Can be used for Mining, Blacksmithing, and Skinning!', '可用于采矿、锻造和剥皮！'),
    ('Can be used in arenas.  This potent flask is not consumed when used, but is unaffected by Mixology.', '可在竞技场中使用。  这瓶强效药剂使用后不会消耗，但不受调合剂专精影响。'),
    ('Can be used to active the Voidborne effect at a transmogrifier.', '可在幻化师处用于激活虚亡效果。'),
