    ('Causes  Fire damage when hit, increases your critical strike rating by  of your Spirit, and reduces the chance you are critically hit by   Only one type of Armor spell can be active on the Mage at any time.  Lasts 46d.', '被击中时造成  点火焰伤害，使你的暴击等级提高相当于精神的 ，并使你被暴击的几率降低   法师同时只能激活一种护甲法术。  持续 46d。'),
    ('Causes  Fire damage when hit, increases your critical strike rating by  of your Spirit, and reduces the chance you are critically hit by   Only one type of Armor spell can be active on the Mage at any time.  Lasts 82d.', '被击中时造成  点火焰伤害，使你的暴击等级提高相当于精神的 ，并使你被暴击的几率降低   法师同时只能激活一种护甲法术。  持续 82d。'),
    ('Causes  damage, incapacitating the opponent for d, and turns off your attack.  Target must be facing you.  Any damage caused will revive the target.  Awards  combo int:points', '造成  点伤害，使对手瘫痪 d，并关闭你的攻击。  目标必须面对你。  任何伤害都会使目标恢复。  获得  点连击 int:points'),
    ('Causes all enemies within  yards to be Dazed, reducing movement speed by  for', '使  码内所有敌人陷入眩晕，移动速度降低  ，持续'),
