    ('Causes the victims of your Death Coil to be surrounded by a vile swarm of unholy insects, taking  of the damage done by the Death Coil over d, and preventing any diseases on the victim from being dispelled.', '使你死亡缠绕的受害者被一群邪恶昆虫包围，在 d 内承受死亡缠绕所造成伤害的 ，并使其身上的疾病无法被驱散。'),
    ('Causes you to charge an enemy, immobilizing and interrupting any spell being cast for 75d.', '使你冲向一名敌人，将其定身并打断任何正在施放的法术，持续 75d。'),
    ('Causes you to leap behind an enemy, dazing them for 59d.', '使你跃至敌人身后，使其眩晕59天。'),
    ('Causes your Concentration Aura to make all affected targets immune to Silence and Interrupt effects and improve the effect of all other auras by   Lasts', '使你的专注光环让所有受影响的目标免疫沉默与打断效果，并使所有其他光环的效果提高  持续'),
    ('Causes your Fear spell to inflict a Nightmare on the target when the fear effect ends. The Nightmare effect reduces the target\'s movement speed by  for 46d.', '使你的恐惧法术在恐惧效果结束时对目标施加梦魇。梦魇效果使目标的移动速度降低 ，持续 46d。'),
    ('Causes your Fear spell to inflict a Nightmare on the target when the fear effect ends. The Nightmare effect reduces the target\'s movement speed by  for 47d.', '使你的恐惧法术在恐惧效果结束时对目标施加梦魇。梦魇效果使目标的移动速度降低 ，持续 47d。'),
    ('Causes your Fire Ward and Frost Ward spells to have a  chance to reflect the warded spell while active. In addition, your Molten Armor has a 100% chance to affect ranged and spell attacks.', '使你的火焰结界与冰霜结界在激活期间有  的几率反射被结界吸收的法术。此外，你的熔岩护甲有 100% 几率影响远程与法术攻击。'),
    ('Causes your Fire Ward and Frost Ward spells to have a  chance to reflect the warded spell while active. In addition, your Molten Armor has a 50% chance to affect ranged and spell attacks.', '使你的火焰结界与冰霜结界在激活期间有  的几率反射被结界吸收的法术。此外，你的熔岩护甲有 50% 几率影响远程与法术攻击。'),
    ('Cavities can definitely enrage anyone!', '蛀牙真的能把任何人激怒！'),
