    ('Channel the power of Ossirian.', '引导奥斯里安的力量。'),
    ('Chaotic arcane energy crystallized from high-traffic portals. The soil of Sunsong Ranch will stabilize this energy, yielding a shard that can be broken on the farm to open a one-shot portal to a major city.', '从中转频繁的传送门中结晶出的混乱奥术能量。向阳牧场的土壤能稳定这股能量，产出可在农场中击碎、开启通往主城的一次性传送门的碎片。'),
    ('Charge an enemy, causing  damage (based on attack power) and stunning it for 53d.', '冲锋一名敌人，造成  点伤害（基于攻击强度），并使其昏迷 3 秒。'),
