    ('Creates  copies of the caster nearby, which cast spells and attack the mage\'s enemies.  Lasts 42d.', '在施法者附近创造 个复制体，它们会施放法术并攻击法师的敌人。  持续 42d。'),
    ('Creates a Demonic Healthstone that can be used to instantly restore  health.\n\nConjured items disappear if logged out for more than 15 minutes.', '制造一块恶魔治疗石，使用后可立即恢复  点生命值。\n\n若登出超过 15 分钟，召唤物品将会消失。'),
