    ('Creates a portal, teleporting group members to Onyxia Lair.', '开启一道传送门，把小队成员传送至奥妮克希亚巢穴。'),
    ('Creates a portal, teleporting group members to Zul\'Gurub.', '开启一道传送门，把小队成员传送至祖尔格拉布。'),
    ('Creates a shadowy fiend to attack the target.  Caster receives  mana when the Shadowfiend attacks. Damage taken by area of effect attacks is reduced. Lasts', '制造一个暗影恶魔攻击目标。  暗影魔攻击时施法者会获得  点法力值。其受到的群体伤害降低。持续'),
    ('Creates a violent storm in the target area causing  Nature damage to enemies every  sec, reducing movement speed by %, ][ ]and increasing the time between attacks of enemies by   Lasts   Druid must channel to maintain the spell.', '在目标区域制造猛烈风暴，每  秒对敌人造成  点自然伤害，使其移动速度降低 %，并使敌人的攻击间隔延长   持续   德鲁伊必须引导以维持该法术。'),
    ('Crisp basilisk urethra.', '酥脆的蜥蜴尿管。'),
    ('Crow\'s Omen', '乌鸦的预兆'),
    ('Crudely carved from a twisted thunder lizard horn.', '用扭曲的雷蜥角粗糙雕刻而成。'),
    ('Crushed in the fury of combat.', '在战斗的狂怒中被碾碎。'),
    ('Crusted with eons of debris and recently fractured.', '包裹着万年的积垢，且最近刚刚裂开。'),
    ('Cryptic commands from someone named Helix.', '来自某个名叫 Helix 的人的隐晦命令。'),
    ('Crystals Scales of Dark Dragon', '黑暗巨龙的晶鳞'),
    ('Cultivated by an Alchemist at a Sanguine Workbench to create ingredients.\n\nObtained from herb nodes in High-Risk Tier zones.', '由炼金师在血色工作台上培育以制造材料。\n\n从高风险档次区域的草药节点获得。'),
    ('Cyclopean Demonic Octopi... nice!', '独眼的恶魔章鱼……不错！'),
    ('DO NOT DROP!!!', '请勿掉落！！！'),
    ('DO NOT POINT AT SELF OR OTHERS. IN CASE OF CONTACT WITH SKIN: RUN.', '切勿指向自己或他人。若接触皮肤：快跑。'),
    ('Damage that would take you below  health or taken while you are at  health is reduced by 84s1%.', '会使你的生命值低于 点、或在你处于 点生命值时受到的伤害降低 84s1%。'),
    ('Damage that would take you below  health or taken while you are at  health is reduced by 85s1%.', '会使你的生命值低于 点、或在你处于 点生命值时受到的伤害降低 85s1%。'),
    ('Damage that would take you below  health or taken while you are at  health is reduced by 86s1%.', '会使你的生命值低于 点、或在你处于 点生命值时受到的伤害降低 86s1%。'),
    ('Dank, wet, and smells like fish.', '阴湿，闻起来像鱼。'),
    ('Dark as tar on a pitch black night!', '漆黑夜里如沥青般黑！'),
    ('Darker and cloudier than the other samples of oil.', '比其他油样更暗、更浑浊。'),
    ('Dazed, but still alive and wiggling.', '晕乎乎的，但还活着，还在扭动。'),
