    ('Death\'s Reward for reaching level 80.', '达到 80 级的死亡奖励。'),
    ('Debris from weapons, armor, or something else, it\'s difficult to tell anymore, but it still has its metallic sheen. Hopefully that\'s all the harpies care about.', '来自武器、护甲或其他东西的残片，如今已难以分辨，但仍保着金属光泽。但愿鹰身人只在乎这些。'),
    ('Deceptively long, and surprisingly elastic!', '看着短，却出奇地有弹性！'),
    ('Decrease the armor of the target by  for   While affected, the target cannot stealth or turn invisible.', '使目标的护甲降低 ，持续  受此影响期间，目标无法潜行或隐形。'),
    ('Decrease the armor of the target by  for   While affected, the target cannot stealth or turn invisible.  Deals  damage and additional threat when used in Bear Form or Dire Bear Form.', '使目标的护甲降低 ，持续   受影响期间，目标无法潜行或隐身。  在熊形态或巨熊形态下使用时造成  点伤害与额外威胁值。'),
    ('Definitely not anodized.', '绝对没有做过阳极处理。'),
    ('Definitely stolen from an adventurer.', '绝对是从某个冒险者那里偷来的。'),
    ('Deformed from where it cracked through Gann\'s rib.', '在穿透甘恩肋骨的裂口处变形了。'),
    ('Delicately crafted to fit comfortably around a Murloc\'s neck.', '精巧制作，能舒适地套在鱼人脖子上。'),
    ('Delicious and completely absent of  psychedelic properties.', '美味可口，且完全不含迷幻成分。'),
    ('Delivery for Salazar Bloch. The package contains the Annals of Tarren Mill and the Full History of Southshore.', '寄给萨拉查·布洛克的投递。包裹内是《塔伦米尔年鉴》与《南海镇全史》。'),
    ('Demonic Fanblades', '恶魔扇刃'),
    ('Designed for rapid draw and fire!', '专为快速拉弓射击而设计！'),
    ('Despite its beauty, the flower\'s petals are tougher than leather.', '尽管美丽，这朵花的花瓣却比皮革还坚韧。'),
    ('Despite the fires, a tiny sprout grows.', '尽管周围有火，一株小芽仍在生长。'),
    ('Destroy  of the target\'s mana (up to a maximum of  of your own maximum mana). For each mana destroyed in this way, the target takes 0.5 Shadow damage.', '摧毁目标  的法力值（最多不超过你自己最大法力值的 ）。每以此法摧毁一点法力值，目标就受到 0.5 点暗影伤害。'),
    ('Details Kirin Tor movements and numbers across the isle.', '详载肯瑞托在岛上的动向与人数。'),
    ('Details mogu positions and potential artifacts of interest within the Vale.', '详载谷内魔古势力位置与值得关注的潜在神器。'),
    ('Details the brave acts you performed in service of the Alliance.', '详载你为联盟效劳的英勇事迹。'),
