    ('Disguise yourself as one of the Gordok ogres, and maybe even fool a particular captain in the process!  The suit will only hold together for $d1.', '把自己伪装成戈多克食人魔，说不定还能顺便骗过某位队长！  这套伪装只能维持 $d1。'),
