    ('Dispels  Curse from a friendly target.', '驱散友方目标身上的诅咒。'),
    ('Dispels magic in a  yard radius, removing  harmful ell:spells', '驱散  码半径内的魔法，移除  个有害法术效果'),
    ('Dispels magic in a 15 yard radius, removing all harmful Magic from 5 friendly targets and 1 beneficial Magic effect from 5 enemy targets. Potent enough to remove Magic that is normally undispellable.', '驱散 15 码半径内的魔法，移除 5 个友方目标身上的所有有害魔法，以及 5 个敌方目标身上的 1 个有益魔法效果。效力足以移除通常无法驱散的魔法。'),
    ('Dispenser serves as:\nGyromatic Micro-Adjuster,\nArclight Spanner,\nBlacksmithing Hammer,\nMining Pick,\nSkinning Knife,\nLumber Axe,\nVirtuoso Inking Set,\nPhilosopher\'s Stone.\n\n|cffFF0000ALL Upgrades are lost if this item is destroyed!|r', '工具箱可充当：\n侏儒微调器、\n弧光扳手、\n锻造锤、\n矿工锄、\n剥皮小刀、\n伐木斧、\n大师级铭文工具、\n点金石。\n\n|cffFF0000若此物品被摧毁，所有升级都将丢失！|r'),
    ('Dispenser serves as:\nGyromatic Micro-Adjuster,\nArclight Spanner,\nBlacksmithing Hammer,\nMining Pick,\nSkinning Knife,\nLumber Axe,\nVirtuoso Inking Set,\nPhilosopher\'s Stone.\n|cff00ff00Upgrades:\nRuned Arcanite Rod|r\n\n|cffFF0000ALL Upgrades are lost if this item is destroyed!|r', '工具箱可充当：\n侏儒微调器、\n弧光扳手、\n锻造锤、\n矿工锄、\n剥皮小刀、\n伐木斧、\n大师级铭文工具、\n点金石。\n|cff00ff00升级：\n符文奥金棒|r\n\n|cffFF0000若此物品被摧毁，所有升级都将丢失！|r'),
    ('Dispenser serves as:\nGyromatic Micro-Adjuster,\nArclight Spanner,\nBlacksmithing Hammer,\nMining Pick,\nSkinning Knife,\nLumber Axe,\nVirtuoso Inking Set,\nPhilosopher\'s Stone.\n|cff00ff00Upgrades:\nRuned Eternium Rod|r\n\n|cffFF0000ALL Upgrades are lost if this item is destroyed!|r', '工具箱可充当：\n侏儒微调器、\n弧光扳手、\n锻造锤、\n矿工锄、\n剥皮小刀、\n伐木斧、\n大师级铭文工具、\n点金石。\n|cff00ff00升级：\n符文恒金棒|r\n\n|cffFF0000若此物品被摧毁，所有升级都将丢失！|r'),
    ('Dispenser serves as:\nGyromatic Micro-Adjuster,\nArclight Spanner,\nBlacksmithing Hammer,\nMining Pick,\nSkinning Knife,\nLumber Axe,\nVirtuoso Inking Set,\nPhilosopher\'s Stone.\n|cff00ff00Upgrades:\nRuned Titanium Rod|r\n\n|cffFF0000ALL Upgrades are lost if this item is destroyed!|r', '工具箱可充当：\n侏儒微调器、\n弧光扳手、\n锻造锤、\n矿工锄、\n剥皮小刀、\n伐木斧、\n大师级铭文工具、\n点金石。\n|cff00ff00升级：\n符文泰坦精钢棒|r\n\n|cffFF0000若此物品被摧毁，所有升级都将丢失！|r'),
    ('Distracts the target to attack you, but has no effect if the target is already attacking you. Lasts 59d.', '使目标分心转而攻击你，但如果目标已在攻击你则无效。持续 59d。'),
    ('Do not drink.', '请勿饮用。'),
    ('Do not drop.', '请勿掉落。'),
    ('Do not leave in your bags unattended.', '别把装有它的背包丢下不管。'),
    ('Do not mistake the stillness of this lifeless face for peace. The warmongering spirit of Maggoc yet lingers, ready to incite violence at the first opportunity.', '不要把这具无生命面孔的静止误认为安宁。马格克的嗜战之魂仍在徘徊，随时准备煽动暴力。'),
    ('Do tauren even wear shoes?', '牛头人到底穿不穿鞋？'),
    ('Dodeka\'s Wrath', '多德卡的怒火'),
    ('Does not consume on use. Only usable in the Manastorm', '使用时不会消耗。仅可在法力风暴中使用'),
    ('Does not consume on use. Only usable in the Manastorm. Shares cooldown with similar effects.', '使用时不消耗。仅可在法力风暴中使用。与同类效果共享冷却时间。'),
    ('Does not drop on death in High-Risk.\n\nLures Creatures to Twisted Beast Nests found in High-Risk Zangramarsh, Terrokar Forest and Nagrand. Placing bait will trigger the No-Retreat debuff on you, preventing escape spells from taking you to safety.', '在高风险区域死亡时不会掉落。\n\n用于引诱生物前往高风险区域赞加沼泽、泰罗卡森林与纳格兰的扭曲兽巢。放置诱饵会对你施加「无法退缩」减益，使逃脱法术无法将你带离险境。'),
    ('Does not drop on death in High-Risk.\n\nLures Creatures to Void Beast Nests found in High-Risk Netherstorm. Placing bait will trigger the No-Retreat debuff on you, preventing escape spells from taking you to safety.', '在高风险区域死亡时不会掉落。\n\n用于在高风险区域虚空风暴的虚空兽巢穴吸引生物。放置诱饵会对你施加「无法退缩」减益，使逃脱法术无法将你带离险境。'),
    ('Does not drop on death in High-Risk.\n\nOpens Core Forged Beast Nests found in High-Risk Un\'goro, Burning Steppes and Azshara. Opening a cache will trigger the No-Retreat debuff on you, preventing escape spells from taking you to safety.', '在高风险区域死亡时不会掉落。\n\n用于开启高风险区域安戈洛、燃烧平原与艾萨拉的熔铸兽巢。开启宝箱会对你施加「无法退缩」减益，使逃脱法术无法将你带离险境。'),
    ('Does not drop on death in High-Risk.\n\nOpens Demon Forged Beast Nests found in High-Risk Silithus and Winterspring. Opening a cache will trigger the No-Retreat debuff on you, preventing escape spells from taking you to safety.', '在高风险区域死亡时不会掉落。\n\n用于开启高风险区域希利苏斯与冬泉谷的恶魔锻造兽巢。开启宝箱会对你施加「无法退缩」减益，使逃脱法术无法将你带离险境。'),
    ('Does not drop on death in High-Risk.\n\nOpens Dread Hidden Caches found in High-Risk Blade\'s Edge Mountain and Shadowmoon Valley. Opening a cache will trigger the No-Retreat debuff on you, preventing escape spells from taking you to safety.', '在高风险区域死亡时不会掉落。\n\n用于开启高风险区域刀锋山与影月谷的恐惧隐秘宝箱。开启宝箱会对你施加「无法退缩」减益，使逃脱法术无法将你带离险境。'),
    ('Does not drop on death in High-Risk.\n\nOpens Scourge Forged Beast Nests found in High-Risk High-Risk Western Plaguelands and Eastern Plaguelands. Opening a cache will trigger the No-Retreat debuff on you, preventing escape spells from taking you to safety.', '在高风险区域死亡时不会掉落。\n\n用于开启高风险区域西瘟疫之地与东瘟疫之地的天灾熔铸兽巢。开启宝箱会对你施加「无法退缩」减益，使逃脱法术无法将你带离险境。'),
    ('Does not drop on death in High-Risk.\n\nOpens Twisted Hidden Caches found in High-Risk Zangramarsh, Terrokar Forest and Nagrand. Opening a cache will trigger the No-Retreat debuff on you, preventing escape spells from taking you to safety.', '在高风险区域死亡时不会掉落。\n\n用于开启高风险区域赞加沼泽、泰罗卡森林与纳格兰的扭曲隐秘宝箱。开启宝箱会对你施加「无法退缩」减益，使逃脱法术无法将你带离险境。'),
    ('Does not drop on death in High-Risk.\n\nOpens Void Bound Hidden Caches found in High-Risk Netherstorm. Opening a cache will trigger the No-Retreat debuff on you, preventing escape spells from taking you to safety.', '在高风险区域死亡时不会掉落。\n\n用于开启高风险区域虚空风暴中的虚空束缚隐秘宝箱。开启宝箱会对你施加「无法退缩」减益，使逃脱法术无法将你带离险境。'),
    ('Does this stuff still work?', '这东西还能用吗？'),
    ('Don\'t drop it!', '别把它掉了！'),
    ('Don\'t feel too bad... it wasn\'t theirs to begin with.', '别太难过……那本来也不是他们的东西。'),
    ('Don\'t forget to bind your own hearthstone when you reach Orgrimmar!', '到了奥格瑞玛后别忘了绑定你自己的炉石！'),
    ('Don\'t forget to bind your own hearthstone when you reach Stormwind!', '到了暴风城后别忘了绑定你自己的炉石！'),
    ('Don\'t smell it...', '别去闻它……'),
    ('Don\'t touch what you can\'t afford.', '买不起的别碰。'),
    ('Dont you get...', '你难道不明白……'),
    ('Downright crumbly.', '简直要碎成渣了。'),
    ('Draconic runes appear and disappear along the surface. It may fits into somewhere.', '龙族符文在表面时隐时现。它也许能嵌进某处。'),
    ('Draw upon unholy energy to become undead for   While undead, you are immune to Charm, Fear and Sleep effects.', '借助邪恶能量变为亡灵，持续  处于亡灵状态时，你免疫魅惑、恐惧与睡眠效果。'),
