    ('Dreadlord\'s Venombane Wings', '恐惧魔王的毒牙之翼'),
    ('Dress up in a Hobgoblin Costume.', '穿上大地精伪装。'),
    ('Dried rations, blades, and uniforms packed in straw.', '干粮、刀剑与制服，用稻草包着。'),
    ('Dried up, crusty blood can be seen all over the blade.', '刀刃上到处可见干涸的结痂血迹。'),
    ('Drink responsibly.', '请理性饮酒。'),
    ('Dripping.', '滴落着。'),
    ('Drop a rug. Assemble your Peace Pipe. Light up some strange herb and get ready to chill out and get real ascended.', '铺开地毯，组装你的和平烟斗，点上些奇怪的草药，准备好放松下来，真正升格。'),
