    ('Equips your Tamed Verdantcoil, who blends seamlessly with the wild, draping across your shoulder like a guardian of the forest, always ready to slip into the shadows.', '装备你的驯服翠蔓蛇，它与野地浑然一体，如森林守卫般垂绕在你肩上，随时准备隐入阴影。'),
    ('Erunak\'s \'other\' orb.', '埃鲁纳克的“另一个”宝珠。'),
    ('Escape from the wandering visions', '逃离游荡的幻象'),
    ('Eschewing accuracy for awe.', '舍弃精准以取震撼。'),
    ('Essence of the Forgotten King', '被遗忘之王的精华'),
    ('Even before Jannik\'s death, it seems Henricus was experimenting with temporal manipulation to keep a copy of the staff for himself.', '早在雅尼克去世之前，亨利库斯似乎就在研究时间操控之术，以把法杖的副本据为己有。'),
    ('Even holding one of these in your hand fills you with unease.', '即便只是握在手里一只，也让你心生不安。'),
    ('Even if your watch has to last forever, and I probably won\'t, just remember me as someone who was your friend for a little while, okay Ralo?', '即使你的守望必须永远持续，而我大概无法陪伴，也请记住曾有一个人，短暂地做过你的朋友，好吗，拉洛？'),
    ('Even in death, this strange creature continues changing color to blend in with its environment.', '即便在死亡之后，这个奇异生物仍不断改变颜色以融入环境。'),
    ('Even its facets have facets. This is certainly very valuable to the right person.', '连它的切面都有切面。对识货的人来说这无疑价值连城。'),
    ('Even longer than your average cloak or cape.', '比寻常的披风或斗篷都要长得多。'),
    ('Even those you care for most will turn on you in the end.', '即便是你最在乎的人，最终也会背叛你。'),
    ('Even works in lava!', '在岩浆里也能用！'),
    ('Every bit as slick as it is speckled.', '既光滑又带斑点。'),
    ('Every herb blooms in its own sweet time. Then you pick it!', '每种草药都会在自己的甜蜜时刻开花。然后你去采它！'),
    ('Everything appears in order. The request to strap poison bombs to the Hozen does strike you as odd.', '一切看起来都很正常。只有把毒气炸弹绑在猴人身上这要求让你觉得有点奇怪。'),
    ('Everything from silvered knives to holy water.', '从镀银小刀到圣水，应有尽有。'),
    ('Everything you need to fix those pesky critters.', '修理那些烦人小东西所需的一切。'),
    ('Everything you\'ve ever managed to earn or steal!', '你挣到的或偷到的一切！'),
    ('Everything, INCLUDING the kitchen sink!', '样样俱全，连厨房水槽都有！'),
    ('Ewwww!', '呃啊……！'),
    ('Excavator\'s Camping Backpack', '挖掘工的露营背包'),
    ('Excavator\'s Field Backpack', '挖掘工的野外背包'),
    ('Excavator\'s Work Backpack', '挖掘工的工作背包'),
    ('Exchanged at Vishous for rewards.', '在维绍斯处兑换奖励。'),
    ('Experience, honor points and faction reputation are in the days ahead.', '经验、荣誉点数与阵营声望就在前方。'),
    ('Exposes all hidden and invisible enemies within  yards of the targeted area for', '揭穿目标区域  码内所有隐藏与隐身的敌人，持续'),
    ('Expressing gratitude by trying to claw and bite you.', '用抓咬你来表达感激之情。'),
    ('Exquisitely crafted and bearing the mark of the Wukao.', '工艺精湛，并带有武考之印。'),
    ('Extensively glyphed with runes from the elemental tongue.', '满布元素语言的符文刻印。'),
    ('Exterminator\'s Crest of the Damned', '受诅者的灭虫者纹章'),
    ('Extremely difficult to open.', '极难打开。'),
    ('Extremely hot to the touch.', '摸起来极烫。'),
    ('Fade out, temporarily reducing all your threat for', '渐隐，暂时降低你的全部威胁值，持续'),
    ('Faewoven Bulb', '织灵球茎'),
    ('Faewoven Pack', '织灵行囊'),
    ('Faintly glowing symbols move quietly over the surface of this perfectly smooth stone. You can\'t read the language, but Wrathion can interpret it.', '微光闪烁的符号在这块完美光滑的石面上静静游走。你读不懂这种文字，但拉希奥能解读。'),
    ('False documents that compile fabricated evidence linking the Alliance to the recent fires and sabotage in Thunder Bluff. The documents mention five Alliance agents who managed to slip away before they could be captured. Is it a coincidence that the five pacified ones you handed over to Kagtha match that number?', '伪造的文件，将最近雷霆崖的火灾与破坏活动牵强地归咎于联盟。文件中提到五名联盟特工在被捕之前成功脱身。而你交给卡格莎的那五名被安抚者恰好也是五名，这难道只是巧合？'),
    ('Feathers crackle with residual flame.', '羽毛还带着余火的噼啪声。'),
    ('Feathers of the First Ones', '先驱者之羽'),
    ('Feathers of the Peacock', '孔雀之羽'),
    ('Feathers of the Raven Lord', '渡鸦领主之羽'),
    ('Feathers of the Rose Pheonix', '玫瑰凤凰之羽'),
    ('Featuring such favorites as the \'Thundermar Triple-Fork\' and the \'Blammenhammer Chin Strip.\'', '收录了“雷蹄三叉戟”和“布拉门锤下巴剃刀”等热门款式。'),
    ('Feed to an Arboreal Gulper to weaken it\'s defense.', '喂给树栖吞咽者以削弱它的防御。'),
    ('Feed your pet the selected item.  Feeding your pet increases happiness.  Using food close to the pet\'s level will have a better result.', '用选中的物品喂养你的宠物。  喂养宠物会提升其快乐值。  使用接近宠物等级的食物效果更好。'),
    ('Feeling lucky?', '感觉运气不错？'),
    ('Feeling lucky? Open up this box and receive a random Flag of Ownership.', '想碰碰运气？打开这个盒子可获得一面随机归属旗帜。'),
    ('Feign death which may trick enemies into ignoring you.  Lasts up to', '假死，可能让敌人忽略你。最长持续'),
    ('Feisty!', '脾气火爆！'),
    ('Fel Power is used to enhance your Hero.\n\nYou gain Fel Power from gaining levels, completing Demon Contracts, and Completing Fel Challenges.\nFel Power automatically unlocks Powerful Perks, Riding, Empowered Legion Insignia\'s and more as you accumulate it.\n\nIt can also be spent at Silas Darkmoon for Mystic Runes, Orbs, Skillcards, and Hands of Fate.', '邪能用于强化你的英雄。\n\n你可以通过升级、完成恶魔契约与完成邪能挑战获得邪能。\n邪能会随着累积自动解锁强力增益、骑乘、强化军团徽记等更多内容。\n\n你也可以在主城的塞拉斯·暗月处用它换取神秘符文、宝珠、技能卡与命运之手。'),
    ('Fel energy is leaking from several places.', '邪能从好几处泄漏出来。'),
    ('Felforged Souls can be used to redeem consumable and account-wide rewards in the Twisting Nether from your master Qormaladon.\n\nSouls can be earned from Quests, Fel Challenges, and Hero Kills.', '邪铸灵魂可用于在扭曲虚空向你主人科玛拉顿兑换消耗品与账号通用的奖励。\n\n灵魂可通过任务、邪能挑战与英雄击杀获得。'),
    ('Felo\'melorn also known as Flamestrike is an ancient Highborne runeblade once wielded by Dath\'Remar Sunstrider, even before the War of the Ancients.It is rumored to have once been his favored weapon.', '费罗梅罗恩又名烈焰之击，是一柄古老的上层精灵符文剑，早在永恒之井之战前就曾由达斯雷玛·逐日者持有。据传说它曾是他最钟爱的武器。'),
    ('Field Warden\'s Torture Kit', '战地看守的刑具包'),
    ('Field Warden\'s Watchful Eye', '战地看守的警惕之眼'),
    ('Fiending.', '渴求着。'),
    ('Fights the funk with some arcane junk!', '用奥术垃圾对抗这股恶臭！'),
    ('Fill \'er up!', '加满！'),
    ('Filled with fresh water.', '装满了淡水。'),
    ('Filled with rations, parchment, and a few odd pieces of equipment.', '装满了口粮、羊皮纸和几件零散装备。'),
    ('Filled with the right herbs, this flask could be very potent.', '装上对的草药，这只瓶子会非常强效。'),
    ('Filled with various reagents from the Altar of Storms.', '装满了来自风暴祭坛的各类材料。'),
    ('Filled with warmth and light.', '充满温暖与光明。'),
    ('Fills the Paladin with divine light for d, giving each melee attack a chance to heal the Paladin for   Only one Seal can be active on the Paladin at any one time.\n\nUnleashing this Seal\'s energy will deal  Holy damage to an enemy.', '以神圣之光充满圣骑士，持续 d，使每次近战攻击都有几率治疗圣骑士  点。圣骑士同时只能激活一种圣印。\n\n释放此圣印的能量会对一名敌人造成  点神圣伤害。'),
    ('Fills the Paladin with divine wisdom for d, giving each melee attack a chance to restore  of the paladin\'s maximum mana.  Only one Seal can be active on the Paladin at any one time.\n\nUnleashing this Seal\'s energy will deal  Holy damage to an enemy.', '以神圣智慧充满圣骑士，持续 d，使每次近战攻击都有几率恢复圣骑士最大法力值的  。圣骑士同时只能激活一种圣印。\n\n释放此圣印的能量会对一名敌人造成  点神圣伤害。'),
    ('Fills the Paladin with holy power, causing attacks to apply Holy Vengeance, which deals  additional Holy damage over   Holy Vengeance can stack up to  times.  Once stacked to  times, each of the Paladin\'s attacks also deals  weapon damage as additional Holy damage.  Only one Seal can be active on the Paladin at any one time.  Lasts  this Seal\'s energy will deal  Holy damage to an enemy, increased by 10% for each application of Holy Vengeance on the target.', '以神圣之力充满圣骑士，使攻击施加神圣复仇，在  内额外造成  点神圣伤害。神圣复仇最多可叠加  次。叠满  次后，圣骑士的每次攻击还会额外造成  点武器伤害的神圣伤害。圣骑士同时只能激活一种圣印。持续  ，释放此圣印的能量会对一名敌人造成  点神圣伤害，目标身上每层神圣复仇使该伤害提高 10%。'),
    ('Fills the Paladin with holy spirit for d, granting each melee attack  additional Holy damage.  Only one Seal can be active on the Paladin at any one time.', '以圣光之灵充满圣骑士，持续 d，使每次近战攻击附带  点额外神圣伤害。  圣骑士同时只能激活一种圣印。'),
    ('Fills the Paladin with the spirit of justice for d, giving each melee attack a chance to stun for   Only one Seal can be active on the Paladin at any one time.\n\nUnleashing this Seal\'s energy will deal  Holy damage to an enemy.', '以正义之灵充满圣骑士，持续 d，使每次近战攻击有几率使其昏迷   圣骑士同时只能激活一种圣印。\n\n释放此圣印的能量会对敌人造成  点神圣伤害。'),
    ('Fills you with the embrace of Shadow energy, causing you to be healed for  and other party members to be healed for', '以暗影能量的拥抱充满你，使你获得 点治疗，其他队员获得 点治疗，持续'),
    ('Filthy, bloody, and singed.', '肮脏、血污，还被烧焦了。'),
    ('Find beauty in ordinary things. Vendor them for cash.', '在平凡之物中发现美。卖给商人换钱。'),
    ('Finely crafted to Ephoenix\'s specification', '按 Ephoenix 的规格精心打造'),
    ('Finest snack for the workers of the Legion.', '献给军团工兵的美味小食。'),
    ('Finishing move that exposes the target, reducing armor by  and lasting longer per combo point:\n   1 point  :  sec.\n   2 points:  sec.\n   3 points:  sec.\n   4 points:  sec.\n   5 points:  sec.', '暴露目标的终结技，使其护甲降低 ，且连击点数越多持续时间越长：\n   1 点：  秒\n   2 点：  秒\n   3 点：  秒\n   4 点：  秒\n   5 点：  秒'),
    ('Finishing move that increases melee attack speed by   Lasts longer per combo point:\n   1 point  :  seconds\n   2 points:  seconds\n   3 points:  seconds\n   4 points:  seconds\n   5 points:  seconds', '提高近战攻击速度的终结技，使其提高   连击点数越多持续时间越长：\n   1 点： 秒\n   2 点： 秒\n   3 点： 秒\n   4 点： 秒\n   5 点： 秒'),
    ('Finishing move that increases physical damage done by   Only useable while in Cat Form.  Lasts longer per combo point:\n   1 point  : 14 seconds\n   2 points: 19 seconds\n   3 points: 24 seconds\n   4 points: 29 seconds\n   5 points: 34 seconds', '终结技，使你造成的物理伤害提高 ，只能在猎豹形态下使用。持续时间随连击点数延长：\n   1 点：14 秒\n   2 点：19 秒\n   3 点：24 秒\n   4 点：29 秒\n   5 点：34 秒'),
    ('Finishing move that stuns the target.  Lasts longer per combo point:\n   1 point  : 1 second\n   2 points: 2 seconds\n   3 points: 3 seconds\n   4 points: 4 seconds\n   5 points: 5 seconds', '使目标昏迷的终结技。  连击点数越多持续时间越长：\n   1 点：1 秒\n   2 点：2 秒\n   3 点：3 秒\n   4 点：4 秒\n   5 点：5 秒'),
    ('Finishing move that stuns the target.  Lasts longer per combo point:\n   1 point  : 2 seconds\n   2 points: 3 seconds\n   3 points: 4 seconds\n   4 points: 5 seconds\n   5 points: 6 seconds', '使目标昏迷的终结技。  连击点数越多持续时间越长：\n   1 点：2 秒\n   2 点：3 秒\n   3 点：4 秒\n   4 点：5 秒\n   5 点：6 秒'),
    ('Fire a blast of unholy energy, causing  Shadow damage to an enemy target or healing  damage from a friendly Undead target  Refunds  runic power when used to heal.][.]', '射出一道邪恶能量，对敌方目标造成  点暗影伤害，或治疗友方亡灵目标  点伤害。  用于治疗时返还  点符文能量。][.]'),
    ('Fire a freezing arrow that places a Freezing Trap at the target location, freezing the first enemy that approaches, preventing all action for up to   Any damage caused will break the ice.  Trap will exist for   Only one trap can be active at a time.', '射出一支冰霜之箭，在目标位置放置一个冰冻陷阱，冻结第一个靠近的敌人，最多  内无法行动。任何伤害都会击破冰封。陷阱存在  。  同时只能激活一个陷阱。'),
    ('Fire and Fury!', '烈焰与狂怒！'),
    ('Fires several missiles, hitting  targets.', '发射数枚飞弹，命中目标。'),
    ('First responders have no problem getting their hands dirty.', '急救人员不怕把手弄脏。'),
    ('Fists ring with the weight of carved granite.', '拳头因承载花岗岩的重量而嗡鸣。'),
    ('Flasky essence captured from the mythical beast!', '从神话野兽身上捕获的瓶装精华！'),
    ('Fletched by Andy "The Macho Gnome" Savage.', '由「猛男地精」安迪·萨维奇所制。'),
    ('Flickering spirit essence, condensed from the unrest haunting the Valley of Trials.', '闪烁的灵魂精华，由困扰试炼谷的亡灵凝聚而成。'),
    ('Flight of Klaxxi', '卡拉希飞翔'),
    ('Flight of Kyrian Val\'kyr', '基瑞安瓦格里之飞'),
    ('Flight of the Fire Daemon', '火焰恶魔的飞行'),
    ('Flush out your system.', '清理你的身体。'),
    ('Focus your protective gaze on a group or raid target, reducing their damage taken by  and transfers  of the threat they cause to you.  In addition, each time they are hit by an attack your Taunt cooldown is refreshed.  Lasts   This effect can only be on one target at a time.', '将你的保护目光集中于一名小队或团队成员，使其受到的伤害降低  ，并其产生威胁值的  转移给你。此外，每当目标受到攻击时，你的嘲讽冷却即被刷新。持续   同一时间只能对一个目标施加此效果。'),
    ('Follow this easy 1-step guide and you\'ll instantly become a famous flexer!', '照着这份简易「一步」指南做，你立刻就能成为著名的炫技大师！'),
    ('Food and Water for the journey ahead.', '为前方旅程准备的食物与水。'),
    ('Food for the Mind', '心智之食'),
    ('For Military Use Only', '仅限军用'),
    ('For a time, Onyxia masqueraded as one of the highest officials in Stormwind.Ultimately, she was unmasked by Marshal Windsor with the help of Varian Wrynn, Broll Bearmantle, Valeera Sanguinar, and Thargas Anvilmar.', '有一段时间，奥妮克希亚伪装成暴风城最高级别的官员之一。最终，她被温莎元帅在瓦里安·乌瑞恩、布洛尔·熊鬃、瓦蕾拉·桑古纳尔与萨加斯·安维尔玛的协助下揭穿。'),
    ('For contribution to the scientific advancement of knowledge.', '为科学知识进步所作出的贡献。'),
    ('For delivery to Greta Mosshoof at Wildheart Point.', '送往野性之心哨站的格雷塔·苔蹄。'),
    ('For shootin\' Southshore citizens.', '用来射击南海镇的居民。'),
    ('For some reason you feel strangely proud of yourself while holding this.', '不知为何，拿着这东西时你莫名地对自己感到自豪。'),
    ('For the Silithid intolerant.', '异种虫不耐受者的福音。'),
    ('For the completion of many columns', '为完成众多专栏而设'),
    ('For those occasions when regular rum just won\'t do.', '适用于普通朗姆酒无法应付的场合。'),
    ('For those who wish to ditch the life of crime.', '给那些想脱离犯罪生涯的人。'),
    ('For use in mining operations, tree felling, and practical jokes.', '用于采矿作业、伐木，以及恶作剧。'),
    ('For use on squirrels only.', '仅限对松鼠使用。'),
    ('For when talking is no longer an option.', '当谈话不再是选项时。'),
    ('For when you need to explode a lock without exploding yourself or nearby objects.', '当你需要炸开一把锁，却又不想炸飞自己或周围的东西时。'),
    ('Forces all enemies within  yards to focus attacks on you for', '迫使  码内所有敌人集中攻击你，持续'),
    ('Forces all nearby enemies within  yards to focus attacks on you for', '迫使  码内附近所有敌人集中攻击你，持续'),
    ('Forces the target to speak in Demonic, increasing the casting time of all spells by   Only one Curse per Warlock can be active on any one target.  Lasts', '迫使目标以恶魔语说话，使其所有法术的施法时间延长   同一目标身上只能有一个术士的诅咒。  持续'),
    ('Foretold by Salzman.', '萨尔兹曼的预言。'),
    ('Forever Burning', '永恒燃烧'),
    ('Forever starved, forever cruel, this wretched skull whispered dark promises to lure mortals into its master\'s gaping jaws. Let its duplicitous whispers now fall silent', '永远饥饿，永远残忍，这颗可憎的头骨以黑暗的许诺引诱凡人走入它主人的巨口。让它的虚伪低语就此沉寂吧。'),
    ('Forged for T.S.', '为 T.S. 锻造'),
    ('Forged from Fel Energy', '以邪能锻造'),
    ('Forged from pure light.', '以纯净之光锻造。'),
    ('Forged from the scales of an ancient wyrm, this key opens the treasure chest sealed with dragonfire beside Abydion.', '以远古巨龙的鳞片锻造，这把钥匙能打开阿比迪翁旁被龙焰封印的宝箱。'),
    ('Forged in moonlight.', '于月光中锻造。'),
    ('Forged in the breath of Anachronos the Ancient.', '在远古阿纳克洛斯的气息中锻造而成。'),
    ('Forged in the heart of a dying star, this ethereal blade is feared across the cosmos.', '在一颗垂死恒星的核心锻造而成，这把空灵之刃令整个宇宙为之畏惧。'),
    ('Forged in...', '锻造于……'),
    ('Found deep in the Swamp of Sorrows.', '在悲伤沼泽深处找到。'),
    ('Found it in a half sunken bar, still sealed. Smells like wet wolf and regret. \n\nStrong enough to kill a plague rat or your conscience. Great gift for enemies, exes, or yourself.', '在一间半沉于水中的酒吧里发现，仍密封着。闻起来像湿狼与悔意。 \n\n足以毒死一只瘟疫鼠或你的良心。送敌人、前任或自己的绝佳礼物。'),
    ('Found sewn into a secret pocket.', '在一个暗袋里被缝着找到了。'),
    ('Found when mining in dangerous zones while in War Mode or High-Risk.', '在战争模式或高风险状态下于危险区域采矿时发现。'),
    ('Four pack.', '四包装。'),
    ('Frayed, crusted, and darkened with age.', '磨损、结壳、因岁月而发暗。'),
    ('Fresh from the farm.', '刚从农场送来。'),
    ('From Attumen the Huntsman!', '来自猎手阿图门！'),
    ('From Nesingwary himself. What an honor!', '来自奈辛瓦里本人。真是荣幸！'),
    ('From a quick glance, it seems like Lord Valesir has been working with an unnamed Syndicate leader planning to stage a coup, along with a group referred to as "Argus Wake".', '乍看之下，瓦勒希尔领主似乎正与一位未具名的辛迪加首领合作，策划一场政变，参与者还包括一个名为「阿古斯守夜」的组织。'),
    ('From the mountain springs of Alterac!', '来自奥特兰克的山间泉水！'),
    ('From those rough, brutish Durotar swine, hee hee! And gull eggs.', '取自那些粗野的杜隆塔尔猪，嘿嘿！还有海鸥蛋。'),
    ('Full of Tanaris Tea.', '满满一包塔纳利斯茶。'),
    ('Fully powered up with arcane energy.', '已充满奥术能量。'),
    ('Fun for your flying pet', '给你的飞行宠物找点乐子'),
    ('Fungal growth, nourished by the dark power that lies deep beneath the archipelago. As the Sleeper dreams within the stone\'s embrace, the breath of its mushrooms whispers sweet hallucinations.', '由群岛深处黑暗力量滋养的真菌。当沉眠者在石之怀抱中做梦时，它的蘑菇之息低语着甜美的幻觉。'),
    ('Funny.  Always seems to turn black around Remtravel.', '真有趣。在雷姆崔弗附近它总是会变黑。'),
    ('Fuzzy.', '毛茸茸的。'),
    ('Gain access to any Treasure Chest! Usually keeps more than half the content intact!', '获得任意宝箱的开启权！通常能保有一半以上的内容物！'),
    ('Gained by completing High-Risk daily quests. Used to transmute High-Risk Materials into higher qualities.', '通过完成高风险日常任务获得。用于将高风险材料转化为更高品质。'),
    ('Garrote the enemy, silencing them for  and causing  damage over d, increased by attack power.  Must be stealthed and behind the target.  Awards  combo int:points', '绞杀敌人，使其沉默 ，并在 d 内造成  点伤害，受攻击强度加成。  必须在潜行状态且位于目标背后。  获得  点连击 int:points'),
    ('Gather information about the target beast.  The tooltip will display damage, health, armor, any special resistances, and diet.  In addition, Beast Lore will reveal whether or not the creature is tameable and what abilities the tamed creature has.', '收集目标野兽的信息。提示信息将显示伤害、生命值、护甲、特殊抗性与食性。此外，野兽知识会揭示该生物是否可驯服，以及被驯服生物拥有的技能。'),
    ('Generates 1 rage per 3 seconds.', '每 3 秒产生 1 点怒气。'),
