    ('Gift of Medivh', '麦迪文的赠礼'),
    ('Gift of the Destroyer', '毁灭者的赠礼'),
    ('Gilded Agony Cage', '镀金苦难牢笼'),
    ('Gilded Crest of Torment', '镀金苦难徽记'),
