    ('Gilded Skull Crescent', '镀金骷髅月刃'),
    ('Give the command to kill, increasing your pet\'s damage done from special attacks by  for   Each special attack done by the pet reduces the damage bonus by 27s1%.', '下达杀戮指令，使你的宠物特殊攻击造成的伤害提高 ，持续   宠物每次特殊攻击都会使该伤害加成降低 27s1%。'),
    ('Give to a Stonetalon Prisoner so that they may regain their honor.', '交给石爪山俘虏，让他们重拾荣誉。'),
    ('Gives 120 Item Level If This Is Your Only Equipped Item. :)', '若这是你唯一装备的物品，将提供 120 点物品等级。 :)'),
    ('Gives a chance to parry enemy melee attacks and reduces all threat generated by 91s2%.', '有几率招架敌人的近战攻击，并使你产生的所有威胁值降低 91s2%。'),
    ('Gives a chance to parry enemy melee attacks.', '有几率招架敌人的近战攻击。'),
    ('Gives all members of the raid or group that share the same class with the target the Greater Blessing of Kings, increasing total stats by  for   Players may only have one Blessing on them per Paladin at any one time.', '为团队或小队中与目标同职业的所有成员施加王者祝福（强效），使其所有属性提高 ，持续   每名圣骑士同时只能给一个目标施加一种祝福。'),
    ('Gives all members of the raid or group that share the same class with the target the Greater Blessing of Sanctuary, reducing damage taken from all sources by  for  and increasing strength and stamina by   In addition, when the target blocks, parries, or dodges a melee attack the target will gain  of maximum displayed mana.  Players may only have one Blessing on them per Paladin at any one time.', '为团队或小队中与目标同职业的所有成员施加庇护祝福（强效），使其受到的所有来源伤害降低  ，持续  ，并使其力量与耐力提高  。此外，当目标格挡、招架或躲闪一次近战攻击时，将获得相当于其最大显示法力值  的法力。每名圣骑士同时只能给一个目标施加一种祝福。'),
    ('Gives off a heavenly aroma. Only usable in the Molten Front.', '散发着天堂般的香气。仅在熔火前线可用。'),
    ('Gives the Paladin\'s damaging attacks a chance to reduce the target\'s attack power by  for .', '使圣骑士的伤害性攻击有几率使目标的攻击强度降低 ，持续 。'),
    ('Gives the Paladin\'s damaging attacks a chance to reduce the target\'s attack power by  for 17d.', '使圣骑士的伤害性攻击有几率使目标的攻击强度降低 ，持续 17d。'),
    ('Gives you a  chance after blocking or being hit by any damaging attack that the next  weapon swings within  will generate an additional attack.', '使你在格挡或被任何伤害性攻击命中后，有  的几率使你随后  内的  次武器挥击额外产生一次攻击。'),
    ('Gives you a  chance to gain the Focused Casting effect that lasts for  after being the victim of a melee or ranged critical strike.  The Focused Casting effect reduces the pushback suffered from damaging attacks while casting Priest spells and decreases the duration of Interrupt effects by 28s2%.', '当你遭受近战或远程暴击后，有  的几率获得持续  的专注施法效果。该效果可减少施放牧师法术时因受到伤害而遭受的延迟，并使打断效果的持续时间缩短 28s2%。'),
    ('Gives you a  chance to gain the Focused Casting effect that lasts for  after being the victim of a melee or ranged critical strike.  The Focused Casting effect reduces the pushback suffered from damaging attacks while casting Priest spells and decreases the duration of Interrupt effects by 43s2%.', '当你遭受近战或远程暴击后，有  的几率获得持续  的专注施法效果。该效果可减少施放牧师法术时因受到伤害而遭受的延迟，并使打断效果的持续时间缩短 43s2%。'),
    ('Gives you a chance to generate an additional rage point when you deal melee damage with a weapon.', '使用武器造成近战伤害时，有几率额外产生 1 点怒气。'),
    ('Gives you a chance to generate an additional rage point when you deal melee damage with a weapon.  Effect occurs more often than Unbridled Wrath (Rank 1).', '使你在用武器造成近战伤害时有几率额外产生 1 点怒气。  触发频率高于无尽怒气（等级 1）。'),
    ('Gives you a chance to generate an additional rage point when you deal melee damage with a weapon.  Effect occurs more often than Unbridled Wrath (Rank 2).', '使你在用武器造成近战伤害时有几率额外产生 1 点怒气。  触发频率高于无尽怒气（等级 2）。'),
    ('Gives you a chance to generate an additional rage point when you deal melee damage with a weapon.  Effect occurs more often than Unbridled Wrath (Rank 3).', '使你在用武器造成近战伤害时有几率额外产生 1 点怒气。  触发频率高于无尽怒气（等级 3）。'),
    ('Gives you a chance to generate an additional rage point when you deal melee damage with a weapon.  Effect occurs more often than Unbridled Wrath (Rank 4).', '使你在用武器造成近战伤害时有几率额外产生 1 点怒气。  触发频率高于无尽怒气（等级 4）。'),
    ('Gives you access to your Guild Sized Bank with purchasable tabs.', '为你开启公会规模银行，栏位可购买。'),
    ('Gives you access to your Guild Sized Bank with purchaseable tabs. You can put soulbound items into bank.\n\nShares storage with other Personal Bank Items!\n\nSeason 9 bundle exclusive.', '使你获得可按格购买的公会规模银行。你可以将灵魂绑定的物品存入银行。\n\n与其他个人银行物品共享存储空间！\n\n第九赛季礼包专属。'),
    ('Gives you the power to purge and reset your Abilities', '赋予你净化并重置技能的力量'),
    ('Gives your Corruption and Drain Life spells a 2% chance to cause you to enter a Shadow Trance state after damaging the opponent.  The Shadow Trance state reduces the casting time of your next Shadow Bolt spell by 41s1%.', '使你的腐蚀术与吸取生命法术在对敌人造成伤害后有 2% 的几率使你进入暗影恍惚状态。  该状态使你下一个暗影箭法术的施法时间缩短 41s1%。'),
    ('Gives your Corruption and Drain Life spells a 4% chance to cause you to enter a Shadow Trance state after damaging the opponent.  The Shadow Trance state reduces the casting time of your next Shadow Bolt spell by 41s1%.', '使你的腐蚀术与吸取生命法术在对敌人造成伤害后有 4% 的几率使你进入暗影恍惚状态。  该状态使你下一个暗影箭法术的施法时间缩短 41s1%。'),
