    ('Granted to Shek\'zeer\'s elite guard for service to the Empress.', '授予谢克泽尔的精锐卫兵，以表彰其为女皇效劳。'),
    ('Grants 300 Skill Points to a Profession of your choice. *You will need to learn the profession as well*', '为你选择的专业提供 300 点技能点数。*你还需要先学会该专业*'),
    ('Grants 300 Skill Points to a Profession of your choice. You will need to learn the profession as well.', '为你选择的专业提供 300 点技能点数。你还需要先学会该专业。'),
