    ('Grants both the Warlock and the summoned demon an effect as long as that demon is active.\n\nImp - Increases your Fire damage by %, and increases the critical effect chance of your Fire spells by  - Reduces Physical damage taken by  - Increases your Shadow damage by %, and increases the critical effect chance of your Shadow spells by  - Reduces all spell damage taken by  - Increases all damage done by %, and reduces all damage taken by 04s2%.', '只要恶魔处于激活状态，术士与所召唤的恶魔都会获得一个效果。\n\n小鬼 - 使你的火焰伤害提高 %，并使火焰法术的暴击几率提高  虚空行者 - 使你受到的物理伤害降低  魅魔 - 使你的暗影伤害提高 %，并使暗影法术的暴击几率提高  地狱猎犬 - 使你受到的所有法术伤害降低  恶魔卫士 - 使你造成的所有伤害提高 %，并使受到的所有伤害降低 04s2%。'),
    ('Grants both the Warlock and the summoned demon an effect as long as that demon is active.\n\nImp - Increases your Fire damage by %, and increases the critical effect chance of your Fire spells by  - Reduces Physical damage taken by  - Increases your Shadow damage by %, and increases the critical effect chance of your Shadow spells by  - Reduces all spell damage taken by  - Increases all damage done by %, and reduces all damage taken by 05s2%.', '只要恶魔处于激活状态，术士与所召唤的恶魔都会获得一个效果。\n\n小鬼 - 使你的火焰伤害提高 %，并使火焰法术的暴击几率提高  虚空行者 - 使你受到的物理伤害降低  魅魔 - 使你的暗影伤害提高 %，并使暗影法术的暴击几率提高  地狱猎犬 - 使你受到的所有法术伤害降低  恶魔卫士 - 使你造成的所有伤害提高 %，并使受到的所有伤害降低 05s2%。'),
    ('Grants both the Warlock and the summoned demon an effect as long as that demon is active.\n\nImp - Increases your Fire damage by %, and increases the critical effect chance of your Fire spells by  - Reduces Physical damage taken by  - Increases your Shadow damage by %, and increases the critical effect chance of your Shadow spells by  - Reduces all spell damage taken by  - Increases all damage done by %, and reduces all damage taken by 06s2%.', '只要恶魔处于激活状态，术士与所召唤的恶魔都会获得一个效果。\n\n小鬼 - 使你的火焰伤害提高 %，并使火焰法术的暴击几率提高  虚空行者 - 使你受到的物理伤害降低  魅魔 - 使你的暗影伤害提高 %，并使暗影法术的暴击几率提高  地狱猎犬 - 使你受到的所有法术伤害降低  恶魔卫士 - 使你造成的所有伤害提高 %，并使受到的所有伤害降低 06s2%。'),
    ('Grants increased rewards as you get stronger gear rewards. Rewards gear up to the previous tier released.', '随着装备奖励变强，获得的奖励也会提升。奖励装备上限为上一已发布档次。'),
    ('Grants the Warlock\'s summoned demon Empowerment.\n\nImp - Increases the Imp\'s spell critical strike chance by  for  - Increases the Voidwalker\'s health by %, and its threat generated from spells and attacks by  for  - Instantly vanishes, causing the Succubus to go into an improved Invisibility state. The vanish effect removes all stuns, snares and movement impairing effects from the Succubus.\n\nFelhunter - Dispels all magical effects from the Felhunter.\n\nFelguard - Increases the Felguard\'s attack speed by  and breaks all stun, snare and movement impairing effects and makes your Felguard immune to them for 08d.', '赋予术士所召唤的恶魔强化效果。\n\n小鬼 - 使小鬼的法术暴击几率提高  ，持续  虚空行者 - 使虚空行者的生命值提高 %，其法术与攻击产生的威胁值提高  ，持续  魅魔 - 立即消失，使魅魔进入强化隐形状态。消失效果会清除魅魔身上的所有昏迷、定身与移动限制效果。\n\n地狱猎犬 - 驱散地狱猎犬身上的所有魔法效果。\n\n恶魔卫士 - 使恶魔卫士的攻击速度提高  ，并破除所有昏迷、定身与移动限制效果，使你的恶魔卫士在 08d 内免疫此类效果。'),
    ('Grants the most recent Prestigious Cache available.', '给予你当前可用的最新尊崇宝箱。'),
    ('Grants the periodic damage from your Corruption and Unstable Affliction spells the ability to critically hit for  increased damage, and increases the critical strike damage bonus of your Haunt spell by .', '使你的腐蚀术与痛苦无常的持续伤害可以造成暴击，暴击伤害提高 ，并使你的鬼影缠身法术的暴击伤害加成提高 。'),
    ('Grants the periodic damage from your Lacerate and Rip abilities the ability to critically hit.', '使你的裂伤与割裂技能造成的持续伤害能够造成爆击。'),
