    ('Includes Gyromatic Micro-Adjuster, Arclight Spanner, Flint and Tinder, Blacksmithing Hammer, Mining Pick, and a Skinning Knife.', '内含陀螺仪微调器、弧光扳手、燧石与火绒、铁匠锤、矿工锄和剥皮刀。'),
