    ('Increases all resistances by .5 per level and causes all spells you fully resist to restore  of your total mana.  1 sec cooldown.', '使所有抗性每级提高 0.5 点，并使你完全抵抗的所有法术为你恢复 点总法力。  冷却 1 秒。'),
