    ('Increases the damage done by your Seal and Judgement spells by %, and your Judgement spells increase your casting and melee haste by  for 57d.', '使你的圣印与审判法术造成的伤害提高 %，且你的审判法术会使你的施法与近战急速提高 ，持续 57d。'),
    ('Increases the damage of Curse of Agony, Corruption and Seed of Corruption by  and reduces the chance your helpful Affliction spells and damage over time effects will be dispelled by an additional .', '使痛苦诅咒、腐蚀术与腐蚀之种造成的伤害提高 ，并使你的有益痛苦系法术与持续伤害效果被驱散的几率额外降低 。'),
