    ('Increases the target\'s chance to critically hit with spells by   When the target critically hits the caster\'s chance to critically hit with spells is increased by  for   Cannot be cast on self.', '使目标法术暴击几率提高   当目标造成暴击时，施法者的法术暴击几率提高 ，持续   无法对自己施放。'),
    ('Increases the threat generated by your Holy spells by   Lasts', '使你的神圣法术产生的威胁值提高  ，持续'),
