    ('Increases your melee attack speed by   In addition your Rend and Deep Wounds abilities also increase all physical damage caused to that target by 70s1%.', '使你的近战攻击速度提高   此外，你的撕裂与重伤效果还会使目标受到的所有物理伤害提高 70s1%。'),
    ('Increases your movement speed by  in Cat Form and increases your chance to dodge while in Cat Form, Bear Form and Dire Bear Form by 64s1%.', '在豹形态下使你的移动速度提高 ，并使你在豹形态、熊形态和巨熊形态下的躲闪几率提高 64s1%。'),
    ('Increases your movement speed by  in Cat Form and increases your chance to dodge while in Cat Form, Bear Form and Dire Bear Form by 67s1%.', '在豹形态下使你的移动速度提高 ，并使你在豹形态、熊形态和巨熊形态下的躲闪几率提高 67s1%。'),
