    ('Increases your spell critical effect chance by %, and after taking a critical hit you gain the Focused Will effect, reducing all damage taken by  and increasing healing effects on you by   Stacks up to  times.  Lasts 41d.', '使你的法术暴击几率提高 %，且在受到暴击后获得专注意志效果，使受到的所有伤害降低 ，并提高你受到的治疗效果   最多叠加  次。  持续 41d。'),
    ('Increases your spell critical effect chance by %, and after taking a critical hit you gain the Focused Will effect, reducing all damage taken by  and increasing healing effects on you by   Stacks up to  times.  Lasts 42d.', '使你的法术暴击几率提高 %，且在受到暴击后获得专注意志效果，使受到的所有伤害降低 ，并提高你受到的治疗效果   最多叠加  次。  持续 42d。'),
    ('Increases your total Strength by  and the contribution your Ghouls get from your Strength and Stamina by', '使你的总力量提高 ，并使你的食尸鬼从你的力量与耐力中获得的加成提高'),
    ('Increases your total attack power by  and all physical damage caused to enemies you have poisoned is increased by 83s1%.', '使你的总攻击强度提高 ，并使你对已中毒敌人造成的所有物理伤害提高 83s1%。'),
    ('Increases your total attack power by  and all physical damage caused to enemies you have poisoned is increased by 84s1%.', '使你的总攻击强度提高 ，并使你对已中毒敌人造成的所有物理伤害提高 84s1%。'),
    ('Incredibly hard to remove.', '极难取下。'),
    ('Induces a friendly unit into a killing frenzy for   The target is Enraged, which increases their physical damage by %, but causes them to lose health equal to  of their maximum health every second.', '使一个友方单位陷入杀戮狂热，持续   目标进入激怒状态，其物理伤害提高 %，但每秒损失相当于其最大生命值  的生命值。'),
    ('Inflicts  Physical damage and pulls the target to the caster.', '造成  点物理伤害并将目标拉向施法者。'),
    ('Information on the Revantusk Tribe and strategic locations.', '关于复仇者部落与战略要点的情报。'),
    ('Infuses the death knight with unholy fury, increasing attack speed by %, movement speed by  and reducing the global cooldown on all abilities by  sec.  Only one Presence may be active at a time.', '以邪恶的暴怒灌注死亡骑士，使攻击速度提高 %，移动速度提高 ，并使所有技能的公共冷却时间缩短  秒。  同时只能激活一种领域。'),
    ('Infuses the target with power, increasing spell casting speed by  and reducing the mana cost of all spells by   Lasts', '为目标注入力量，使施法速度提高 并使所有法术的法力消耗降低  持续'),
    ('Ingredient in certain types of plant food.', '某些类型植物肥料的原料。'),
    ('Inlaid with pulsing troll runes.', '镶嵌着脉动的巨魔符文。'),
    ('Inscribed on the band: Ramaladni', '戒圈上刻着：拉玛拉德尼'),
    ('Inscribed with Jinyu runes that allow the user to understand the language of the waves.', '刻有锦鱼人符文，可让使用者听懂波浪的语言。'),
    ('Inside, you see a pair of clearly-unused safety goggles.', '里面能看到一副明显没用过的护目镜。'),
    ('Instantly Whirlwind up to  nearby targets and for the next  you will perform a whirlwind attack every  sec.  While under the effects of Bladestorm, you can move but cannot perform any other abilities but you do not feel pity or remorse or fear and you cannot be stopped unless killed.', '立即对至多  名附近目标发动旋风斩，并在接下来  内每  秒发动一次旋风斩攻击。在剑刃风暴效果期间，你可移动，但无法使用其它技能；你不会感到怜悯、悔恨或恐惧，除非被杀否则无法被阻止。'),
    ('Instantly attack the target causing  damage.  Can only be used within  after you kill an enemy that yields experience or honor.  Damage is based on your attack power.', '立即攻击目标，造成  点伤害。  只能在你击杀一个能提供经验或荣誉的敌人后  内使用。  伤害基于你的攻击强度。'),
    ('Instantly attack the target causing  damage.  In addition, the next  successful melee attacks will restore  of max health.  This effect lasts   Damage is based on your attack power.', '立即攻击目标，造成  点伤害。  此外，接下来的  次成功近战攻击会恢复最大生命值的   此效果持续   伤害基于你的攻击强度。'),
    ('Instantly attack with both weapons.  In addition, the next  sources of Nature damage dealt to the target from the Shaman are increased by  Lasts 64d.', '立即用双武器攻击。此外，萨满随后对目标造成的接下来  次自然伤害提高  持续 64d。'),
    ('Instantly blasts the target with a gust of wind, causing no damage but interrupting spellcasting and preventing any spell in that school from being cast for  Also lowers your threat, making the enemy less likely to attack you.', '以一阵狂风立即冲击目标，不造成伤害，但打断施法并阻止该系任何法术在  内施放。同时降低你的威胁值，使敌人更不愿攻击你。'),
    ('Instantly counterattack any enemy that strikes you in melee for   Melee attacks made from behind cannot be counterattacked.  A maximum of  attacks will cause retaliation.', '立即反击任何以近战攻击你的敌人，造成  点伤害。  来自背后的近战攻击无法被反击。  最多回击  次攻击。'),
    ('Instantly levels the user to Max Level! \n\nCannot be used in Challenges or Prestige leveling.', '立即将使用者提升至满级！ \n\n无法在挑战模式或转生升级中使用。'),
    ('Instantly overpower the enemy, causing weapon damage.  Only useable after the target dodges.  The Overpower cannot be blocked, dodged or parried.', '立即压制敌人，造成武器伤害。  仅在目标躲闪后可用。  压制无法被格挡、躲闪或招架。'),
    ('Instantly reduces a friendly target\'s threat by %, reduces all damage taken by  and increases resistance to Dispel mechanics by  for', '立即降低友方目标 % 的威胁值，使其受到的所有伤害降低 ，并使抗驱散机制的几率提高 ，持续'),
    ('Instantly removes all existing harmful spell effects and increases your chance to resist all spells by  for   Does not remove effects that prevent you from using Cloak of Shadows.', '立即移除所有现有的有害法术效果，并使你在  内的所有法术抗性几率提高   。  不会移除阻止你使用暗影斗篷的效果。'),
    ('Instantly strike the enemy, causing  weapon damage plus  for each disease effect on the target.', '瞬间击打敌人，造成 点武器伤害，目标身上每层疾病效果再额外造成 点伤害。'),
    ('Instantly throw both weapons at all targets within  yards, causing  weapon damage with daggers, and  weapon damage with all other weapons.', '立即向 码内的所有目标投掷双武器，使用匕首时造成  点武器伤害，使用其他武器时造成  点武器伤害。'),
    ('Intensely hot, you feel energy surge through you upon touching this pearl.', '热得烫人，你一碰到这颗珍珠就感到能量涌过全身。'),
    ('Invalid loot table, crashes when you modify Miscellaneous', '无效的战利品表，修改「杂项」时会崩溃'),
    ('Is that a beer stain?', '那是啤酒渍吗？'),
    ('Is that... blood?', '那是……血吗？'),
    ('It appears to be incredibly ordinary.', '它看起来极其普通。'),
    ('It bubbles and churns violently. Used in high-level profession crafts.', '它剧烈地冒泡翻腾。用于高级专业技能制作。'),
    ('It certainly looks scary to me.', '在我看来确实挺吓人。'),
    ('It changes color!', '它会变色！'),
    ('It costs approximately 4000 gold to fire this gun for twelve seconds. Truly the peak of Goblin Engineering', '这把枪开火十二秒大概要花 4000 金币。地精工程的巅峰莫过于此'),
    ('It doesn\'t seem like there\'s much in it, actually...', '实际上，里面似乎没多少东西……'),
    ('It doesn\'t smell bad, but it looks like it\'s going to taste awful.', '闻起来不难闻，但看起来会很难吃。'),
    ('It even has a beverage holder!', '它甚至还有杯架！'),
    ('It glows ever so slightly.', '它微微发光。'),
    ('It glows softly.', '它微微发光。'),
    ('It glows with an ephemeral energy.', '它散发着短暂易逝的能量。'),
    ('It has a FOUL smell.', '它散发着恶臭。'),
    ('It has everything!', '它应有尽有！'),
    ('It has the perfect hue to evoke violence and death. It requires much work, however, to be turned into usable ink.', '它的色泽恰好能唤起暴力与死亡。不过要把它变成可用的墨水还得费不少功夫。'),
    ('It has the power... to move you.', '它有着……感动你的力量。'),
    ('It has the texture of phlegm or mucus, it slips from the hands, and leaves a damp trail behind.', '质感像痰或黏液，从手中滑落，并在身后留下湿痕。'),
    ('It inexplicably shattered when you picked it up.', '你把它捡起来时，它莫名其妙地碎了。'),
    ('It is now somewhat safe to cross the streams.', '现在穿过溪流多少安全一些了。'),
    ('It is said that this contains the actual tears of his students.', '据说这里面装的是他学生们真实的眼泪。'),
    ('It keeps trying to climb back out of the bottle.', '它一直想爬回瓶子外面。'),
    ('It looks golden.', '它看起来是金色的。'),
    ('It looks like Gar\'gol periodically used this to clean his ears.', '看样子加戈尔时常拿它来掏耳朵。'),
