    ('It looks up at you with pleading eyes.', '它用哀求的眼睛抬头看着你。'),
    ('It probably isn\'t wise to drink an unknown potion, but with some research you might be able to learn more about it, and how to replicate it.', '喝下未知的药剂大概并不明智，但通过一些研究，你或许能更多地了解它，以及如何复制它。'),
    ('It pulses with airy luminosity.', '它散发着轻盈的光辉。'),
    ('It pulses with erratic energy', '它脉动着不稳定的能量'),
    ('It roils as though alive, and is still warm to the touch.', '它像活物一样翻涌，摸起来还温热。'),
    ('It seems Ren\'s fishing methods are strangely effective.', '看来雷恩的钓鱼法出奇地有效。'),
    ('It seems somehow able to magically refill itself.', '它似乎能以某种方式神奇地自行补满。'),
    ('It shifts and oozes as if still occupied by elementals.', '它不断变形渗流，仿佛仍被元素占据。'),
    ('It smells just as bad as it looks. Probably the fungus growing all over it.', '闻起来和看上去一样糟糕。大概是上面长的真菌。'),
    ('It sounds like something is moving in here.', '听起来里面有什么东西在动。'),
    ('It writhes and burbles madly, trying to escape.', '它疯狂地扭动翻腾，试图逃出去。'),
    ('It yet beats with foul demonic magic!', '它仍在以邪恶的恶魔魔法跳动！'),
    ('It\'s a likeness of Gallywix\'s late mother.  Bless her soul.', '这是加里维克斯已故母亲的画像。愿她安息。'),
    ('It\'s a little rubbery and somehow feels artificial.', '有点弹性，不知怎的还感觉像人造的。'),
    ('It\'s alive!', '它是活的！'),
    ('It\'s all that\'s left.', '就剩这些了。'),
    ('It\'s battered and broken. But then again, so are most murloc hovels.', '它破烂不堪。不过，大多数鱼人的棚屋也都是这样。'),
    ('It\'s been seriously stomped on.', '它被狠狠地踩过。'),
    ('It\'s best not to think about how Jin\'yu pearls are made.', '最好别去想金玉珍珠是怎么做出来的。'),
    ('It\'s clear that the owner of this medallion was a bitter enemy of the Horde.', '显然，这枚徽章的持有者是部落的死敌。'),
    ('It\'s definitely not half full.', '绝对不是半满。'),
    ('It\'s difficult to determine which is worse: The texture, or the smell.', '很难判断哪个更糟：质地，还是气味。'),
    ('It\'s doubtful Gul\'dan ever used this', '古尔丹恐怕从没用过这个'),
    ('It\'s freezing cold! You must resist the temptation to put your tongue on it.', '冻得刺骨的冷！你必须忍住把舌头贴上去的冲动。'),
    ('It\'s hard, like a rock.  Is this even an egg?', '硬得像块石头。这也能算蛋吗？'),
    ('It\'s hard..', '很难……'),
    ('It\'s heavy. And jingles.', '很重。而且叮当作响。'),
    ('It\'s just Zanzil\'s Mixture with some ice in it.  He could have at least TRIED to make it look appealing.', '不过是加了冰的赞吉尔的混合物。  他至少可以试着弄得好看一点。'),
    ('It\'s just about as heavy as it looks.', '差不多和看上去一样重。'),
    ('It\'s not immediately apparent why anybody would want this as a gift.', '一时看不出来谁会想要这个作礼物。'),
    ('It\'s not important where it came from. What\'s important is, it\'s meat - or passes for it, at least.', '它来自哪里并不重要。重要的是它是肉——至少勉强算是肉。'),
    ('It\'s not quite clear why there\'s a bone inside the meat...maybe it\'s better to use it as a weapon instead of eating it.', '不太清楚为什么肉里会有根骨头……也许把它当武器用比吃掉更好。'),
    ('It\'s not supreme but it\'s not bad either.', '不算顶级，但也不差。'),
    ('It\'s pretty heavy.', '挺重的。'),
