    ('Momentarily transforms the caster into a random iconic villain.', '暂时把施法者变成一位随机的标志性恶人。'),
    ('More Pew Pew, Less QQ', '少抱怨，多开枪'),
    ('Most of it has been ripped to shreds.', '大部分都被撕成碎片了。'),
    ('Most of the time, it works all of the time!', '大多数时候，它一直都很管用！'),
    ('Most people would consider this vulgar, however, troggs call it art.', '多数人会认为这很低俗，但穴居人称其为艺术。'),
    ('Much heavier than it looks.  This is a flower?', '比看起来重得多。这居然是朵花？'),
    ('Mud-crusted trinkets that have been buried for thousands of years.', '埋在水下数千年的泥壳小饰品。'),
    ('Must have snapped off the fishing line. Who fishes with diamonds, anyway?', '准是从鱼线上崩下来的。话说谁会拿钻石钓鱼？'),
    ('My horn is my power, my power is my strength, my strength is my horn, and my horn is my dick!', '我的角是我的力量，我的力量是我的力量，我的力量是我的角，而我的角是我的命根子！'),
    ('Mystic Runes are used at Mystic Enchanting Altars to Reforge Mystic Scrolls into new Enchants. This earns experience towards Mystic Extracts, allowing you to save Enchants to your Collection permanently.\n\nAltars are often found summoned in Capital Cities and can be found out in the world. Their locations are marked as POIs on the world map.', '神秘符文用于神秘附魔祭坛，可将神秘卷轴重铸为新的附魔。此过程会为神秘萃取物累积经验，让你能永久将附魔保存进收藏。\n\n祭坛常被召唤于主城，也可在世界各处找到。它们的位置会作为兴趣点标注在世界地图上。'),
    ('NOT FOR SELF-USE', '不可自用'),
    ('NOTE: Not Guaranteed to Contain an Actual Mount', '注意：不保证内含真正的坐骑'),
    ('Napal\'s detailed technique for having a Dream Vision', '纳帕尔获得梦境视象的详细技巧'),
    ('Nearly as complicated to operate as it is to make.', '操作起来几乎和制作它一样复杂。'),
    ('Nearly too hot to touch.', '烫得几乎不能碰。'),
    ('Nerglish for Dummies', '鱼人语入门'),
    ('Never look up when there are flying mounts above you.', '头顶有飞行坐骑时，千万别抬头。'),
    ('Never stand in the shadow of dragons.', '永远不要站在巨龙的阴影里。'),
    ('Never trust a troll. Or a rogue. Especially a troll rogue.', '永远别信巨魔。也别信盗贼。尤其是巨魔盗贼。'),
    ('Never trust an honest goblin or a sober dwarf.', '永远别信诚实的地精，也别信清醒的矮人。'),
    ('New & Improved Kaja\'Cola Zero-One! Half the Calories, Twice the IDEAS! (TM).', '全新升级的卡亚可乐零号！一半卡路里，两倍灵感！（TM）'),
    ('New and improved design!', '全新改良设计！'),
    ('No matter how many times you try, nothing will ever change.', '无论你尝试多少次，什么都不会改变。'),
    ('No matter what you think you are, your heroism will only bring more despair.', '无论你怎么看自己，你的英雄气概只会带来更多绝望。'),
    ('No money, no problems.', '没钱就没烦恼。'),
    ('No really, I said healer.', '说真的，我说的是治疗者。'),
    ('No smoke here.', '这里没有烟。'),
    ('No. Just... no!', '不。绝对……不行！'),
    ('Non-perishables retrieved from the ocean floor.', '从海底打捞上来的不易腐坏的物资。'),
    ('Not a scratch on it.', '毫发无损。'),
    ('Not as bad as it sounds.', '没有听起来那么糟。'),
    ('Not at all', '一点也不'),
    ('Not consumed when used.', '使用后不会消耗。'),
    ('Not fit for human consumption.  Robot consumption is also questionable.  You should not consume robots.', '不适合人类食用。  机器人食用也有疑问。  你不该食用机器人。'),
    ('Not likely to play nicely with the other items in your bags.', '它大概没法和你包里的其他东西好好相处。'),
    ('Not quite as fancy or frilly as an actual Alliance kit may be.', '没真正的联盟套装那么花哨华丽。'),
    ('Not quite sure where this came from, but it has big energy.', '不太确定它是从哪来的，但它气势十足。'),
    ('Not so evil anymore.', '不再那么邪恶了。'),
    ('Not sure how he expects to make bomb\'s with this junk.', '不知道他打算怎么用这堆破烂做炸弹。'),
    ('Not to be confused with Spiny...', '别和尖刺弄混了……'),
    ('Not very filling.', '不太顶饱。'),
    ('Not very safe.', '不太安全。'),
    ('Not what you were expecting.', '不是你所期待的东西。'),
    ('Not worth as much now as they used to be...', '如今已经没以前那么值钱了……'),
    ('Note: For the safety of small children,cannon does not actually fire.', '注意：为儿童安全起见，火炮并不会真的发射。'),
    ('Nothing comes without a cost, no matter how good it may seem.', '没有什么是不要代价的，无论它看起来多好。'),
    ('Now accurate to 15 yards!', '现在精准到 15 码！'),
    ('Now is the time to try something new. Perhaps a new tradeskill.', '该尝试点新东西了。也许学一门新手艺。'),
    ('Now we\'re talking real money.', '这才叫真金白银。'),
    ('Now with twice the worms!', '现在虫子加倍！'),
    ('Nukes have all been used now.', '核弹已经用光了。'),
    ('Observations on wildlife and local resources.', '关于当地野生动物与资源的观察记录。'),
