    ('Obtained from Manastorm Levels: 511 to 535\nContains: \n+ Mythic Blackwing Lair Gear\n+ Normal Ruins of AQ Gear\nChance to contain: \n+ Mythic 11-20 Dungeon Gear', '从法力风暴等级 511 至 535 获得：\n包含：\n+ Mythic Blackwing Lair Gear\n+ Normal Ruins of AQ Gear\n有几率包含：\n+ Mythic 11-20 Dungeon Gear'),
