    ('Obtained from completing Endgame Manastorms from |cffFFFFFFlevel 466 to level 496.|r\n\n|cFFffffffContains:|r \n\n+ Normal Tier 5 Gear\n\n|cFFffffffChance to contain:|r \n\n+ Heroic Tier 5 Gear\n+ Mythic1-10 Dungeon Gear', '完成终局法力风暴获得，等级 466 至 496：\n\n|cFFffffffContains:|r \n\n+ 普通五级套装装备\n\n|cFFffffffChance to contain:|r \n\n+ 英雄五级套装装备\n+ Mythic1-10 Dungeon Gear'),
