    ('Obtained from completing Endgame Manastorms from |cffFFFFFFlevel 50 to level 106.|r\n\n|cFFffffffContains:|r|r\n\n+ Normal Dungeon Gear\n+ Heroic Dungeon Gear', '完成终局法力风暴获得，等级 50 至 106：\n\n|cFFffffffContains:|r|r\n\n+ 普通地牢装备\n+ 英雄地牢装备'),
    ('Obtained from completing Endgame Manastorms from |cffFFFFFFlevel 526 to level 556.|r\n\n|cFFffffffContains:|r \n\n+ Heroic Tier 5 Gear\n\n|cFFffffffChance to contain:|r\n\n+ Mythic Tier 5 Gear\n+ Mythic11-20 Dungeon Gear', '完成终局法力风暴获得，等级 526 至 556：\n\n|cFFffffffContains:|r \n\n+ 英雄五级套装装备\n\n|cFFffffffChance to contain:|r\n\n+ 神话五级套装装备\n+ Mythic11-20 Dungeon Gear'),
    ('Obtained from completing Endgame Manastorms from |cffFFFFFFlevel 556 to level 586.|r\n\n|cFFffffffContains:|r \n\n+ Heroic Tier 5 Gear\n\n|cFFffffffChance to contain:|r\n\n+ Mythic Tier 5 Gear\n+ Normal Zul\'Aman Gear\n+ Mythic11-20 Dungeon Gear', '完成终局法力风暴获得，等级 556 至 586：\n\n|cFFffffffContains:|r \n\n+ 英雄五级套装装备\n\n|cFFffffffChance to contain:|r\n\n+ 神话五级套装装备\n+ Normal Zul\'Aman Gear\n+ Mythic11-20 Dungeon Gear'),
    ('Obtained from completing Endgame Manastorms from |cffFFFFFFlevel 586 to level 616.|r\n\n|cFFffffffContains:|r \n\n+ Heroic Tier 5 Gear\n\n|cFFffffffChance to contain:|r\n\n+ Mythic Tier 5 Gear\n+ Heroic Zul\'Aman Gear\n+ Mythic11-20 Dungeon Gear', '完成终局法力风暴获得，等级 586 至 616：\n\n|cFFffffffContains:|r \n\n+ 英雄五级套装装备\n\n|cFFffffffChance to contain:|r\n\n+ 神话五级套装装备\n+ Heroic Zul\'Aman Gear\n+ Mythic11-20 Dungeon Gear'),
    ('Obtained from completing Endgame Manastorms from |cffFFFFFFlevel 616 to level 646.|r\n\n|cFFffffffContains:|r \n\n+ Mythic Tier 5 Gear\n\n|cFFffffffChance to contain:|r\n\n+ Mythic Zul\'Aman Gear\n+ Mythic11-20 Dungeon Gear', '完成终局法力风暴获得，等级 616 至 646：\n\n|cFFffffffContains:|r \n\n+ 神话五级套装装备\n\n|cFFffffffChance to contain:|r\n\n+ Mythic Zul\'Aman Gear\n+ Mythic11-20 Dungeon Gear'),
    ('Obtained from completing Endgame Manastorms from |cffFFFFFFlevel 646 to level 676.|r\n\n|cFFffffffContains:|r \n\n+ Mythic Tier 5 Gear\n\n|cFFffffffChance to contain:|r\n\n+ Normal Mount Hyjal Gear\n+ Mythic Zul\'Aman Gear\n+ Mythic11-20 Dungeon Gear', '完成终局法力风暴获得，等级 646 至 676：\n\n|cFFffffffContains:|r \n\n+ 神话五级套装装备\n\n|cFFffffffChance to contain:|r\n\n+ Normal Mount Hyjal Gear\n+ Mythic Zul\'Aman Gear\n+ Mythic11-20 Dungeon Gear'),
    ('Obtained from completing Endgame Manastorms from |cffFFFFFFlevel 676 to level 706.|r\n\n|cFFffffffContains:|r \n\n+ Normal Mount Hyjal Gear\n\n|cFFffffffChance to contain:|r \n\n+ Heroic Mount Hyjal Gear\n+ Normal Black Temple Gear\n+ Mythic11-20 Dungeon Gear', '完成终局法力风暴获得，等级 676 至 706：\n\n|cFFffffffContains:|r \n\n+ Normal Mount Hyjal Gear\n\n|cFFffffffChance to contain:|r \n\n+ Heroic Mount Hyjal Gear\n+ Normal Black Temple Gear\n+ Mythic11-20 Dungeon Gear'),
    ('Obtained from completing Endgame Manastorms from |cffFFFFFFlevel 706 to level 736.|r\n\n|cFFffffffContains:|r \n\n+ Normal Mount Hyjal Gear\n\n|cFFffffffChance to contain:|r \n\n+ Heroic Mount Hyjal Gear\n+ Mythic Zul\'Aman Gear\n+ Mythic11-20 Dungeon Gear', '完成终局法力风暴获得，等级 706 至 736：\n\n|cFFffffffContains:|r \n\n+ Normal Mount Hyjal Gear\n\n|cFFffffffChance to contain:|r \n\n+ Heroic Mount Hyjal Gear\n+ Mythic Zul\'Aman Gear\n+ Mythic11-20 Dungeon Gear'),
    ('Obtained from completing Endgame Manastorms from |cffFFFFFFlevel 736 to level 766.|r\n\n|cFFffffffContains:|r \n\n+ Normal Black Temple or Mount Hyjal Gear\n\n|cFFffffffChance to contain:|r \n\n+ Heroic Mount Hyjal Gear\n+ Heroic Black Temple Gear\n+ Mythic21-30Dungeon Gear', '完成终局法力风暴获得，等级 736 至 766：\n\n|cFFffffffContains:|r \n\n+ Normal Black Temple or Mount Hyjal Gear\n\n|cFFffffffChance to contain:|r \n\n+ Heroic Mount Hyjal Gear\n+ Heroic Black Temple Gear\n+ Mythic21-30Dungeon Gear'),
    ('Obtained from completing Endgame Manastorms from |cffFFFFFFlevel 766 to level 796.|r\n\n|cFFffffffContains:|r \n\n+ Normal Black Temple or Mount Hyjal Gear\n\n|cFFffffffChance to contain:|r \n\n+ Normal Sunwell Plateau\n+ Heroic Black Temple or Mount Hyjal Gear\n+ Mythic31-40 Dungeon Gear', '完成终局法力风暴获得，等级 766 至 796：\n\n|cFFffffffContains:|r \n\n+ Normal Black Temple or Mount Hyjal Gear\n\n|cFFffffffChance to contain:|r \n\n+ Normal Sunwell Plateau\n+ Heroic Black Temple or Mount Hyjal Gear\n+ Mythic31-40 Dungeon Gear'),
    ('Obtained from completing Endgame Manastorms from |cffFFFFFFlevel 796 to level 826.|r\n\n|cFFffffffContains:|r \n\n+ Heroic Black Temple or Mount Hyjal Gear\n\n\n|cFFffffffChance to contain:|r \n\n+ Heroic Sunwell Plateau\n+ Mythic31-40 Dungeon Gear', '完成终局法力风暴获得，等级 796 至 826：\n\n|cFFffffffContains:|r \n\n+ Heroic Black Temple or Mount Hyjal Gear\n\n\n|cFFffffffChance to contain:|r \n\n+ Heroic Sunwell Plateau\n+ Mythic31-40 Dungeon Gear'),
    ('Obtained from completing Endgame Manastorms from |cffFFFFFFlevel 826 to level 876.|r\n\n|cFFffffffContains:|r \n\n+ Heroic Black Temple or Mount Hyjal Gear\n\n|cFFffffffChance to contain:|r \n\n+ Mythic Mount Hyjal Gear\n+ Heroic Sunwell Gear\n+ Mythic31-40 Dungeon Gear', '完成终局法力风暴获得，等级 826 至 876：\n\n|cFFffffffContains:|r \n\n+ Heroic Black Temple or Mount Hyjal Gear\n\n|cFFffffffChance to contain:|r \n\n+ Mythic Mount Hyjal Gear\n+ Heroic Sunwell Gear\n+ Mythic31-40 Dungeon Gear'),
    ('Obtained from completing Endgame Manastorms from |cffFFFFFFlevel 876 to level 926.|r\n\n|cFFffffffContains:|r \n\n+ Heroic Black Temple or Mount Hyjal Gear\n\n|cFFffffffChance to contain:|r \n\n+ Heroic Sunwell Plateau Gear\n+ Mythic Mount Hyjal Gear\n+ Mythic Black Temple Gear\n+ Mythic31-40 Dungeon Gear', '完成终局法力风暴获得，等级 876 至 926：\n\n|cFFffffffContains:|r \n\n+ Heroic Black Temple or Mount Hyjal Gear\n\n|cFFffffffChance to contain:|r \n\n+ Heroic Sunwell Plateau Gear\n+ Mythic Mount Hyjal Gear\n+ Mythic Black Temple Gear\n+ Mythic31-40 Dungeon Gear'),
    ('Obtained from completing Endgame Manastorms from |cffFFFFFFlevel 926 onwards.|r\n\n|cFFffffffContains:|r \n\n+ Heroic Black Temple or Mount Hyjal Gear\n\n|cFFffffffChance to contain:|r \n\n+ Mythic Sunwell Plateau\n+ Mythic Mount Hyjal Gear\n+ Mythic Black Temple Gear\n+ Mythic31-40 Dungeon Gear', '由完成 |cffFFFFFF926 级及以上|r 的终局法力风暴获得。\n\n|cFFffffff包含：|r \n\n+ 英雄黑暗神殿或海加尔山装备\n\n|cFFffffff有几率包含：|r \n\n+ 神话太阳之井高地\n+ 神话海加尔山装备\n+ 神话黑暗神殿装备\n+ 神话 31-40 地牢装备'),
    ('Obtained from the Arena Frenzy Event. \n\nSeems to regenerate every time you take a bite. Upon close inspection, it is very clearly not a cooked fish.', '从竞技场狂乱事件中获得。 \n\n每咬一口似乎都会再生。仔细看去，这明显不是一条烤熟的鱼。'),
    ('Obtained from the Arena Frenzy Event. \n\nThe dark green substance inside almost looks alive. Drinking from it seems to make it replenish.', '从竞技场狂乱事件中获得。 \n\n里面深绿色的物质几乎像是活的。似乎喝下去之后它就会自行补充。'),
    ('Obtained through conquering Azeroth\'s fiercest creatures.', '通过征服艾泽拉斯最凶猛的生物获得。'),
    ('Odd warlocks notwithstanding, this doesn\'t seem like something you\'d want to touch for too long.', '除了某些古怪的术士，这东西似乎并不适合长时间握在手里。'),
    ('Of COURSE it\'s venison, sweetling. What ELSE would it be?!', '这当然是鹿肉，亲爱的。还能是什么呢？！'),
    ('Offering of consanguinity. A dark intelligence has taken root within this stone, having come from the other side of the sea. The children of the Black Goat of the Dark Wood numbered in the thousands. Those who escaped their mother\'s miserable hunger were eventually sealed away in the deepest depths.', '血缘的供品。某种黑暗的智慧已在这块石头中扎根，它来自大海彼岸。黑暗森林的黑山羊的子嗣数以千计。那些逃过母亲凄惨饥饿的存在，最终被封印在最深的深处。'),
    ('Oh so valuable and you feel smarter already!', '如此珍贵，你已经觉得自己更聪明了！'),
    ('Oily and coarse. This doesn\'t feel at all like normal rope.', '油腻粗糙。这手感完全不像普通的绳子。'),
    ('Oily, volatile, and ever so smelly.', '油腻、易挥发，还特别难闻。'),
    ('Old.  Very old.', '古老。非常古老。'),
    ('On the inside collar it reads, \'Inspected by Earl Z. Moade.\'', '内侧领口写着：「检验员 厄尔·Z·莫德」。'),
    ('On the label, a lowercase text catches your eye: \'Workbeast assumes no responsibility for any potential side effects experienced by the undead, reanimated, zombies, or any being that has undergone near-death experiences. Caution is advised for individuals with a history of resurrection or abnormal regeneration.\'', '标签上，一行小字映入眼帘：「工作兽对亡灵、复生者、僵尸或任何经历过濒死体验的存在可能出现的副作用概不负责。有复活史或异常再生史者请谨慎使用。」'),
    ('Once awakened, the spirit will seek to bind itself to the tools of war.', '一旦苏醒，这个精灵会寻求与战争工具结合。'),
    ('Once beaten, twice shy', '一朝被咬，十年怕井绳'),
    ('Once belonged to Crafty.', '曾属于克拉夫提。'),
    ('Once owned by the Mayor of Darkshire.', '曾是夜色镇镇长的所有物。'),
    ('Once popular amongst the ancient Highborne, this exotic berry now only grows in Azshara.', '这种奇异浆果曾流行于上古上层精灵之间，如今只在艾萨拉生长。'),
    ('One final invention...', '最后一项发明……'),
    ('One for the road.', '再来一杯上路。'),
    ('One is enough if it\'s big', '够大一个就够'),
    ('One of Stromgarde\'s relics overseen by the Caretakers, a mace enchanted to safely incapacitate weakened foes.', '激流堡的遗迹之一，由看护者看管，一把经过附魔、可安全制服虚弱敌人的锤子。'),
    ('One of the few things the draenei were able to take with them on their flight from Argus.', '德莱尼人逃离阿古斯时，能带走的少数物品之一。'),
    ('One who promises to go on a blind date is bound on pickup.', '答应去相亲的人，就该被绑定拾取。'),
    ('Only a true champion can weild this weapon.', '只有真正的勇士才能挥动这件武器。'),
    ('Only jewelcrafting trainers native to Pandaria know how to cut this unusual gem.', '只有潘达利亚本地的珠宝加工训练师才知道如何切割这种奇特的宝石。'),
    ('Only rewarded to top-ranking champions of the Brawler\'s Guild.', '只授予格斗家公会中排名最高的冠军。'),
    ('Only seems to fit on two of your fingers... inconvenient.', '似乎只能套上你的两根手指……真不方便。'),
    ('Only the Firman family can be accepted by this great power', '只有菲尔曼家族的人才能被这股伟大力量接纳'),
    ('Only the dead could possibly drink this.', '只有死人才喝得下去。'),
    ('Only used once!', '只用过一次！'),
    ('Ooh, that\'s sharp!', '哦，好锋利！'),
    ('Ook ook', '呜克呜克'),
    ('Opaque, with swirls of dark color.', '不透明，带着深色的漩涡。'),
    ('Open it! Open It!', '打开它！快打开！'),
    ('Open the Lucky Box and get a random reward from the Azzar Faire!', '打开幸运盒，从阿扎尔集市获得随机奖励！'),
    ('Open the bottle.', '打开瓶子。'),
    ('Opening this will give you Scrolls of Fortune: Talents for your current Specialization. These allow you to unlearn talents.\n\nYou can obtain scrolls from The Manastorm, Quests, Dungeons, Raids, Callboard Caches, Battlegrounds, High-Risk Open-World, and a Questchain on Silas Darkmoon in Capitals using Marks of Ascension.\n\n|cFFCC0000THIS ITEM IS DESTROYED UPON PRESTIGE|r', '打开后可获得与你当前专精相符的「命运卷轴：天赋」。它们可用于遗忘天赋。\n\n卷轴可从法力风暴、任务、地牢、突袭、告示板宝箱、战场、高风险开放世界，以及主城塞拉斯·暗月处用飞升印记兑换的任务链中获得。\n\n|cFFCC0000此物品在转生时会被摧毁|r'),
    ('Opens Demon Bound Hidden Caches in Tier 3 zones.', '打开 3 阶区域的恶魔束缚隐藏宝箱。'),
    ('Opens a gate which the Death Knight can use to return to Ebon Hold.', '开启一道死亡骑士可用来返回黑锋要塞的传送门。'),
    ('Orders signed by General Hawthorne, labeled \'Burn this.\'', '霍桑将军签署的命令，标注着「烧掉此件」。'),
    ('Orendil\'s potion now glows with the power of the moonlight.', '奥伦迪尔的药剂此刻泛着月光之力。'),
    ('Osteowings of the Necrolords', '通灵领主的骨翼'),
    ('Ouch!', '哎哟！'),
    ('Ouch! Hot potato, hot potato!', '哎哟！烫手山芋，烫手山芋！'),
    ('Ouch, ouch! Hot potato!', '哎哟哎哟！烫手山芋！'),
    ('Owned by someone who never gave up hope.', '曾属于一个从未放弃希望的人。'),
    ('Pages of elegantly-inked arcane script, complete with carefully-penned diagrams.', '数页以优雅墨迹书写的奥术文字，并附有仔细绘制的图表。'),
    ('Painbringer\'s Back-Prison', '苦难使者的背狱'),
    ('Pants included.', '含裤子。'),
    ('Party over here!', '这边开派对！'),
    ('Passed down from generation to generation.', '一代又一代传下来的。'),
    ('Passed down through several generations.', '传承了好几代人。'),
    ('Passed down through untold generations of Cho\'s forebears.', '经周氏祖先无数代相传。'),
    ('Perfect for bouncing off tables.', '非常适合从桌上弹开。'),
    ('Perfect for grinding down into a Shiny Bauble.', '正适合磨成一颗闪亮小饰物。'),
    ('Perfect for wrestling red pandas of any inebriation level.', '无论红熊猫醉成什么样，都适合用来摔跤。'),
    ('Perfectly balanced.', '平衡完美。'),
    ('Perfectly clear and cool to the touch.', '完全清澈，摸起来冰凉。'),
    ('Perfectly smooth and icy cold to the touch.', '触感光滑无比，且冰凉刺骨。'),
    ('Perfectly smooth but for hundreds of tiny runes, somehow unblemished despite its age.', '表面完美光滑，却刻有数百个微小符文；历经岁月竟毫无瑕疵。'),
    ('Perfectly tenderized.', '处理得恰到好处。'),
    ('Performs a feint, causing no damage but lowering your threat by a large amount, making the enemy less likely to attack you.  In addition, reduces the damage you take from area of effect attacks by  for', '佯攻一次，不造成伤害，但大幅降低你的威胁值，使敌人更不愿攻击你。  此外，使你在  内受到的群体伤害降低'),
    ('Performs a feint, causing no damage but lowering your threat by a medium amount, making the enemy less likely to attack you.', '进行一次佯攻，不造成伤害，但会中量降低你的威胁值，使敌人不太可能攻击你。'),
    ('Performs a feint, causing no damage but lowering your threat by a small amount, making the enemy less likely to attack you.', '进行一次佯攻，不造成伤害，但会少量降低你的威胁值，使敌人不太可能攻击你。'),
    ('Performs an instant off-hand weapon attack that automatically applies the poison from your off-hand weapon to the target.  Slower weapons require more Energy.  Neither Shiv nor the poison it applies can be a critical strike.  Awards 1 combo point.', '发动一次瞬发的副手武器攻击，自动将副手武器上的毒药施加于目标。武器速度越慢，所需能量越多。毒刃本身及其施加的毒药均无法造成暴击。产生 1 个连击点。'),
    ('Perhaps some scholar would be interested in this.', '也许某位学者会对此感兴趣。'),
    ('Perhaps these can be mended back into a Scroll of Fortune.', '也许还能把它们修补回一张幸运卷轴。'),
    ('Permanently enchants a cloak to increase Intellect by 180.  Requires a level 372 or higher item.', '永久为一件披风附魔，使智力提高 180。  需要物品等级 372 或以上。'),
    ('Permanently enchants a cloak to increase Stamina by 200.  Requires a level 372 or higher item.', '永久为一件披风附魔，使耐力提高 200。  需要物品等级 372 或以上。'),
    ('Permanently enchants a cloak to increase critical strike by 180.  Requires a level 372 or higher item.', '永久为一件披风附魔，使爆击提高 180。  需要物品等级 372 或以上。'),
    ('Permanently enchants a cloak to increase hit by 180.  Requires a level 372 or higher item.', '永久为一件披风附魔，使命中提高 180。  需要物品等级 372 或以上。'),
    ('Permanently enchants a pair of boots to increase haste by 175.  Requires a level 372 or higher item.', '永久为一双靴子附魔，使急速提高 175。  需要物品等级 372 或以上。'),
    ('Permanently enchants a pair of boots to increase hit by 175.  Requires a level 372 or higher item.', '永久为一双靴子附魔，使命中提高 175。  需要物品等级 372 或以上。'),
    ('Permanently enchants a pair of boots to increase movement speed slightly and Agility by 140.  Requires a level 372 or higher item.', '永久为一双靴子附魔，略微提高移动速度并使敏捷提高 140。  需要物品等级 372 或以上。'),
    ('Permanently enchants a pair of boots to increase movement speed slightly and mastery by 140.  Requires a level 372 or higher item.', '永久为一双靴子附魔，略微提高移动速度并使精通提高 140。  需要物品等级 372 或以上。'),
    ('Permanently enchants a shield or off-hand item to increase Intellect by 165.  Requires a level 372 or higher item.', '永久为一面盾牌或副手物品附魔，使智力提高 165。  需要物品等级 372 或以上。'),
    ('Permanently enchants bracers to increase dodge by 170.  Requires a level 372 or higher item.', '永久为一件护腕附魔，使闪避提高 170。  需要物品等级 372 或以上。'),
    ('Permanently enchants bracers to increase mastery by 170.  Requires a level 372 or higher item.', '永久为一件护腕附魔，使精通提高 170。  需要物品等级 372 或以上。'),
    ('Permanently enchants chest armor to increase PvP resilience by 200.  Requires a level 372 or higher item.', '永久为一件胸甲附魔，使 PvP 韧性提高 200。  需要物品等级 372 或以上。'),
    ('Permanently enchants chest armor to increase Spirit by 200.  Requires a level 372 or higher item.', '永久为一件胸甲附魔，使精神提高 200。  需要物品等级 372 或以上。'),
