    ('Pilfered from the Eye of Eternity, but seemingly inert.', '从永恒之眼偷来，但似乎已失去活性。'),
    ('Pilfered information on the Kor\'kron\'s brutal techniques.', '偷来的关于库卡隆残暴战法的情报。'),
