    ('Piping hot and spicy!', '滚烫香辣！'),
    ('Pitted and encrusted with barnacles, but it might still work...', '坑坑洼洼结满藤壶，但也许还能用……'),
    ('Pixie Dust Wings', '仙尘之翼'),
    ('Place a Guild Banner that allows any player to interact with and join your guild. Only usable as Guild Master or Officer.', '放置一面公会旗帜，任何玩家都可与之互动并加入你的公会。仅限会长或官员使用。'),
    ('Place a Mark of Blood on an enemy.  Whenever the marked enemy deals damage to a target, that target is healed for  of its maximum health.  Lasts for  or up to  hits.', '在敌人身上施加血之印记。  每当被标记的敌人对某个目标造成伤害，该目标就会恢复其最大生命值的  点生命。  持续 或最多  次命中。'),
    ('Place a barricade.', '放置一处路障。'),
    ('Place a frost trap that creates an ice slick around itself for  when the first enemy approaches it.  All enemies within  yards will be slowed by  while in the area of effect.  Trap will exist for   Only one trap can be active at a time.', '放置一个冰霜陷阱，在第一个敌人靠近时于陷阱周围形成一片冰面，持续  。区域内所有敌人减速 ，陷阱存在 。  同时只能激活一个陷阱。'),
    ('Place a trap that will release several venomous snakes to attack the first enemy to approach.  The snakes will die after   Trap will exist for   Only one trap can be active at a time.', '放置一个陷阱，释放数条毒蛇攻击第一个靠近的敌人。  毒蛇会在  后死亡  陷阱将存在   同时只能激活一个陷阱。'),
    ('Place down an Ebon Blade Banner.  Range is $r yards.', '放置一面黑锋骑士团旗帜。范围为 $r 码。'),
    ('Placeholder: A crumpled dispatch marked with a ruby seal.', '占位：一份带红宝石封蜡的皱巴巴急件。'),
    ('Places a Blessing on the friendly target, increasing total stats by  for   Players may only have one Blessing on them per Paladin at any one time.', '为友方目标施加祝福，使其所有属性提高 ，持续 。  每名圣骑士同时只能给一个目标施加一种祝福。'),
    ('Places a Blessing on the friendly target, reducing damage taken from all sources by  for  and increasing strength and stamina by   In addition, when the target blocks, parries, or dodges a melee attack the target will gain  of maximum displayed mana.  Players may only have one Blessing on them per Paladin at any one time.', '为友方目标施加祝福，使其受到的所有来源伤害降低  ，持续  ，并使其力量与耐力提高  。此外，当目标格挡、招架或躲闪一次近战攻击时，将获得相当于其最大显示法力值  的法力。每名圣骑士同时只能给一个目标施加一种祝福。'),
    ('Places a Hand on the friendly target, granting immunity to movement impairing effects for   Players may only have one Hand on them per Paladin at any one time.', '为友方目标施加圣手，使其免疫移动限制效果，持续 。  每名圣骑士同时只能给一个目标施加一种圣手。'),
    ('Places a Hand on the party or raid member, reducing their total threat by  every  sec. for   Players may only have one Hand on them per Paladin at any one time.', '为小队或团队成员施加圣手，每  秒使其总威胁值降低 ，持续 。  每名圣骑士同时只能给一个目标施加一种圣手。'),
    ('Places a Hand on the party or raid member, transfering  damage taken to the caster.  Lasts  or until the caster has transfered  of their maximum health.  Players may only have one Hand on them per Paladin at any one time.', '为小队或团队成员施加圣手，将  点所受伤害转移给施法者。  持续 ，或直到施法者已转移其最大生命值的   每名圣骑士同时只能给一个目标施加一种圣手。'),
    ('Places a large, stationary Anti-Magic Zone that reduces spell damage done to party or raid members inside it by   The Anti-Magic Zone lasts for  or until it absorbs  spell damage.', '放置一个大型的固定反魔法区域，使其中小队或团队成员受到的法术伤害降低   反魔法区域持续 ，或直到它吸收  点法术伤害为止。'),
    ('Plaguethrower\'s Backpack (Green)', '瘟疫喷射者的背包（绿色）'),
    ('Plaguethrower\'s Backpack (Purple)', '瘟疫喷射者的背包（紫色）'),
    ('Plant a Gladiator Pepe flag on your position.', '在你所在位置插上一面角斗士佩佩旗帜。'),
    ('Plant a Laughing Pepe flag on your position.', '在你所在位置插上一面大笑佩佩旗帜。'),
    ('Plant a PepeGM on your position.', '在你的位置放置一个 PepeGM。'),
    ('Plant your banner and represent your allegiance to the Argent Crusade!', '插起你的旗帜，表明你对银色北伐军的忠诚！'),
    ('Plant your banner and represent your allegiance to the Argent Dawn!', '插起你的旗帜，表明你对银色黎明的忠诚！'),
    ('Plant your banner for all to see how much you have sacrificed!  "I will feast on your soul!"', '插下你的旗帜，让所有人看到你付出了多少牺牲！  “我将以你的灵魂为食！”'),
    ('Plant your banner for all to see how much you have sacrificed!  "What have you given?"', '插下你的旗帜，让所有人看到你付出了多少牺牲！  “你献出了什么？”'),
    ('Plant your banner for all to see the power of Fel!  "FUEL FOR THE FEL!"', '插起你的旗帜，让所有人看到邪能之力！「为邪能而燃！」'),
    ('Plant your banner for all to see the power of Fel!  "Your soul will serve me well!"', '插下你的旗帜，让所有人见识邪能的力量！  “你的灵魂将为我所用！”'),
    ('Plant your banner for all to see!', '插起你的旗帜让所有人看见！'),
    ('Plant your banner for all to see!  "Ghosted!"', '插起你的旗帜让大家看看！「被幽灵了！」'),
