    ('Point, Shoot, Destroy', '瞄准、射击、摧毁'),
    ('Possession of this key grants access to The Eye (Tempest Keep) in Netherstorm', '持有此钥匙即可进入虚空风暴的「眼」（风暴要塞）。'),
    ('Possession of this medallion grants access to Blackwing Lair.', '持有此徽章即可进入黑翼之巢。'),
    ('Possession of this medallion grants access to Serpentshrine Cavern', '持有此徽章即可进入毒蛇神殿'),
    ('Possession of this medallion grants access to the Battle for Mount Hyjal.', '持有此徽章即可进入海加尔山之战。'),
    ('Possession of this medallion grants access to the Molten Core.', '持有此徽章即可进入熔火之心。'),
    ('Possibly the finest toolbox ever made, embellished with gold inlay.', '大概是有史以来最好的工具箱，还镶着金饰。'),
    ('Powdery, yet sticky at the same time.', '粉状，却又黏手。'),
    ('Power infuses the target increasing their Stamina by  for', '能量注入目标，使其耐力提高  ，持续'),
    ('Power radiates from this crystal.  It contains a captured power from the aether.  Perhaps you can find a way to forge it into your gear?', '能量自这枚水晶中散发出来。  它封存着来自以太的力量。  也许你能找到办法将它锻入你的装备？'),
    ('Prayer of the Dusk', '黄昏祈祷'),
    ('Prestige Tokens are obtained by allowing Chromie to wind back time resetting you to level 1. \n\nThese tokens can be used to buy unique cosmetics from Chromie.', '声望币可通过让克罗米倒转时间、将你重置为 1 级来获得。 \n\n这些声望币可在克罗米处购买独特的幻化物品。'),
    ('Presumably used for making loin cloths.', '大概是用来做缠腰布的。'),
    ('Pretty good, if you\'re into eating.', '如果你喜欢吃东西，那还不错。'),
    ('Pretty intense.', '相当激烈。'),
    ('Prevents the gum disease scurvy.', '预防牙龈病坏血病。'),
    ('Printed in red ink.', '用红墨水印成。'),
    ('Probably best not to hold it for too long.', '最好别握太久。'),
    ('Probably stolen from an adventurer.', '多半是从某个冒险者那里偷来的。'),
    ('Proof of valor in quelling the forces of evil on Azeroth.', '在艾泽拉斯平息邪恶势力之勇气的证明。'),
    ('Property of Quel\'Danil Lodge', '奎尔达尼尔小屋的财产'),
    ('Protects the paladin from all damage and spells for d, but reduces all damage you deal by   Once protected, the target cannot be targeted by Divine Shield, Divine Protection, or Hand of Protection again for   Cannot be used within  of using Avenging Wrath.', 'd 内保护圣骑士免受所有伤害与法术影响，但你造成的所有伤害降低   一旦受到保护，目标在  内无法再次成为圣盾术、保护之手或圣佑术的目标。在与复仇之怒使用间隔  内无法使用。'),
    ('Pulsing with an intense heat...', '散发着强烈的热量……'),
    ('Pulsing with immense power.', '脉动着巨大的力量。'),
    ('Pulsing with life and energy, shards sharpened to a piercing tip.', '搏动着生命与能量，碎片被磨成锋利的尖端。'),
    ('Pulsing with the fel powers of the Burning Legion, gazing into its depths threatens to unhinge even the soundest mind.', '脉动着燃烧军团的邪能力量，凝视其深处足以让最坚定的心智崩坏。'),
    ('Pummel the target, interrupting spellcasting and preventing any spell in that school from being cast for', '猛击目标，打断施法，并使该系法术在接下来一段时间内无法施放，持续'),
    ('Pungent.', '气味刺鼻。'),
    ('Purges the earth around the Death Knight of all heat.  Enemies within  yards are trapped in ice, preventing them from performing any action for  and infecting them with Frost Fever.  Enemies are considered Frozen, but any damage other than diseases will break the ice.', '抽走死亡骑士周围大地的所有热量。  码内的敌人被冰封，  内无法采取任何行动，并感染冰霜疫病。敌人被视为冰冻状态，但除疾病以外的任何伤害都会击破冰封。'),
    ('Purifies the friendly target, removing  disease effect and  poison effect.', '净化友方目标，移除  个疾病效果与  个中毒效果。'),
    ('Put on a Tiki Troll Mask! Reward for completing the trial Hardcore - Trollbane.', '戴上一顶提基巨魔面具！完成硬核「巨魔克星」试炼的奖励。'),
    ('Puts the enemy target in a state of meditation, incapacitating them for up to d, and removing the effect of Righteous Vengeance.  Any damage caused will awaken the target.  Usable against Demons, Dragonkin, Giants, Humanoids and Undead.', '使敌方目标进入冥想状态，最多 d 内无法行动，并驱散其正义复仇效果。任何伤害都会使目标醒来。可对恶魔、龙类、巨人、类人生物与亡灵使用。'),
    ('Qiang the Merciless was a master tactician and strategist.  A random quote from the Warlord King\'s treatise reads, "Bones multiply as they are crushed."', '无情者强是一位战术与战略大师。  军阀之王的论著中有一句随机引文写道：「骨骼被碾碎时会不断增殖。」'),
    ('Quotation marks are legally binding in Ratchet. Dug up a lot of value with this one, metaphorically speaking. \n\nGreat for unearthing secrets, unmarked graves, or competitive gardening.', '在棘齿城，引号具有法律效力。从这一个里挖出了不少价值——比喻意义上的。 \n\n很适合挖掘秘密、无名坟墓，或竞争性园艺。'),
    ('Radiant armor piece, stripped from a fanatic of the mysterious sect. Still leaks radioactive fumes, which their creed claims to be the source of enlightenment and radiant clarity.', '一件光亮的护甲，从某个神秘教派的狂热者身上剥下。它仍在渗出放射性气体，该教派声称这才是启蒙与光耀澄明的源头。'),
    ('Radiate with the vivid brilliance of the rainbow\'s palette for 20 seconds. Has a 1 minute cooldown.', '绽放彩虹调色板般的绚丽光芒，持续 20 秒。冷却时间 1 分钟。'),
    ('Radiates heat that increases with the wearer\'s anger. Has been known to melt lesser jewelry and occasionally fingers.', '散发的热量随佩戴者的愤怒而增强。据说曾熔化过次等首饰，偶尔也熔过手指。'),
    ('Rainbows of light seem to dance off of the flawless crystal.', '彩虹般的光芒似乎在无瑕水晶上起舞。'),
    ('Raise your hand.  You\'ve just won a poster!', '举起手来。你刚赢了一张海报！'),
    ('Raise your hand.  You\'ve just won an Absolutely Kickin\' Rad Poster!', '举起手来。你刚赢了一张绝对酷毙的海报！'),
    ('Raise your hand.  You\'ve just won an NVIDIA PNY XLR8 GeForce GTX 275!', '举起手来。你刚赢得了一张 NVIDIA PNY XLR8 GeForce GTX 275！'),
    ('Raise your shield, reflecting the next spell cast on you.  Lasts', '举起你的盾牌，反射下一个对你施放的法术。持续'),
    ('Raises a Ghoul to fight by your side.  If no humanoid corpse that yields experience or honor is available, you must supply Corpse Dust to complete the spell.  You can have a maximum of one Ghoul at a time.  Lasts 85d.', '召唤一只食尸鬼与你并肩作战。  若没有能提供经验或荣誉的类人生物尸体，你必须提供尸尘才能完成法术。  同时最多只能拥有一只食尸鬼。  持续 85d。'),
    ('Raises the corpse of a raid or party member to fight by your side.  The player will have control over the Ghoul for 19d.', '唤起一名团队或小队成员的尸体为你作战。  该玩家将控制这只食尸鬼，持续 19d。'),
    ('Rare, imported, and probably dipped in something mystical. They say a Pandaren artist once painted an entire sunset with this and then ate it. \n\nWorks for painting, poking, or impressing strangers.', '稀有、进口，大概还浸过什么神秘的东西。据说有位潘达利亚艺术家曾用它画下整片晚霞，然后把画吃了。 \n\n可用于作画、戳人，或给陌生人留个深刻印象。'),
    ('Rare.', '稀有。'),
    ('Rarely found when milling herbs native to Pandaria.', '研磨潘达利亚原生草药时罕见发现。'),
    ('Rarely obtained when milling Cinderbloom, Stormvine, Azshara\'s Veil, Heartblossom, Twilight Jasmine, and Whiptail.', '在对烬花、风暴藤、艾萨拉之眼、心之花、暮光茉莉与鞭尾草进行研磨时稀有获得。'),
    ('Raw Elementium pieces. Very valuable. Covered in spider excretions.', '源质原矿碎片。非常值钱。还沾满了蜘蛛的排泄物。'),
    ('Razor-sharp and covered with ash from the flames that killed its owner.', '锋利如剃刀，覆满了烧死它主人的火焰余烬。'),
    ('Reading this book will permanently increase your skill in Fishing by 50, up to a max of 600.', '阅读此书将永久提高你 50 点钓鱼技能，最高可达 600。'),
    ('Reading this tome could ..', '阅读这本典籍可能会……'),
    ('Ready for delivery to Northwatch Hold.', '准备送往北望要塞。'),
    ('Really satisfies.', '真的很满足。'),
    ('Recent news from Fort Triumph, including word of your lastest victories in the Battlescar.', '来自凯旋堡垒的最新消息，包括你在战痕战场的最新胜利。'),
    ('Records of Highvale supplies and Alliance contacts.', '关于高地谷补给与联盟联络人的记录。'),
