    ('Right click to choose your preferred elemental!', '右键选择你偏好的元素！'),
    ('Right click to permanently unlock an additional Build Card to pick from when starting Build Draft. \n\nYou can unlock up to 16 card slots in Build Draft.\n\nUnlocks for all characters on this realm.\n\nImportant: Make sure to use this before Role Selection in Build Draft for the best results.', '右键点击可永久解锁一张额外的构筑卡牌，供开始构筑轮抽时选择。\n\n你可以解锁最多 16 个构筑轮抽卡槽。\n\n解锁对所有本服务器角色生效。\n\n重要提示：请务必在构筑轮抽的角色选择之前使用，以获得最佳效果。'),
    ('Right click to summon The MIGHTY Millhouse!', '右键召唤强大的米尔豪斯！'),
    ('Right-click to browse and purchase a vanity class bundle!', '右键浏览并购买外观职业礼包！'),
    ('Right-click to browse and purchase heirloom weapons!', '右键浏览并购买传家宝武器！'),
    ('Right-click to open and reveal its contents.', '右键打开并揭示其中的物品。'),
    ('Rimmed with an ever-shifting ring of clouds.', '边缘环绕着不断变幻的云环。'),
    ('Ripped from the smile of a crocolisk.', '从鳄鱼的笑容上撕下来的。'),
    ('Ripped off of the armor of a dead Kirin Tor agent.  The Sunreavers will reward you for this.', '从一名已死肯瑞托密探的护甲上撕下。  夺日者会为此奖励你。'),
    ('Ripped off of the armor of a dead Sunreaver agent.  The Kirin Tor will reward you for this.', '从一名已死夺日者密探的护甲上撕下。  肯瑞托会为此奖励你。'),
    ('Rips your soul from your body and fuses it into one of the soulshells found in the Karazhan Crypts. This process is not permanent, nor will it grant you access to the power that armor holds.', '将你的灵魂从肉体中剥离，并融入卡拉赞地下墓穴中的一枚灵魂壳。此过程并非永久，也不会赐予你该护甲所拥有的力量。'),
    ('Rough to the touch, but oddly warm.', '摸起来粗糙，却奇异地温暖。'),
    ('Ruby Blades of the Beast', '野兽的红宝石之刃'),
    ('Rumbling with the power of Earth', '随着大地的力量轰鸣'),
    ('Run at high speed towards a party member, intercepting the next melee or ranged attack made against them as well as reducing their total threat by 67s1%.', '高速冲向一名小队成员，拦截下一次针对其的近战或远程攻击，并使其总威胁值降低 67s1%。'),
    ('Run them through the One-Time Decryption Engines.', '把它们过一遍一次性解密引擎。'),
    ('Runes shimmer and dance along the teeth of this ancient key.', '符文在这把古老钥匙的齿上闪烁舞动。'),
