    ('Sacrifices an undead minion, healing the Death Knight for  of s:her', '献祭一个亡灵仆从，为死亡骑士恢复其  点'),
    ('Sadness', '悲伤'),
    ('Said to be the craftiest fish in Orgrimmar, it appears he was outsmarted at last.', '据说他是奥格瑞玛最狡猾的鱼，看来终究还是被人算计了。'),
    ('Sanguine Band of Accuria', '阿库里亚的血色指环'),
    ('Sanguine Cauterizing Band', '血色灼烙指环'),
    ('Sanguine Choker of the Fire Lord', '火焰之王的血色项圈'),
    ('Sanguine Quick Strike Ring', '血色迅击指环'),
    ('Sanguine Ring of Spell Power', '血色法术能量指环'),
    ('Sanguine Talisman of Ephemeral Power', '瞬逝之力血色护符'),
    ('Sapped of its natural strength and resilience by the Sha presence, only a skilled leatherworker can hope to recover this unusable hide.', '受煞之影响，这块皮已失去原有的韧性与强度；只有熟练的制皮师才有望从这块无法使用的皮中提取可用之物。'),
    ('Satisfaction guaranteed. Durability not included', '满意保证。不保证耐久。'),
