    ('Seems to always be black', '似乎总是黑的'),
    ('Seems to be an attempt at writing a novel. Many lines are crossed out and rewritten,  and the later half of the pages is simply blank.', '似乎是在尝试写一部小说。许多行被划掉重写，后半页则完全是空白。'),
    ('Seems to have just been a collector\'s item, but this might be the best connection to the Emerald Dream you\'ll find in a town of mages.', '看来只是件收藏品，但在法师之城，这或许是你与翡翠梦境最紧密的联系。'),
    ('Seems unfair.', '似乎不太公平。'),
    ('Seems... magical.', '似乎……有魔力。'),
    ('Seething darkness engulfs the eye.', '翻涌的黑暗吞没了眼睛。'),
    ('Seething with dark energies.', '翻涌着黑暗能量。'),
    ('Selfless Sigil of the Archon', '执政官的无私印记'),
    ('Selfless Wings of the Ascended', '升格者的无私之翼'),
    ('Send your pet into a rage causing  additional damage for   While enraged, the beast does not feel pity or remorse or fear and it cannot be stopped unless killed.', '使你的宠物陷入狂暴，在  内造成  点额外伤害。  狂暴期间，野兽不会感到怜悯、悔意或恐惧，除非被杀否则无法阻止。'),
    ('Sends a wave of force in front of the warrior, causing  damage (based on attack power) and stunning all enemy targets within  yards in a frontal cone for', '向战士前方释放一道力量波，造成  点伤害（基于攻击强度），并使 码内前方锥形范围内的所有敌对目标昏迷，持续'),
    ('Servant of Neptulon', '耐普图隆的仆从'),
    ('Several dazzling gems hide inside....', '里面藏着好几颗耀眼的宝石……'),
    ('Several gash marks indicate that the grunt did not part with it willingly.', '几处深深的砍痕说明这名步兵并不是自愿交出它的。'),
    ('Several small diamonds, strung together with gold filigree.', '几颗小钻石，用金丝串在一起。'),
    ('Sha-Infused Bladewings', '煞能注入的刃翼'),
    ('Sha-Infused Feather of A\'lar', '灌注煞能的艾拉之羽'),
    ('Shackles the target with frozen chains, reducing their movement by %, and infects them with Frost Fever.  The target regains  of their movement each second for', '用冰封锁链束缚目标，使其移动速度降低 %，并使其感染冰霜热疫。  目标每秒恢复其  的移动能力，持续'),
    ('Shadehunter\'s Crescent', '暗影猎手的月刃'),
    ('Shadows shift and swirl within the fabric of this dark satchel.', '阴影在这只黑挎包的织物里游移翻涌。'),
    ('Shake your Muffinmaker!', '摇晃你的松饼机！'),
    ('Shakes the ground with thundering force, doing  Nature damage to all enemies within  yards.  This ability causes a moderate amount of additional threat.', '以雷霆之力震荡大地，对 码内所有敌人造成  点自然伤害。  此技能会产生中等量的额外威胁值。'),
    ('Shaped like a thorn-backed boar.', '形状像一头棘背野猪。'),
    ('Shapeshift into Moonkin Form.  While in this form the armor contribution from items is increased by %, damage taken while stunned is reduced by %, and all party and raid members within  yards have their spell critical chance increased by   Single target spell critical strikes in this form have a chance to instantly regenerate  of your total mana.  The Moonkin can not cast healing or resurrection spells while shapeshifted.\n\nThe act of shapeshifting frees the caster of Polymorph and Movement Impairing effects.', '变形为枭兽形态。此形态下，物品提供的护甲值提高 %，昏迷期间受到的伤害降低 %， 码内所有小队与团队成员的法术暴击几率提高  。此形态下单体法术暴击有几率立即为你恢复总法力值的  。枭兽形态下无法施放治疗或复活法术。\n\n变形行为会解除施法者身上的变形与移动限制效果。'),
    ('Shapeshift into aquatic form, increasing swim speed by  and allowing the druid to breathe underwater.  Also protects the caster from Polymorph effects.\n\nThe act of shapeshifting frees the caster of Polymorph and Movement Impairing effects.', '变形为水生形态，游泳速度提高 ，并允许德鲁伊在水下呼吸。同时使施法者免疫变形效果。\n\n变形行为会解除施法者身上的变形与移动限制效果。'),
    ('Shapeshift into bear form, increasing melee attack power by 3, armor contribution from cloth and leather items by %, and Stamina by   Also protects the caster from Polymorph effects and allows the use of various bear abilities.\n\nThe act of shapeshifting frees the caster of Polymorph and Movement Impairing effects.', '变形为熊形态，近战攻击强度提高 3 点，布甲与皮甲提供的护甲值提高 %，耐力提高  。同时使施法者免疫变形效果，并可使用多种熊形态技能。\n\n变形行为会解除施法者身上的变形与移动限制效果。'),
    ('Shapeshift into cat form, increasing melee attack power by  plus Agility.  Also protects the caster from Polymorph effects and allows the use of various cat abilities.\n\nThe act of shapeshifting frees the caster of Polymorph and Movement Impairing effects.', '变形为猎豹形态，近战攻击强度提高  点，并额外加上敏捷属性。同时使施法者免疫变形效果，并可使用多种猎豹形态技能。\n\n变形行为会解除施法者身上的变形与移动限制效果。'),
    ('Shapeshift into dire bear form, increasing melee attack power by 3, armor contribution from cloth and leather items by %, and Stamina by   Also protects the caster from Polymorph effects and allows the use of various bear abilities.\n\nThe act of shapeshifting frees the caster of Polymorph and Movement Impairing effects.', '变形为巨熊形态，近战攻击强度提高 3 点，布甲与皮甲提供的护甲值提高 %，耐力提高  。同时使施法者免疫变形效果，并可使用多种熊形态技能。\n\n变形行为会解除施法者身上的变形与移动限制效果。'),
    ('Shapeshift into flight form, increasing movement speed by  and allowing you to fly.  Cannot use in combat.  Can only use this form in Outland or Northrend.\n\nThe act of shapeshifting frees the caster of Polymorph and Movement Impairing effects.', '变形为飞行形态，移动速度提高 ，并允许你飞行。无法在战斗中使用。仅可在外域或诺森德使用此形态。\n\n变形行为会解除施法者身上的变形与移动限制效果。'),
    ('Shapeshift into travel form, increasing movement speed by   Also protects the caster from Polymorph effects.  Only useable outdoors.\n\nThe act of shapeshifting frees the caster of Polymorph and Movement Impairing effects.', '变形为旅行形态，使移动速度提高   并使施法者免疫变形效果。  仅可在户外使用。\n\n变形行为会解除施法者身上的变形与移动限制效果。'),
    ('Shapeshifts into a Faerie Dragon, reducing magic damage taken.', '变形为精灵龙，降低受到的魔法伤害。'),
    ('Sharp enough to effectively poke things.', '够锋利，能有效地戳东西。'),
    ('Shifts your spirit into the Spectral Realm for 60 seconds.', '将你的灵魂转入幽灵领域 60 秒。'),
    ('Shokia\'s language, particularly in describing the Hozen, leaves little to be desired.', '绍基亚的语言，尤其在描述猴人的时候，可谓妙不可言。'),
    ('Shoots pebbles.', '发射小石子。'),
    ('Short prayers from a dozen different faiths are contained in this book.', '这本书中收录了来自十几种不同信仰的简短祷文。'),
    ('Show your support for the current brawl contender!', '展示你对当前斗殴挑战者的支持！'),
    ('Showing everyone else what it\'s like to be a gnome for more than 50 years.', '让大家都体验一下当侏儒超过 50 年是什么感觉。'),
    ('Shows the location of all nearby beasts on the minimap.  Only one form of tracking can be active at a time.', '在小地图上显示附近所有野兽的位置。同一时间只能追踪一种类型。'),
    ('Shows the location of all nearby demons on the minimap until cancelled.  Only one form of tracking can be active at a time.', '在小地图上显示附近所有恶魔的位置，直到取消。  同一时间只能激活一种追踪方式。'),
    ('Shows the location of all nearby demons on the minimap.  Only one form of tracking can be active at a time.', '在小地图上显示附近所有恶魔的位置。同一时间只能追踪一种类型。'),
    ('Shows the location of all nearby dragonkin on the minimap.  Only one form of tracking can be active at a time.', '在小地图上显示附近所有龙类的位置。同一时间只能追踪一种类型。'),
    ('Shows the location of all nearby elementals on the minimap.  Only one form of tracking can be active at a time.', '在小地图上显示附近所有元素生物的位置。同一时间只能追踪一种类型。'),
    ('Shows the location of all nearby giants on the minimap.  Only one form of tracking can be active at a time.', '在小地图上显示附近所有巨人的位置。同一时间只能追踪一种类型。'),
    ('Shows the location of all nearby humanoids on the minimap.  Only one form of tracking can be active at a time.', '在小地图上显示附近所有人形生物的位置。同一时间只能追踪一种类型。'),
    ('Shows the location of all nearby humanoids on the minimap.  Only one type of thing can be tracked at a time.', '在小地图上显示附近所有人形生物的位置。同一时间只能追踪一种类型。'),
    ('Shows the location of all nearby undead on the minimap until cancelled.   Only one form of tracking can be active at a time.', '在小地图上显示附近所有亡灵的位置，直到取消。  同一时间只能激活一种追踪方式。'),
    ('Shows the location of all nearby undead on the minimap.  Only one form of tracking can be active at a time.', '在小地图上显示附近所有亡灵的位置。同一时间只能追踪一种类型。'),
    ('Shred the target, causing  damage plus 144 to the target.  Must be behind the target.  Awards  combo int:points', '撕碎目标，造成 点伤害外加 144 点伤害。  必须位于目标背后。  获得 个连击 int:点'),
    ('Shred the target, causing  damage plus 236 to the target.  Must be behind the target.  Awards  combo int:points', '撕碎目标，造成 点伤害外加 236 点伤害。  必须位于目标背后。  获得 个连击 int:点'),
    ('Shred the target, causing  damage plus 54 to the target.  Must be behind the target.  Awards  combo int:points', '撕碎目标，造成 点伤害外加 54 点伤害。  必须位于目标背后。  获得 个连击 int:点'),
    ('Shred the target, causing  damage plus 72 to the target.  Must be behind the target.  Awards  combo int:points', '撕碎目标，造成 点伤害外加 72 点伤害。  必须位于目标背后。  获得 个连击 int:点'),
    ('Shred the target, causing  damage plus 99 to the target.  Must be behind the target.  Awards  combo int:points', '撕碎目标，造成 点伤害外加 99 点伤害。  必须位于目标背后。  获得 个连击 int:点'),
    ('Sifting through your packs.', '翻检你的背包。'),
    ('Signed by Darkmaster Gandling himself.', '由黑暗院长加丁亲笔签名。'),
    ('Silences the target, preventing them from casting spells for   Non-player victim spellcasting is also interrupted for 47d.', '使目标沉默，使其无法施放法术，持续  非玩家受害者的施法也会被打断，持续 47d。'),
    ('Silken shoulders imbued with flowing water magic.', '注入了流水魔法的丝质护肩。'),
    ('Simply looking at the core instills you with a feeling of complete serenity.', '光是凝视这枚核心，就让你感到完全的宁静。'),
    ('Simultaneously places up to 4 totems specified in the Totem Bar.', '同时放置图腾栏中指定的最多 4 个图腾。'),
    ('Simultaneously places up to 4 totems specified in the Totem Bar. Can call different totems than Call of the Elements or Call of the Ancestors.', '同时放置图腾栏中指定的最多 4 根图腾。可召唤与元素召唤或先祖召唤不同的图腾。'),
    ('Simultaneously places up to 4 totems specified in the Totem Bar. Can call different totems than Call of the Elements.', '同时放置图腾栏中最多 4 个指定图腾。可召唤与元素召唤不同的图腾。'),
    ('Sin\'Dorei Compass', '辛多雷罗盘'),
    ('Slap an egg between two slap rocks, BAM, you got breakfast. Slap a muffin in there, POW, you got a waffle.', '把鸡蛋拍在两块拍石之间，砰，早餐有了。再拍个松饼进去，啪，华夫饼也有了。'),
    ('Slick, green and sickly.', '滑腻、发绿、病态。'),
    ('Slightly crispy. Utterly useless.', '有点脆。完全没用。'),
    ('Slightly gnawed on, but still good!', '被啃过一点，但还是好的！'),
    ('Slightly wet with what you hope is ocean water and not Hozen drool.', '有点湿，你希望那是海水而不是猢狲的口水。'),
    ('Sloshing with liquid joy.', '晃荡着液态的欢乐。'),
    ('Slows friendly party or raid target\'s falling speed for', '使友方小队或团队成员的下落速度降低，持续'),
    ('Small engraving on the side implies this belonged to Okuno, the member of Ashtongue.', '侧面刻有的小字表明它曾属于灰舌氏族的成员奥库诺。'),
    ('Small pile of gold coins...', '一小堆金币……'),
    ('Smash the target\'s mind with cold, interrupting spellcasting and preventing any spell in that school from being cast for', '以彻骨寒意猛击目标心灵，打断施法，并使该系法术在接下来一段时间内无法施放，持续'),
    ('Smells dangerously good.', '闻起来好得危险。'),
    ('Smells funny.', '气味古怪。'),
    ('Smells interesting...', '味道很有意思……'),
    ('Smells like death and chicken. Mostly death.', '闻起来像死亡和鸡肉。主要是死亡。'),
    ('Smells like feet.', '闻起来像脚臭。'),
    ('Smells like fishing bait and booze.', '闻起来像鱼饵和酒。'),
    ('Smells like honey.', '闻起来像蜂蜜。'),
    ('Smells like it\'s already been barbecued!', '闻起来像已经烤过了！'),
    ('Smells pretty funky, but dinosaurs don\'t seem to mind it.', '气味相当刺鼻，但恐龙似乎并不介意。'),
    ('Smells strongly of alcohol and ether.', '散发着浓烈的酒精与以太气味。'),
    ('Smells weird.', '味道很怪。'),
    ('Smelly enough to potentially daze someone hit by it.', '味道太冲，被砸中的人可能会眩晕。'),
    ('Smoke dances beneath its flawless surface.', '烟气在它无瑕的表面下游走。'),
    ('Smouldering with demonic fire.', '阴燃着恶魔之火。'),
    ('Snapped in place by an enormous rusted spring.', '被一根巨大的锈蚀弹簧卡入到位。'),
    ('So fresh it\'s still twitching.', '新鲜得还在抽搐。'),
    ('So much pain', '太痛苦了'),
    ('So realistic - as though it might come to life.', '如此逼真——仿佛随时会活过来。'),
    ('So... Much... Treasure!!!', '好多……好多……宝藏！！！'),
    ('Soaked in the demonic blood of Rage Incarnate.', '浸透了怒灵化身恶魔之血。'),
    ('Soft to the touch.', '摸起来很柔软。'),
    ('Soft wailing can be heard from the glowing light.', '能听到那团亮光中传来轻柔的哀号。'),
    ('Sold by Big Keech in the Vale of Eternal Blossoms.', '由永恒之眼谷的大奇奇出售。'),
    ('Sold by Yasmin in Uldum.', '由奥丹姆的雅丝敏出售。'),
    ('Sold by inscription vendors and crafted by scribes, this fine dust is necessary to remove powerful glyphs so one may apply a new one.  Reserved for those level 81 or higher.', '由铭文商人出售、铭文师制作；这种精细的粉末用于去除强力雕文，以便施加新的雕文。  仅供 81 级或以上角色使用。'),
    ('Sold by inscription vendors and crafted by scribes, this is a vital reagent necessary for erasing and reapplying glyphs in your spellbook.  This particular powder can only be used if you are level 80 or lower.', '由铭文商人出售、铭文师制作；这是在法术书中擦除并重新施加雕文所必需的关键材料。  这种粉末仅能在 80 级或以下使用。'),
    ('Sold by inscription vendors and crafted by scribes, this tome is necessary to remove powerful glyphs and talents so that one may apply new ones. Reserved for those level 86 or higher.', '由铭文商人出售、铭文师制作；此典籍用于去除强力雕文与天赋，以便施加新的。仅供 86 级或以上角色使用。'),
    ('Solid gold. Shocking!', '纯金打造。真是惊人！'),
    ('Some dropped calls, probably no hidden fees!', '有些掉线，大概没有隐藏费用！'),
    ('Some extra gold, revealed by Fiona\'s Lucky Charm.', '菲奥娜的幸运符揭示出的一些额外金币。'),
    ('Some folks sharpen this to use as a tool.', '有些人把它磨利当作工具用。'),
    ('Some of the locusts seem to have even found their way into your bags...', '有些蝗虫似乎已经钻进了你的背包……'),
    ('Some of the pages have been eaten.', '有些书页被吃掉了。'),
    ('Somehow even more sinister than Mystery Meat.', '不知怎的，比神秘肉还要阴森些。'),
    ('Somehow it\'s still cool and frosty? This stuff is amazing.', '不知怎的它还是又凉又冰？这东西真神奇。'),
    ('Somehow its piercing gaze remains even after being removed.', '即便被取下，那刺人的凝视依旧不散。'),
    ('Somehow, you\'re still able to pick it up...', '不知怎的，你居然还能把它捡起来……'),
    ('Someone nearby wants to /flirt with you.', '附近有人想对你/调情。'),
    ('Someone will pay plenty for this...', '会有人为这个付大价钱的……'),
    ('Something about the shape of this stone makes it feel...  organic.', '这石头的形状不知怎的让人感觉……很有生命感。'),
    ('Something glows within.', '里面有东西在发光。'),
    ('Something is moving around inside!', '里面有东西在动！'),
    ('Sometimes Vile gets itchy', '维尔有时会痒'),
    ('Sometimes it is not an option..', '有时候并不是一个选择……'),
    ('Sometimes it\'s hard to let go.', '有时候就是难以放手。'),
    ('Sometimes obtained when disenchanting Bloodforged equipment.', '有时可通过分解血铸装备获得。'),
    ('Sometimes obtained when milling Briarthorn, Swiftthistle, Bruiseweed, and Stranglekelp.', '有时在对棘刺草、迅捷草、跌打草与窒息海藻进行研磨时获得。'),
    ('Sometimes the truth cannot be handled.', '有时候真相是承受不了的。'),
    ('Sometimes you just can\'t find a Stable Master.', '有时候你就是找不到兽栏管理员。'),
    ('Soothes the target beast, reducing the range at which it will attack you by  yards.  Only affects Beast and Dragonkin targets level 40 or lower.  Lasts', '安抚目标野兽，使其攻击你的距离缩短  码。  仅对 40 级或以下的野兽与龙类目标有效。  持续'),
    ('Soothes the target beast, reducing the range at which it will attack you by  yards.  Only affects Beast and Dragonkin targets level 55 or lower.  Lasts', '安抚目标野兽，使其攻击你的距离缩短  码。  仅对 55 级或以下的野兽与龙类目标有效。  持续'),
    ('Soothes the target beast, reducing the range at which it will attack you by  yards.  Only affects Beast and Dragonkin targets level 85 or lower.  Lasts', '安抚目标野兽，使其攻击你的距离缩短  码。  仅对 85 级或以下的野兽与龙类目标有效。  持续'),
    ('Soothes the target, reducing the range at which it will attack you by  yards.  Only affects Humanoid targets.  Lasts', '安抚目标，使其攻击你的范围降低 码。  仅影响人形目标。  持续'),
    ('Souls of those you have Slain, these can be used to redeem consumable and account-wide rewards in your capitial city.', '被你击杀者的灵魂，可在你的主城中用于兑换消耗品与账号通用奖励。'),
    ('Souls swirl within the beads, confined to some endless torment.', '灵魂在珠子里旋转，被困于某种无尽的折磨。'),
    ('Sound of thunder...', '雷声阵阵……'),
    ('Sound the horn, calling forth the power of the Qiraji Gladiator.', '吹响号角，召唤奇拉虫角斗士之力。'),
    ('Spattered with blood and booze.', '溅满鲜血与酒。'),
    ('Specially curved to allow for horns.', '特意弯出弧度以容纳角。'),
    ('Spectral shard torn from the Last Horizon, where souls march in endless procession. The trolls of old were master artists and craftsmen of the spirit world; shards like this were among their most cherished treasures.', '从灵魂无止无尽列队前行的最后地平线上撕下的幽灵碎片。古时的巨魔是灵魂世界的艺术大师与工匠，这类碎片曾是他们最珍视的宝物。'),
    ('Spend these tokens on gear!', '用这些代币换装备！'),
    ('Spend this on special items at the prestige store.', '可在尊崇商店购买特殊物品。'),
    ('Spherical, but pointy in parts.', '球形，但有些地方是尖的。'),
    ('Spiders are kind of like big crabs.', '蜘蛛有点像大螃蟹。'),
    ('Spirit Tender\'s Branches', '灵魂守望者的枝杈'),
    ('Spirit Tender\'s Bulb', '灵魂守望者的球茎'),
    ('Spirit Tender\'s Pack', '灵魂守望者的行囊'),
    ('Spiritual essence of a serpent, symbol of Dambala. To some, the Serpent Loa embodies wisdom and intrigue. To others, it is nothing but a mark of betrayal.', '蛇的精神精华，丹巴拉之象征。对一些人而言，蛇神灵代表智慧与机谋；对另一些人，它不过是背信的标记。'),
    ('Spiritual essence of a spider, symbol of Elortha no Shadra. To some, the Spider Loa embodies fate and subterfuge. To others, murder and deceit.', '蜘蛛的精神精华，艾洛萨·诺·沙德拉的象征。对一些人而言，蜘蛛神灵代表着命运与诡计；对另一些人，则是谋杀与欺骗。'),
    ('Spiritual residue, a byproduct of a complex ritual. Though it may not look like much, it pulses with residual magic from the spirit.', '灵魂残余，一场复杂仪式的副产物。虽然看起来不起眼，却脉动着灵魂残留的魔法。'),
    ('Splints, bandages, burn salves, smelling salts... anything you will need to get an injured Druid of the Talon back on his feet.', '夹板、绷带、烫伤药膏、嗅盐……任何能让你受伤的利爪德鲁伊重新站起所需的东西。'),
    ('Spots of rust have already begun to appear!', '已经开始出现锈斑了！'),
    ('Spreads existing Blood Plague and Frost Fever infections from your target to all other enemies within  yards.', '将目标身上现有的血之瘟疫与冰霜热疫扩散至 码内的其他所有敌人。'),
    ('Spring, Summer, Autumn, or Winter...', '春、夏、秋，还是冬……'),
    ('Spy Documentation - for Dark Iron eyes only', '间谍文件——仅供黑铁矮人查看'),
    ('Squirming around in your backpack...', '在你的背包里扭来扭去……'),
    ('Staff forged from the same minerals that compose the guardian. A gentle swing of the scepter makes the very air vibrate; an impact against a solid surface would unleash a resonance capable of awakening any other slumbering presence.', '以构成守护者自身的同种矿石锻造的权杖。轻轻挥动便令空气震颤；若击上坚硬表面，将迸发出足以唤醒其他沉睡存在的共鸣。'),
    ('Stained with blood and venom.', '沾满鲜血与毒液。'),
    ('Stained with the blood of many unlucky adventurers.', '沾满了许多不幸冒险者的血。'),
    ('Stamped with the Royal Seal of Bronzebeard.', '盖有铜须王室的印章。'),
    ('Stan...', '斯坦……'),
    ('Standard Issue.', '标准配发。'),
    ('Standard of Death\'s Chosen', '死亡选民战旗'),
    ('Standard of the Blackhound Warband', '黑犬战团战旗'),
    ('Standard of the Necrolords', '通灵领主战旗'),
    ('Star maps showing the dance of celestial bodies.', '展示天体之舞的星图。'),
    ('Stay away from mystery meat.', '离神秘肉远点。'),
    ('Steals a beneficial magic effect from the target.  This effect lasts a maximum of 2 min.', '从目标身上窃取一个有意的魔法效果。  该效果最多持续 2 分钟。'),
    ('Steamed buns. Or dumplings, rather, hee hee!', '是馒头。不，应该说是饺子，嘿嘿！'),
    ('Steeped in red dragon blood.', '浸满红龙之血。'),
    ('Step through the shadows from enemy to enemy within 10 yards, attacking an enemy every .5 secs with both weapons until 5 assaults are made, and increasing all damage done by  for the duration.  Can hit the same target multiple times.  Cannot hit invisible or stealthed targets.', '在 10 码内的敌人之间穿梭于阴影之中，每 .5 秒用双武器攻击一个敌人，共发动 5 次袭击，并在持续期间使你造成的所有伤害提高  。可多次命中同一目标。无法命中隐形或潜行的目标。'),
    ('Still beating.', '仍在跳动。'),
    ('Still breathing, but barely.', '还有呼吸，但很微弱。'),
    ('Still dripping with crazy-juice', '还在滴着疯癫汁液'),
    ('Still dripping with poison.', '还在滴着毒。'),
    ('Still flopping.', '还在扑腾。'),
    ('Still grimacing, as if in battle.', '还皱着眉，仿佛仍在战斗。'),
    ('Still mesmerized by your glowing antenna.', '仍被你那发光的触角迷住。'),
    ('Still round, still heavy... still good.', '还是圆的，还是重的……还是好的。'),
    ('Still squirming violently, even outside of the water.', '即使离开水，它仍在剧烈扭动。'),
    ('Still twitching...', '还在抽搐……'),
    ('Still warm with ancient wrath and the spirit of the Amani beast.', '仍带着远古怒火与阿曼尼野兽之灵的温热。'),
    ('Still wriggling.', '还在蠕动。'),
    ('Stings the target, draining  mana over  (up to a maximum of  of the caster\'s maximum mana), and energizing the Hunter equal to 300% of the amount drained.  Only one Sting per Hunter can be active on any one target.', '钉刺目标，在  内吸取  点法力值（最多不超过施法者最大法力值的 ），并使猎人获得相当于吸取量 300% 的能量。  同一目标身上只能有一个猎人的钉刺效果。'),
    ('Stings the target, reducing chance to hit with melee and ranged attacks by  for   Only one Sting per Hunter can be active on any one target.', '钉刺目标，使其近战和远程攻击的命中几率降低 ，持续 。同一目标身上只能有一个猎人的钉刺效果。'),
    ('Stinky.', '臭烘烘的。'),
    ('Stolen from Hellscream\'s Fist wreckage, it appears the hozen tried using this as a melee weapon.', '从地狱咆哮之拳残骸中盗出，看来猴人曾试图把它当作近战武器。'),
    ('Stolen goblin technology.', '被偷来的地精科技。'),
    ('Stolen long ago by the Nexus-Kings, the Scepter embodies the righteous power of the Naaru.', '很久以前被结点诸王盗走，这柄权杖蕴含着纳鲁的正义之力。'),
    ('Stolen supply from the forsaken convoy sent by the Dark Lady to the Depths of Orgrimmar, meant to reinforce the war effort of the dissidents. After a tip-off, it ended up in the hands of the city\'s worst crime syndicates.', '从黑暗女士派往奥格瑞玛深渊、旨在支援异议者战事的被遗忘者运输队中窃取的物资。在一次告密之后，它落入了城中最为恶劣的犯罪集团手中。'),
    ('Stonemother\'s Blessing', '石母之赐'),
    ('Straight, to the point, and surprisingly optimistic.', '直截了当，而且出人意料地乐观。'),
    ('Strange inscriptions glow on the stone slab.', '石板上闪烁着奇异的铭文。'),
    ('Strange, warped blades packed in crates adorned with cryptic runes.', '装在饰有神秘符文的木箱里的奇异扭曲刀刃。'),
    ('Strangely cool to the touch.', '摸起来出奇地凉。'),
    ('Strangely dry and likely very flammable.', '出奇地干燥，很可能极易燃。'),
    ('Strangely unrusted after countless years underwater.', '在水下待了无数年，却奇怪地没生锈。'),
    ('Strangulates an enemy, silencing them for   Non-player victim spellcasting is also interrupted for 47d.', '扼住一名敌人，使其沉默，持续  非玩家受害者的施法也会被打断，持续 47d。'),
    ('Strengthens the Death Knight with the presence of blood, increasing damage by  and healing the Death Knight by  of damage dealt. Only one Presence may be active at a time.', '以鲜血之力强化死亡骑士，使其伤害提高 ，并将造成伤害的  转化为对死亡骑士的治疗。同时只能激活一种领域。'),
    ('Strike the target for  weapon damage plus   Only usable after the Death Knight dodges or parries.  Can\'t be dodged, blocked, or parried.  This attack causes a high amount of threat.', '对目标造成  点武器伤害外加  仅在死亡骑士躲闪或招架后可用。  无法被躲闪、格挡或招架。  此攻击产生大量威胁值。'),
    ('Strong enough to instantly dissolve iron.  Keep away from your armor and weapons.', '强到能瞬间溶解钢铁。请远离你的护甲与武器。'),
    ('Stronger and sharper than your standard pick.', '比标准镐子更坚固也更锋利。'),
