    ('Summons a Grounding Totem with  health at the feet of the caster that will redirect one harmful spell cast on a nearby party member to itself, destroying the totem.  Will not redirect area of effect spells.  Lasts', '在施法者脚下召唤一根生命值为  的根基图腾，它会将附近小队成员受到的一次有害法术重定向至自身，并因此被摧毁。  不会重定向范围法术。  持续'),
