    ('Summons a Nature Resistance Totem with  health at the feet of the caster for  that increases the nature resistance of party and raid members within  yards by 73s1.', '在施法者脚下召唤一根生命值为  的抗自然图腾，持续 ，使 码内小队与团队成员的自然抗性提高 73s1。'),
    ('Summons a Nature Resistance Totem with  health at the feet of the caster for  that increases the nature resistance of party and raid members within  yards by 96s1.', '在施法者脚下召唤一根生命值为  的抗自然图腾，持续 ，使 码内小队与团队成员的自然抗性提高 96s1。'),
    ('Summons a Nature Resistance Totem with  health at the feet of the caster for  that increases the nature resistance of party and raid members within  yards by 98s1.', '在施法者脚下召唤一根生命值为  的抗自然图腾，持续 ，使 码内小队与团队成员的自然抗性提高 98s1。'),
    ('Summons a Stoneclaw Totem with  health at the feet of the caster for  that taunts creatures within  yards to attack it.  Enemies attacking the Stoneclaw Totem have a  chance to be stunned for   Stoneclaw totem also protects all your totems, causing them to absorb  damage.', '在施法者脚下召唤一根生命值为  的石爪图腾，持续  ，嘲讽  码内的生物攻击它。攻击石爪图腾的敌人有  的几率被昏迷  。石爪图腾还能保护你的所有图腾，使它们吸收  点伤害。'),
    ('Summons a Succubus under the command of the Warlock.', '召唤一只听命于术士的魅魔。'),
    ('Summons a Totem of Wrath with  health at the feet of the caster.  The totem increases spell power by  for all party and raid members, and increases the critical strike chance of of all attacks by  against all enemies within  yards.  Lasts', '在施法者脚下召唤一根生命值为  的愤怒图腾。该图腾使所有小队与团队成员的法术强度提高 ，并使  码内所有敌人的所有攻击暴击几率提高 。  持续'),
    ('Summons a Totem of Wrath with  health at the feet of the caster.  The totem increases the spell power by  for all party and raid members, and increases the critical strike chance of all attacks by  against all enemies within  yards.  Lasts', '在施法者脚下召唤一根生命值为  的愤怒图腾。该图腾使所有小队与团队成员的法术强度提高 ，并使  码内所有敌人的所有攻击暴击几率提高 。  持续'),
    ('Summons a Tremor Totem with  health at the feet of the caster that shakes the ground around it, removing Fear, Charm and Sleep effects from party members within  yards.  Lasts', '在施法者脚下召唤一根生命值为  的震颤图腾，使其周围地面震动，移除 码内小队成员身上的恐惧、魅惑与睡眠效果。  持续'),
    ('Summons a Voidwalker under the command of the Warlock.', '召唤一只听命于术士的虚空行者。'),
    ('Summons a Windfury Totem with  health at the feet of the caster.  The totem provides  melee haste to all party and raid members within  yards.  Lasts', '在施法者脚下召唤一根生命值为  的风怒图腾。  该图腾为 码内所有小队与团队成员提供  点近战急速。  持续'),
    ('Summons a Wrath of Air Totem with  health at the feet of the caster.  The totem provides  spell haste to all party and raid members within  yards.  Lasts', '在施法者脚下召唤一根生命值为  的空气之怒图腾。  该图腾为 码内所有小队与团队成员提供  点法术急速。  持续'),
    ('Summons a meteor from the Twisting Nether, causing  Fire damage and stunning all enemy targets in the area for   An Infernal rises from the crater, under the command of the caster for 82d.', '从扭曲虚空召唤一颗陨石，造成  点火焰伤害，并使该区域内所有敌对目标昏迷   一具地狱火将从坑中升起，受施法者控制 82d。'),
    ('Summons a second rune weapon that fights on its own for d, doing the same attacks as the Death Knight but for  reduced damage.', '召唤第二把符文武器，它独立作战 d，执行与死亡骑士相同的攻击，但造成 降低的伤害。'),
    ('Summons an Earthbind Totem with  health at the feet of the caster for  that slows the movement speed of enemies within  yards.', '在施法者脚下召唤一个生命值为 的地缚图腾，持续 ，使 码内敌人的移动速度降低。'),
    ('Summons an Eye of Kilrogg and binds your vision to it.  The eye moves quickly but is very fragile.', '召唤一只基尔罗格之眼并将你的视野与其绑定。  这只眼移动很快，但非常脆弱。'),
    ('Summons an Imp under the command of the Warlock.', '召唤一只听命于术士的小鬼。'),
    ('Summons an elemental totem that calls forth a greater fire elemental to rain destruction on the caster\'s enemies.  Lasts', '召唤一个元素图腾，唤出一名强大的火焰元素，向施法者的敌人倾泻毁灭。  持续'),
    ('Summons an entire legion of Ghouls to fight for the Death Knight.  The Ghouls will swarm the area, taunting and fighting anything they can.  While channelling Army of the Dead, the Death Knight takes less damage equal to s:her', '召唤一整支食尸鬼军团为死亡骑士作战。  食尸鬼将在区域内成群游荡，嘲讽并攻击一切。  引导亡者大军期间，死亡骑士受到的伤害降低相当于 s:her'),
    ('Summons an immobile Sentry Totem with  health at your feet for  that allows vision of nearby area and warns of enemies that attack it.  Right-Click on buff to switch back and forth between totem sight and shaman sight.', '在你脚下召唤一根不可移动、生命值为  的哨兵图腾，持续 ，可让你观察周边区域并警示攻击它的敌人。  右键点击增益可在图腾视野与萨满视野间切换。'),
    ('Summons two Spirit Wolves under the command of the Shaman, lasting', '召唤两只听命于萨满的幽灵狼，持续'),
    ('Summons your pet to you.', '将你的宠物召唤到你身边。'),
    ('Sun God\'s Wings', '太阳神之翼'),
    ('Sun-drinking crystal shard from the Twin Colossals.', '双峰山传来的饮日水晶碎片。'),
    ('Sunders the target\'s armor, reducing it by  per Sunder Armor and causes a high amount of threat.  Threat increased by attack power.  Can be applied up to 5 times.  Lasts 67d.', '击碎目标的护甲，每次破甲攻击使其护甲降低 ，并产生大量威胁值。  威胁值受攻击强度加成。  最多可叠加 5 次。  持续 67d。'),
    ('Surely there\'s nothing growing inside...right?', '里面肯定没长什么东西……对吧？'),
    ('Surface to Face Grenade', '面贴面手雷'),
    ('Surprise! It might be edible!', '惊喜！也许能吃！'),
    ('Surprisingly difficult to break.', '出乎意料地难以折断。'),
    ('Surprisingly docile.', '出乎意料地温顺。'),
    ('Surprisingly firm.', '出乎意料地紧实。'),
    ('Surprisingly high quality craftmanship considering the circumstances.', '考虑到当时的情况，工艺质量出奇地高。'),
    ('Surprisingly soft.', '出乎意料地柔软。'),
    ('Surrounds the Death Knight in an Anti-Magic Shell, absorbing  of the damage dealt by harmful spells (up to a maximum of  of the Death Knight\'s health) and preventing application of harmful magical effects.  Damage absorbed by Anti-Magic Shell energizes the Death Knight with additional runic power.  Lasts 07d.', '以反魔法护罩包裹死亡骑士，吸收有害法术造成的  点伤害（上限为死亡骑士生命值的  ），并阻止有害魔法效果的施加。反魔法护罩吸收的伤害会为死亡骑士转化为额外的符文能量。持续 07d。'),
    ('Sustenance for the fighting spirit.', '战斗精神的补给。'),
    ('Sweet, warm, buttery goodness.', '香甜、温热、黄油般的美味。'),
    ('Swipe nearby enemies, inflicting  weapon damage.', '横扫附近敌人，造成  点武器伤害。'),
    ('Swiped, I mean sourced, straight from Duskwood. Still smells like fear and grave dirt. \n\nGreat for mood lighting or keeping unwanted spirits at arm\'s length. Some say it only lights up when danger\'s near...', '从暮色森林「借」来的，我是说，采购来的。闻起来仍像恐惧与坟土。 \n\n很适合营造气氛，或让不速之魂敬而远之。有人说它只在危险临近时发亮……'),
    ('Syrupy and foul-smelling.', '黏稠又难闻。'),
    ('THERE\'S the beef, sweetling. Hee!', '这才是肉，小甜心。嘻！'),
    ('TWEET!', '啾！'),
    ('Take a piece of home with you wherever you go.', '无论走到哪里，都带上一片故乡。'),
    ('Take direct control of your pet and see through its eyes for', '直接控制你的宠物，并透过它的眼睛观察，持续'),
    ('Taken from a very angry gnome', '取自一个非常愤怒的侏儒'),
    ('Taken from the corpse of Skulloc Soulgrinder, the stench of fel sorcery still clings to this sack woven from cyclopean sinew.', '取自骷髅洛克·碎魂者的尸体，用独眼巨人肌腱编织的这只袋子仍残留着邪能法术的恶臭。'),
    ('Taken from the flames of a Rogue Flame Spirit, this ember is hot to the touch, flickering erratically as if it holds a mind of its own. It pulses like a heartbeat and crackles softly, eager to ignite anything flammable in its path.', '取自游荡火焰之灵的烈焰，这枚余烬触之灼热，火光诡异闪烁，仿佛自有意志。它如心跳般搏动、发出轻微爆裂声，急切地想点燃路上一切可燃之物。'),
    ('Taking both would be cheating.', '两个都拿就是作弊。'),
    ('Targets in a cone in front of the caster take  Shadow damage and an additional  Fire damage over 60d.', '施法者前方锥形范围内的目标受到 点暗影伤害，并在 60d 内额外受到 点火焰伤害。'),
    ('Targets in a cone in front of the caster take  Shadow damage and an additional  Fire damage over 91d.', '施法者前方锥形范围内的目标受到 点暗影伤害，并在 91d 内额外受到 点火焰伤害。'),
    ('Tastes even worse than it smells.', '尝起来比闻起来还糟。'),
    ('Tastes like sweet, sweet death.', '尝起来像甜甜的死亡。'),
    ('Tastes like... wolf.', '尝起来像……狼肉。'),
    ('Tastes suspiciously like an apple.', '尝起来可疑地像苹果。'),
    ('Tattered bits and pieces of red cloth.', '红布的破烂碎块。'),
    ('Taunts all enemies within  yards for', '嘲讽码内所有敌人，持续'),
    ('Taunts the target to attack you.  If the target is tauntable and not currently targeting you, causes  Holy damage.', '嘲讽目标使其攻击你。  如果目标可被嘲讽且当前未以你为目标，则造成 点神圣伤害。'),
    ('Teaches Feral Charge (Bear) and Feral Charge (Cat).\n\nFeral Charge (Bear) - Causes you to charge an enemy, immobilizing and interrupting any spell being cast for  This ability can be used in Bear Form and Dire Bear Form. 15 second cooldown.\n\nFeral Charge (Cat) - Causes you to leap behind an enemy, dazing them for  30 second cooldown.', '教你「野性冲锋（熊）」与「野性冲锋（豹）」。\n\n野性冲锋（熊）- 使你冲向敌人，使其无法移动并打断正在施放的法术，持续  此技能可在熊形态与巨熊形态下使用。15 秒冷却。\n\n野性冲锋（豹）- 使你跃至敌人身后，使其眩晕  30 秒冷却。'),
    ('Teaches Polymorph: Rabbit - (Warcraft Reborn)', '教你变形术：兔子（魔兽重生）'),
    ('Teaches Polymorph: Turtle - (Warcraft Reborn)', '教你变形术：乌龟（魔兽重生）'),
    ('Teaches Power Word Fortitude (Rank 6)', '教你真言术：韧（等级 6）'),
