    ('Teaches you Agility (Rank 2) on use.\n\n|cFFFFCC00Agility:|r\n|cFFFFFFFFRank 2|r\nIncreases your Agility by |cffFF99002|r.', '使用时教你敏捷（等级 2）。\n\n|cFFFFCC00敏捷:|r\n|cFFFFFFFF等级 2|r\n使你的敏捷提高 |cffFF99002|r。'),
