    ('Teaches you how to permanently enchant a cloak to give 10 additional armor.', '教你如何永久附魔披风，额外提供 10 点护甲。'),
    ('Teaches you how to permanently enchant a cloak to increase critical strike by 65.  Requires a level 300 or higher item.', '教你如何永久为一件披风附魔，使爆击提高 65。  需要物品等级 300 或以上。'),
    ('Teaches you how to permanently enchant a melee weapon to make your damaging melee strikes sometimes activate a Mogu protection spell, absorbing damage.  Requires a level 372 or higher item.', '教你永久附魔一件近战武器，使你的伤害性近战打击有时触发魔古保护法术，吸收伤害。  需要等级 372 或更高的物品。'),
    ('Teaches you how to permanently enchant a melee weapon to sometimes increase Intellect when healing or dealing damage with spells.  Also increases Spirit if your mana is low.  Requires a level 372 or higher item.', '教你永久附魔一件近战武器，使其在使用法术治疗或造成伤害时有时提高智力。若你的法力值较低，还会提高精神。  需要等级 372 或更高的物品。'),
    ('Teaches you how to permanently enchant a melee weapon to sometimes increase your Strength or Agility by 1,650 when dealing melee damage.  Requires a level 372 or higher item.', '教你永久附魔一件近战武器，使其在造成近战伤害时有时使你的力量或敏捷提高 1,650 点。  需要等级 372 或更高的物品。'),
    ('Teaches you how to permanently enchant a melee weapon to sometimes increase your critical strike, haste, or mastery by 1,500 for 12 sec when dealing damage with spells and melee attacks.  Requires a level 372 or higher item.', '教你永久附魔一件近战武器，使其在使用法术与近战攻击造成伤害时有时使你的暴击、急速或精通提高 1,500 点，持续 12 秒。  需要等级 372 或更高的物品。'),
    ('Teaches you how to permanently enchant a melee weapon to sometimes increase your dodge when dealing melee damage.  Requires a level 372 or higher item.', '教你永久附魔一件近战武器，使其在造成近战伤害时有时提高你的躲闪。  需要等级 372 或更高的物品。'),
