    ('Teaches you how to summon the Grungy Containment Pack. Displays on your back.', '教你如何召唤「Grungy Containment Pack. Displays on your back」。'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon the Legion\'s Lexicon on use.\n\nThis item is added to your vanity collection and is usable on all of your Felforged characters.', '教你使用时召唤军团辞典。\n\n此物品会加入你的幻化收藏，你的所有邪铸角色均可使用。'),
