    ('Teaches you how to summon this Void Back Growth. Displays on your back.', '教你如何召唤「this Void Back Growth. Displays on your back」。'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this balloon. Floats behind you.', '教你如何召唤「this balloon. Floats behind you」。'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this balloon. Floats to your left.', '教你如何召唤「this balloon. Floats to your left」。'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this balloon. Floats to your right.', '教你如何召唤「this balloon. Floats to your right」。'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this bell companion.\n\nThis is a non-combat companion.', '教你召唤「this bell companion」。\n\n这是非战斗伙伴。'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this companion that acts as a Portable Transmogrifier!\n\nThis is a non-combat companion.', '教你如何召唤这个可随身携带的幻化师伙伴！\n\n这是非战斗伙伴。'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this companion that acts as a portable bank while in safe zones.\n\nSeason 9 bundle exclusive.\n\nThis is a non-combat companion.', '教你召唤此伙伴，它可在安全区域内充当随身银行。\n\n第九赛季礼包专属。\n\n这是非战斗伙伴。'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this companion that acts as a portable bank while in safe zones.\n\nThis is a non-combat companion.', '教你召唤「this companion that acts as a portable bank while in safe zones」。\n\n这是非战斗伙伴。'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this companion that was deemed unworthy of ascending, this Val\'kyr faced exile from the Halls of Valor. Yet now, she pledges to shield and safeguard you. A newfound sense of security envelops you already!\n\nThis is a non-combat companion.', '教你召唤这名被认为不配飞升的伙伴，这位瓦格里曾被逐出英灵殿。然而如今，她誓言为你提供庇护与守护。一种崭新的安全感已笼罩着你！\n\n这是非战斗伙伴。'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this companion.\n\nThe Book of Ascension allows you train all of your abilities from any class.\n\nLeague 4 Exclusive\n\nThis is a non-combat companion.', '教你召唤此伙伴。\n\n飞升之书允许你学习任何职业的所有技能。\n\n联赛 4 专属\n\n这是非战斗伙伴。'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this companion.\n\nThe Book of Ascension allows you train all of your abilities from any class.\n\nSeason 1 Exclusive.\n\nThis is a non-combat companion.', '教你召唤此伙伴。\n\n飞升之书允许你学习任何职业的所有技能。\n\n第一赛季专属。\n\n这是非战斗伙伴。'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this companion.\n\nThe Book of Ascension allows you train all of your abilities from any class.\n\nSeason 2 Exclusive\n\nThis is a non-combat companion.', '教你召唤此伙伴。\n\n飞升之书允许你学习任何职业的所有技能。\n\n第二赛季专属\n\n这是非战斗伙伴。'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this companion.\n\nThe Book of Ascension allows you train all of your abilities from any class.\n\nSeason 3 Exclusive.\n\nThis is a non-combat companion.', '教你召唤此伙伴。\n\n飞升之书允许你学习任何职业的所有技能。\n\n第三赛季专属。\n\n这是非战斗伙伴。'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this companion.\n\nThe Book of Ascension allows you train all of your abilities from any class.\n\nSeason 4 Exclusive\n\nThis is a non-combat companion.', '教你召唤此伙伴。\n\n飞升之书允许你学习任何职业的所有技能。\n\n第四赛季专属\n\n这是非战斗伙伴。'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this companion.\n\nThe Book of Ascension allows you train all of your abilities from any class.\n\nSeason 5 Exclusive.\n\nThis is a non-combat companion.', '教你召唤此伙伴。\n\n飞升之书允许你学习任何职业的所有技能。\n\n第五赛季专属\n\n这是非战斗伙伴。'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this companion.\n\nThe Book of Ascension allows you train all of your abilities from any class.\n\nSeason 6 Exclusive.\n\nThis is a non-combat companion.', '教你召唤此伙伴。\n\n飞升之书允许你学习任何职业的所有技能。\n\n第六赛季专属\n\n这是非战斗伙伴。'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this companion.\n\nThe Portable Silas Darkmoon offers the same quests as the Silas you find in capital cities.\n\nThis is a non-combat companion.', '教你召唤此伙伴。\n\n便携式希拉斯·暗月提供的任务与你在主城见到的希拉斯相同。\n\n这是非战斗伙伴。'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this companion.\n\n|cFFFFD100Beep boop. I am your Cogsley device. Are you seeking assistance in the Manastorm? I can repair your items and vendor your goods.|r\n\n|cFFFFD100Cogsley only works in the Manastorm.|r\n\nThis is a non-combat companion.', '教你召唤这名伙伴。\n\n|cFFFFD100哔哔。我是你的科格斯利装置。你是在法力风暴中寻求帮助吗？我可以修理你的物品并为你的货物寻找商贩。|r\n\n|cFFFFD100科格斯利仅在法力风暴中有效。|r\n\n这是非战斗伙伴。'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this companion.\n|cff00ffff\nThe Beginner\'s Book of Ascension allows you train all of your abilities from any class up to level 10.|r\n\nThis is a non-combat companion.', '教你召唤此伙伴。\n|cff00ffff\n飞升之书（新手版）允许你学习任何职业的所有技能，最高至 10 级。|r\n\n这是非战斗伙伴。'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this companion. \n\nThe Greedy Goblin gives you access to Portable Fel-Commutation to protect your items in High-Risk\n\nThis is a non-combat companion.', '教你召唤此伙伴。 \n\n贪婪的地精可让你使用便携式邪能转换，以在高风险区域保护你的物品\n\n这是非战斗伙伴。'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this mount that adapts to your riding skill!', '教你如何召唤「this mount that adapts to your riding skill!」。'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this mount which adapts to your riding Skill!\n\nThis is a a Flying mount.', '教你如何召唤这只随你骑术成长的坐骑！\n\n这是一只飞行坐骑。'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this mount!', '教你如何召唤「this mount!」。'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this mount. It is a 3 seat ground mount.', '教你如何召唤「this mount. It is a 3 seat ground mount」。'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this mount. This is a Flying mount.', '教你召唤此坐骑。\n\n这是飞行坐骑。'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this mount. This is a Ground mount.\n\n A reward for completing the Ironman Challenge!', '教你召唤此坐骑。\n\n这是地面坐骑。'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this mount. This is a Ground mount.\n\nLimited Edition.', '教你召唤此坐骑。\n\n这是地面坐骑。'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this mount. This is a Ground mount.\n\nPersonal mount of Azzar, ancient king of the Whispering Peaks. When the deceit of the false loa became apparent, Azzar safeguarded the spirit of his loyal raptor in seven stone tablets. Then, he ventured underground and followed the voice that called from the northern reaches.', '教你召唤此坐骑。\n\n这是地面坐骑。'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this mount. This is a Ground mount.\n\nThis cosmetic item is added to your vanity collection and is usable on all of your characters.', '教你召唤此坐骑。\n\n这是地面坐骑。'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this mount. This is a Ground mount.\n\nThis mount is an exclusive and rare item.', '教你召唤此坐骑。\n\n这是地面坐骑。'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this mount. This is a Ground mount. \n\nThis Felstalker is added to your vanity collection and usable on all Felforged characters', '教你召唤此坐骑。\n\n这是地面坐骑。'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this mount. This is a Ground mount. \n\nThis mount is a reward for completing the Hardcore Trial!', '教你召唤此坐骑。\n\n这是地面坐骑。'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this mount. This is a Ground mount. \n\nViscidous\'s last meal...', '教你召唤此坐骑。\n\n这是地面坐骑。'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this mount. This is a Ground mount. Rewarded from "A Class Above" achievement.', '教你召唤此坐骑。\n\n这是地面坐骑。'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this mount. This is a two-person ground mount.', '教你召唤此坐骑。\n\na two-person ground mount。'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this mount. This mount is capable of Flying.\n\nIt is believed to possess answers to some of life\'s greatest mysteries. It\'s a pity they can\'t talk though...', '教你召唤此坐骑。此坐骑可以飞行。\n\n人们相信它掌握着生命中某些终极奥秘的答案。可惜它不会说话……'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this mount. This mount is capable of Flying.\n\nOne of the heartiest of species that inhabit the slopes of Highmountain, their will to survive even the harshest conditions make them a sought after companion.', '教你召唤此坐骑。此坐骑可飞行。\n\n高山之巅最坚韧的物种之一，它们在最严苛的环境下也顽强求生，因而成为众人追捧的伙伴。'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this mount. This mount is capable of Flying.\n\nOne of the heartiest of species that inhabit the slopes of Highmountain, they can survive for months in freezing blizzards.', '教你召唤此坐骑。此坐骑可以飞行。\n\n它们是居住在高山岭坡地最顽强的物种之一，能在刺骨暴风雪中存活数月。'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this mount. This mount is capable of Flying.\n\nThe Crimson Skyblazer is a Season 7 exclusive from the Ethereal Box of Wares.', '教你召唤此坐骑。此坐骑可以飞行。\n\n赤红天行者是虚灵货物箱中的第七赛季专属坐骑。'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this mount. This mount is capable of Flying.\n\nThe Grove Wardens of the Emerald Dream were some of the first to fall to the corrupting influence of the Nightmare.', '教你召唤此坐骑。此坐骑可以飞行。\n\n翡翠梦境的林地守卫者是最早一批被梦魇腐化影响的存在。'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this mount. This mount is capable of Flying.\n\nThese magical companions are the wardens of peaceful, primordial groves within the Emerald Dream.', '教你召唤此坐骑。此坐骑可以飞行。\n\n这些魔法伙伴是翡翠梦境中宁静原始林地的守护者。'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this mount. This mount is capable of Flying.\n\nThis mount is a reward for completing the Hardcore Resolute Challenge!', '教你召唤此坐骑。此坐骑可以飞行。\n\n此坐骑是完成硬核坚定挑战的奖励！'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this mount. This mount is capable of Flying.\n\nThis mount is obtained by being in the top 10 of the 1v1 or top 10 of the 2v2 leaderboard when a PvP Progression (TBC) comes to an end.', '教你召唤此坐骑。此坐骑可以飞行。\n\n在一轮 PvP 进度（燃烧的远征）结束时，位列 1v1 或 2v2 排行榜前 10 名即可获得此坐骑。'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this mount. This mount is capable of Flying.\n\nThis mount is obtained by being in the top 10 of the 1v1 or top 10 of the 2v2 leaderboard when a PvP Progression (Vanilla) comes to an end.', '教你召唤此坐骑。此坐骑可以飞行。\n\n在一轮 PvP 进度（经典旧世）结束时，位列 1v1 或 2v2 排行榜前 10 名即可获得此坐骑。'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this mount. This mount is capable of Flying.\n\nThis mount is obtained for reaching 2500 arena rating.', '教你如何召唤这只坐骑。该坐骑可以飞行。\n\n达到 2500 竞技场等级即可获得该坐骑。'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this mount. This mount is capable of Flying.\n\nThis mount is obtained from reaching 2500 rating in arena.', '教你如何召唤这只坐骑。该坐骑可以飞行。\n\n在竞技场达到 2500 等级即可获得该坐骑。'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this mount. This mount is capable of Flying.\n\nThis mount was chiseled by the stonemasons of Stormwind, this stone gryphon symbolizes the unbending courage of the Alliance.', '教你召唤此坐骑。此坐骑可以飞行。\n\n这头石狮鹫由暴风城的石匠雕成，象征着联盟不屈的勇气。'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this mount. This mount is capable of Flying.\n\nThis mount was chiseled by the stoneworkers of Orgrimmar, this stone wind rider is a symbol of the unwavering strength of the Horde.', '教你召唤此坐骑。此坐骑可以飞行。\n\n这头石制双足飞龙由奥格瑞玛的石匠雕成，象征着部落坚定不移的力量。'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this mount. This mount is capable of Flying.\n\nThis mount was forged deep within Hellfire Citadel by a mad blacksmith; the Corrupted Annihilator combines the metalworking knowledge of the Iron Horde with the chaotic fel energies of the Burning Legion into an unholy union of steel and flame.', '教你召唤此坐骑。此坐骑可飞行。\n\n此坐骑由一位疯狂的铁匠在地狱火堡垒深处锻造；腐化歼灭者将钢铁部落的金属工艺与燃烧军团的混乱邪能融为一体，形成钢铁与烈焰的邪恶结合。'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this mount. This mount is capable of Flying.\n\nThis mount was forged deep within Hellfire Citadel by a mad blacksmith; the Defiled Annihilator combines the metalworking knowledge of the Iron Horde with the chaotic fel energies of the Burning Legion into an unholy union of steel and flame.', '教你召唤此坐骑。此坐骑可飞行。\n\n此坐骑由一位疯狂的铁匠在地狱火堡垒深处锻造；亵渎歼灭者将钢铁部落的金属工艺与燃烧军团的混乱邪能融为一体，形成钢铁与烈焰的邪恶结合。'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this mount. This mount is capable of Flying.\n\nThis mount was forged deep within Hellfire Citadel by a mad blacksmith; the Felsteel Annihilator combines the metalworking knowledge of the Iron Horde with the chaotic fel energies of the Burning Legion into an unholy union of steel and flame.', '教你召唤此坐骑。此坐骑可飞行。\n\n此坐骑由一位疯狂的铁匠在地狱火堡垒深处锻造；邪钢歼灭者将钢铁部落的金属工艺与燃烧军团的混乱邪能融为一体，形成钢铁与烈焰的邪恶结合。'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this mount. This mount is capable of Flying.\n\nThis mount was forged deep within Hellfire Citadel by a mad blacksmith; the Frostbitten Annihilator combines the metalworking knowledge of the Iron Horde with the chaotic fel energies of the Burning Legion into an unholy union of steel, frost and flame.', '教你召唤此坐骑。此坐骑可飞行。\n\n此坐骑由一位疯狂的铁匠在地狱火堡垒深处锻造；寒霜歼灭者将钢铁部落的金属工艺与燃烧军团的混乱邪能融为一体，形成钢铁、寒霜与烈焰的邪恶结合。'),
    ('Teaches you how to summon this three-person mount with vendors. Excellent for those long journies up the summit of Mount Neverest. Be the envy of your friends.', '教你如何召唤「this three-person mount with vendors. Excellent for those long journies up the summit of Mount Neverest. Be the envy of your friends」。'),
    ('Teaches you how to temporarily imbue a piece of chest armor to give +3 Spirit for 60 min.', '教你如何暂时为一件胸甲附上 60 分钟内 +3 精神的强化效果。'),
    ('Teaches you how to transform into a dragon, allowing you to carry an ally on your back.  This is a flying mount.', '教你如何变形为一条龙，让你可以把一名盟友背在身上。  这是飞行坐骑。'),
    ('Teaches you how to transform into an Obsidian Nightwing, allowing you to carry an ally on your back.  This is a flying mount.', '教你如何变形为黑曜夜翼，让你可以把一名盟友背在身上。  这是飞行坐骑。'),
    ('Teaches you how to transform into this mount. This mount is capable of Flying.\n\nA true union of minds... This is a three person mount.', '教你如何变形为这只坐骑。该坐骑可以飞行。\n\n心灵真正的结合……这是三人坐骑。'),
    ('Teaches you how to transform into this mount. This mount is capable of Flying.\n\nWhen you can\'t run, you crawl, and when you can\'t crawl you find someone to carry you...', '教你变身为该坐骑。该坐骑可以飞行。\n\n当你跑不动时就爬，爬不动时就找个人背你……'),
    ('Teaches you how to transmute Cured Core Imbued Steak', '教你如何转化熟化核心注能牛排。'),
    ('Teaches you how to transmute Cured Demon Imbued Steak', '教你如何转化熟化恶魔注能牛排。'),
    ('Teaches you how to transmute Cured Sanguine Imbued Steak', '教你如何转化熟化猩红注能牛排。'),
    ('Teaches you how to transmute Cured Scourge Charged Steak', '教你如何转化「Cured Scourge Charged Steak」。'),
    ('Teaches you how to transmute Flourishing Core Root', '教你如何转化繁盛核心根。'),
    ('Teaches you how to transmute Flourishing Demon Bloom', '教你如何转化「Flourishing Demon Bloom」。'),
    ('Teaches you how to transmute Flourishing Sanguine Vine', '教你如何转化繁盛猩红藤蔓。'),
    ('Teaches you how to transmute Flourishing Scourge Lotus', '教你如何转化繁盛天灾莲。'),
    ('Teaches you how to transmute Forbidding Core Dust', '教你如何转化禁忌核心粉尘。'),
    ('Teaches you how to transmute Forbidding Demon Dust', '教你如何转化禁忌恶魔粉尘。'),
    ('Teaches you how to transmute Forbidding Sanguine Shard', '教你如何转化禁忌血红碎片。'),
    ('Teaches you how to transmute Forbidding Scourge Dust', '教你如何转化禁忌天灾粉尘。'),
