    ('Teaches you to summon a Wonka Blue Flag. \n\nParty members can use the flag to transform their mounts into a Cyan Winged Wonka for 15 min.', '教你召唤一面旺卡蓝旗。 \n\n小队成员可使用该旗帜，将自己的坐骑变为青色飞翼旺卡，持续 15 分钟。'),
    ('Teaches you to summon a Wonka Green Flag. \n\nParty members can use the flag to transform their mounts into a Green Winged Wonka for 15 min.', '教你召唤一面旺卡绿旗。 \n\n小队成员可使用该旗帜，将自己的坐骑变为绿色飞翼旺卡，持续 15 分钟。'),
