    ('Teaches you to summon a Wonka Purple Flag. \n\nParty members can use the flag to transform their mounts into a Purple Winged Wonka for 15 min.', '教你召唤一面旺卡紫旗。 \n\n小队成员可使用该旗帜，将自己的坐骑变为紫色飞翼旺卡，持续 15 分钟。'),
    ('Teaches you to summon a Wonka Rainbow Flag.\n\nParty members can use the flag to transform their mounts into a Winged Wonka for 15 min.', '教你召唤旺卡彩虹旗。\n\n小队成员可用此旗将坐骑变形为羽翼旺卡，持续 15 分钟。'),
    ('Teaches you to summon a Wonka Red Flag. \n\nParty members can use the flag to transform their mounts into a Red Wonka Insignia for 15 min.', '教你召唤一面旺卡红旗。 \n\n小队成员可使用该旗帜，将自己的坐骑变为红色旺卡徽记，持续 15 分钟。'),
    ('Teaches you to summon a Wonka Yellow Flag. \n\nParty members can use the flag to transform their mounts into a Yellow Winged Wonka for 15 min.', '教你召唤一面旺卡黄旗。 \n\n小队成员可使用该旗帜，将自己的坐骑变为黄色飞翼旺卡，持续 15 分钟。'),
    ('Teaches you to summon an Azzar Faire Beach Chair.', '教你召唤阿扎尔集市沙滩椅。'),
