    ('Teaches: Aquatic Form.\n\nGain this permanent spell.', '教你：水栖形态。\n\n获得此永久法术。'),
    ('Teaches: Call of the Ancestors.\n\nGain this permanent spell.', '教你：先祖召唤。\n\n获得此永久法术。'),
    ('Teaches: Call of the Elements.\n\nGain this permanent spell. This spell is usable inside and outside of Manastorm', '教你：元素召唤。\n\n获得此永久法术。此法术可在法力风暴内外使用'),
    ('Teaches: Eagle Eye.\n\nGain this permanent spell.', '教你：鹰眼术。\n\n获得此永久法术。'),
    ('Teaches: Eye of Kilrogg.\n\nGain this permanent spell. This spell is usable inside and outside of Manastorm', '教你：基尔罗格之眼。\n\n获得此永久法术。此法术可在法力风暴内外使用'),
