    ('Teaches: Levitate.\n\nGain this permanent spell. This spell is usable inside and outside of Manastorm', '教你：漂浮术。\n\n获得此永久法术。此法术可在法力风暴内外使用'),
    ('Teaches: Mind Soothe.\n\nGain this permanent spell. This spell is usable inside and outside of Manastorm', '教你：安抚心灵。\n\n获得此永久法术。此法术可在法力风暴内外使用'),
    ('Teaches: Mind Vision.\n\nGain this permanent spell. This spell is usable inside and outside of Manastorm', '教你：心灵视界。\n\n获得此永久法术。此法术可在法力风暴内外使用'),
    ('Teaches: Pick Lock\n\nGain this Permanent Spell', '教你：开锁\n\n获得此永久法术'),
    ('Teaches: Pick Pocket.\n\nGain this permanent spell.', '教你：扒窃。\n\n获得此永久法术。'),
    ('Teaches: Safe Fall.\n\nGain this permanent spell. This spell is usable inside and outside of Manastorm', '教你：安全坠落。\n\n获得此永久法术。此法术可在法力风暴内外使用'),
    ('Teaches: Teleport: Moonglade.\n\nGain this permanent spell. This spell is usable inside and outside of Manastorm', '教你：传送：月光林地。\n\n获得此永久法术。此法术可在法力风暴内外使用'),
    ('Teaches: Unending Breath.\n\nGain this permanent spell.', '教你：无尽呼吸。\n\n获得此永久法术。'),
    ('Teaches: Water Breathing.\n\nGain this permanent spell.', '教你：水下呼吸。\n\n获得此永久法术。'),
    ('Teaches: Water Walking.\n\nGain this permanent spell.', '教你：水上行走。\n\n获得此永久法术。'),
    ('Technical blueprints filled with mechanical designs, accompanied by the sound of ticking gears.', '填满机械设计的技术蓝图，并伴随着齿轮转动的滴答声。'),
    ('Teleports the caster  yards forward, unless something is in the way.  Also frees the caster from stuns and bonds.', '将施法者向前传送 码，除非前方有东西阻挡。  同时解除施法者的昏迷与束缚。'),
    ('Teleports the caster to Darnassus.', '将施法者传送至达纳苏斯。'),
    ('Teleports the caster to Exodar.', '将施法者传送至埃索达。'),
    ('Teleports the caster to Ironforge.', '将施法者传送至铁炉堡。'),
    ('Teleports the caster to Shattrath.', '将施法者传送至沙塔斯。'),
    ('Teleports the caster to Stormwind.', '将施法者传送至暴风城。'),
    ('Teleports you to your Demonic Circle and removes all snare effects.', '将你传送到你的恶魔法阵，并移除所有定身效果。'),
    ('Temporarily grants the Death Knight  of maximum health and increases the amount of health generated through spells and effects by  for   After the effect expires, the health is lost.', '在  内临时赋予死亡骑士最大生命值的  生命值，并使法术与效果生成的生命值提高   效果结束后，这些生命值将失去。'),
    ('Tendrils of Skyhold', '天顶堡的卷须'),
    ('Teron Gorefiend was able to take the Eye from its secure vault in Dalaran. He tossed a gold coin into the Eventide\'s fountain, which he claims was not for a wish, but as \'payment\' for what he took up and fled away.', '泰隆·血魔从达拉然戒备森严的宝库中取走了那只眼睛。他往暮色喷泉里丢了一枚金币，声称这并非许愿，而是为他带走之物付的「价钱」，随后便逃之夭夭。'),
    ('Terrifying to behold!', '望之生畏！'),
    ('Thankfully the water is sheltering you from what is almost certainly a terrible stench.', '幸好有水层遮蔽着你，否则那气味必定难以忍受。'),
    ('That cranky, old Earthen, Clay Mudaxle, should like this one.', '那个暴躁的老土灵克莱·姆达克索应该会喜欢这个。'),
    ('That is one big paw!', '好大一只爪子！'),
    ('That totem could\'ve at least given you some bottles.', '那个图腾至少该给你几个瓶子。'),
    ('That\'s a lot of gold.', '这可是一大笔金币。'),
    ('That\'s an oxymoron, lad.', '那是自相矛盾，小伙子。'),
    ('That\'s one saucy-looking snapper.', '这只龟看起来真够泼辣的。'),
    ('That\'s what traitors get!', '这就是背叛者的下场！'),
    ('The "supplies" look empty.', '“补给”看起来是空的。'),
    ('The \'Tome\' is actually a slab of dark stone covered with miniscule engravings.', '所谓「典籍」，其实是一块布满微小刻痕的深色石板。'),
    ('The Authoritotal Handbook', '权威全能手册'),
    ('The Death Knight freezes s:her', '死亡骑士冻住了她'),
    ('The Death Knight is surrounded by  whirling bones.  While at least 1 bone remains, :she', '死亡骑士被  旋转的白骨所环绕。只要还剩下 1 根白骨， :she'),
    ('The Death Knight\'s freezing aura creates ice beneath s:her', '死亡骑士的冰霜光环在其脚下结成坚冰'),
    ('The Druid, rebelling against his masters, was consumed by rage. This rage spiraled into madness and the madness became one with the masters.', '这位德鲁伊背叛了他的主人，被愤怒吞噬。这愤怒逐渐化为疯狂，而疯狂最终与主人融为一体。'),
    ('The Eyes of this Effigy pulsates with a Felforged aura, slowly consuming all that remains. As you look closer, the Effigy resembles Prince Malchezaar. I should try to extract this energy.', '这具雕像的双眼搏动着邪铸光环，正缓缓吞噬余下的一切。细看之下，雕像形似玛尔齐扎尔亲王。我该试着提取这股能量。'),
    ('The Grim Guzzler\'s brawls are things of legend.', '阴郁饮客酒馆的斗殴堪称传奇。'),
    ('The Highborne were the upper classes of the ancient Kaldorei civilization, at first a nameless caste made up of night elves who had unusual intelligence, strength, skills, or wealth and thus found favor with the ruling monarch. Their vast arrogance and gr', '上层精灵是古代卡多雷文明的上层阶级，最初是一个无名的种姓，由那些拥有非凡智力、力量、技艺或财富而受到统治者青睐的暗夜精灵组成。他们的极度傲慢与贪'),
    ('The Keystone to enter the Karazhan Crypts, infused with power by Tabetha and attuned to you.', '进入卡拉赞墓穴所需的钥匙石，由塔贝萨注入力量并已与你绑定。'),
    ('The Keystone to enter the Karazhan Crypts. In this form it is useless to you, but perhaps Tabetha will know how to attune it to you.', '进入卡拉赞墓穴所需的钥匙石。以目前形态对你毫无用处，但塔贝萨或许知道如何让它与你绑定。'),
    ('The Left Half of Thunderaan\'s Eternal Prison', '桑德兰永恒牢笼的左半部分'),
    ('The Lich King is waiting! Contains 15 frosty STARTER GEAR items. Make sure you have space in your inventory!', '巫妖王在等待！内含 15 件霜寒新手指装备。请确保背包有足够空间！'),
    ('The Magnataur Slayer.', '猛犸人杀手。'),
    ('The Mantid learned long ago how to bend the winds of Pandaria to the Empress\' will.', '螳螂妖很久以前就学会了如何让潘达利亚的风听从女皇的意志。'),
    ('The Mark of Darkness.', '黑暗印记。'),
    ('The Scroll of Friendship does not include the Spectral Steed. The Spectral Steed is mailed with the Scroll!', '友谊卷轴不包含幽灵战马。幽灵战马会随卷轴一同邮寄！'),
    ('The Skull of the Warlock Gul\'dan. Its mere presence makes you feel sick.', '术士古尔丹的头骨。它单单存在就让你感到恶心。'),
    ('The Spirit burns for what seems like an eternity; you\'re bestowed with the energy of demons.', '灵魂燃烧的感觉仿佛持续了永恒；你被赋予了恶魔的能量。'),
    ('The Spoils of a great battle between the factions!', '阵营之间一场大战的战利品！'),
    ('The Steamwheedle Sharks were always better equipped than the Bilgewater Buccaneers. Time for some payback!', '蒸汽轮鲨鱼帮的装备一直比污水海盗团好。是时候还以颜色了！'),
    ('The Warpstalker Horn gives this weapon its speed', '跃迁兽之角赋予了这把武器速度'),
    ('The Wonka Egg has hatched!', '旺卡蛋已孵化！'),
    ('The added comfort of sensitive explosives in your pockets.', '口袋里还装着敏感爆炸物，额外增加了舒适感。'),
    ('The assembled rod somehow feels both light and heavy within your hand.', '拼好的法杖在手中竟同时感觉轻巧与沉重。'),
    ('The attack power bonus of your spells is increased by 20s1%.', '你的法术的攻击强度加成提高 20s1%。'),
    ('The attack power bonus of your spells is increased by 33s1%.', '你的法术的攻击强度加成提高 33s1%。'),
    ('The attack power bonus of your spells is increased by 35s1%.', '你的法术的攻击强度加成提高 35s1%。'),
    ('The attack power bonus of your spells is increased by 36s1%.', '你的法术的攻击强度加成提高 36s1%。'),
    ('The bag emits a very strong odor.', '这袋子散发出强烈的气味。'),
    ('The barrels of this monstrous gun are almost the size of your fist. It can only be used on a caravan kodo.', '这把巨枪的枪管几乎和你的拳头一样大。它只能用在商队科多兽上。'),
    ('The beard serves remarkably well as a handle.', '这把胡子当把手格外好用。'),
    ('The beginning of wisdom is to desire it. The end of wisdom is to theorycraft.', '智慧的开端是渴望它，智慧的终点是纸上谈兵。'),
    ('The bets are getting bigger.', '赌注越来越大。'),
    ('The blood of the footman it was taken from has left a permanent stain.', '取自步兵的血留下了永久的污渍。'),
    ('The blood of the innocent do not way down the wrath of Lord Naxxemus', '无辜者的血无法平息纳克瑟姆斯领主的怒火'),
    ('The blood-red stone sparkles in the light.', '血红的宝石在光下闪烁。'),
    ('The blooms are remarkably delicate.', '这些花朵格外娇嫩。'),
    ('The blue one.', '蓝色的那个。'),
    ('The book contains Delgren\'s Argent Dawn prayers as well as a diary of his travels.', '这本书里有德尔格伦的银色黎明祷文，以及他的旅行日记。'),
    ('The book is scattered with glyphs and a soft glow emanates from within.', '书页上散布着符文，内部透出柔和的光。'),
    ('The book seems unusually normal, aside from the chains and socket binding it.', '这本书看起来异常普通，只是多了锁链与镶槽的束缚。'),
    ('The bottom of the crate is leaking. Leaking tears...', '箱子底部在漏。漏的是眼泪……'),
    ('The bowstring twangs with an eerie feline howl.', '弓弦发出诡异的猫科嚎叫。'),
    ('The bracers are solid, heavy, and possess a strong magical aura.', '护腕坚固厚重，带有强大的魔法气息。'),
    ('The branch glows with a calming light.', '树枝散发著安抚的光芒。'),
    ('The brew is still warm and bubbling.', '这酿酒还温热冒泡。'),
    ('The brew recipes contained in the book are written in a code known only to the Stormstouts.', '书中的酿酒配方用一种只有雷蹄氏族才懂的密码写成。'),
    ('The brilliance of Elune\'s grace shines through.', '艾露恩恩典的光辉穿透而出。'),
    ('The broken ones don\'t really sell.', '破损的其实卖不出去。'),
    ('The buds of this plant are heavy with liquid stored within.', '这种植物的花苞沉甸甸地蓄满汁液。'),
    ('The candle burns brightly, but the flame gives off no smoke.', '蜡烛烧得很亮，但火焰却不冒烟。'),
    ('The clasp is broken.', '搭扣坏了。'),
    ('The cleanest water in the Cape.', '海角最干净的水。'),
    ('The cold, blue stone hums when held.', '这块冰冷的蓝石在手中嗡鸣。'),
    ('The compartments don\'t seem to open...', '这些隔层似乎打不开……'),
    ('The compass still works!', '罗盘还能用！'),
    ('The core of Dryn Miel emanates a dark mist as you hold it in your hand.', '你把它拿在手中时，德林·米尔的核心散发出黑雾。'),
    ('The core of the woodcutting golem seems to hold a considerable amount of power, it can probably be repurposed for Lilly\'s device.', '伐木傀儡的核心似乎蕴含着相当多的能量，或许可以改用于莉莉的装置。'),
    ('The corruption seems to be spreading to you. Better get it to Gnarl quickly!', '腐化似乎正在蔓延到你身上。最好快点把它交给纳尔！'),
    ('The crate contains foodstuff and simple medical equipment.', '箱子里装着食品和简易医疗设备。'),
    ('The crate is loaded with farming equipment.', '箱子里装满了农具。'),
    ('The crate is soaked, but appears to still be watertight.', '箱子都湿透了，但似乎依然防水。'),
    ('The crowd liked what they saw.', '人群很喜欢眼前的景象。'),
    ('The crystal emanates a dim light from within.', '水晶内部透出微弱的亮光。'),
    ('The crystal seems to draw your eyes. Examining it closely reveals nothing special, until you realize that its shape changed without you noticing.', '这枚水晶似乎吸引着你的目光。细看之下并无特别之处，直到你发现它的形状已在不知不觉中改变。'),
    ('The crystal tears of a mountain giant.', '山岭巨人的水晶之泪。'),
    ('The current party or raid member becomes the target of your Tricks of the Trade.  The threat caused by your next damaging attack and all actions taken for  afterwards will be transferred to the target.  In addition, all damage caused by the target is increased by  during this time.', '当前小队或团队成员成为你「嫁祸诀窍」的目标。你下一次伤害性攻击及之后  内采取的所有行动所产生的威胁值都将转移给该目标。此外，在此期间目标造成的所有伤害提高  。'),
    ('The current party or raid member targeted will receive the threat caused by your next damaging attack and all actions taken for  afterwards.', '当前选中的小队或团队成员将承受你下一次伤害性攻击及其后  内产生的所有威胁值。'),
    ('The death knight takes on the presence of frost, increasing Stamina by %, armor contribution from cloth, leather, mail and plate items by %, and reducing damage taken by   Increases threat generated.  Only one Presence may be active at a time.', '死亡骑士呈现冰霜之姿，耐力提高 %，布甲、皮甲、锁甲与板甲提供的护甲值提高 %，受到的伤害降低 。  提高产生的威胁值。  同时只能激活一种领域。'),
    ('The delicious crunch comes from Silithid chitin! It\'s Sililicious! (tm)', '这美妙的口感来自异种虫甲壳！「异种美味」（tm）'),
    ('The depths go on forever.', '深处永无止境。'),
    ('The display shows 1. missed call: DARKNESS', '屏幕显示 1 个未接来电：黑暗'),
    ('The distilled tears of the elusive Flaskataur.', '难以捉摸的瓶魔牛怪蒸馏出的眼泪。'),
    ('The distinctive color of the chains is due to the blood of the prisoners who once wore them, which has oxidized and adhered to the metal over time.', '锁链色彩独特，源于曾佩戴它们的囚徒之血；这些血液经年氧化，已附在金属之上。'),
    ('The druid\'s skin becomes as tough as bark.  All damage taken is reduced by   While protected, damaging attacks will not cause spellcasting delays.  This spell is usable while stunned, frozen, incapacitated, feared or asleep.  Usable in all forms.  Lasts', '德鲁伊的皮肤变得如树皮般坚硬。受到的所有伤害降低   在受保护期间，受到攻击不会造成施法延迟。此法术可在昏迷、冰冻、无法行动、恐惧或睡眠状态下使用。所有形态下均可使用。持续'),
    ('The earth begins to rumble and your foes begin to tremble. You come, and destruction comes with you. -Gorsik the Tumultuous', '大地开始轰鸣，你的敌人开始颤抖。你到来，毁灭亦随你而来。——喧嚣者戈尔西克'),
    ('The edges are frayed and the parchment frail. You wonder how on Azeroth this could have survived and how it ended up here.', '边缘磨损，羊皮纸脆弱。你不由得好奇它在艾泽拉斯是如何幸存下来、又是如何来到这里的。'),
    ('The edges yearn for Illidan\'s Blood.', '刃口渴望着伊利丹之血。'),
    ('The egg appears to be damaged; it has a small crack. However, the embryo (seems to still be alive. Which Gryphon will hatch from this egg?', '这枚蛋似乎受损了，上面有一道小裂纹。不过胚胎似乎仍然活着。会从这枚蛋中孵出哪种狮鹫呢？'),
    ('The egg has hatched!', '蛋已孵化！'),
    ('The enchanted arrowhead is still razor-sharp.', '这支附魔箭头依然锋利如刀。'),
    ('The enemy target is swarmed by insects, decreasing their chance to hit by  and causing  Nature damage over', '敌方目标被虫群包围，命中几率降低 ，并在持续期间造成 点自然伤害，持续'),
    ('The entire shaft is covered with innumerable notches.', '整根箭杆上布满数不清的刻痕。'),
    ('The etching of a fallen warrior carved into the wake of the scroll', '卷轴末尾刻着一位陨落战士的画像'),
    ('The etchings of lives past lay in your hands', '往昔生命的刻痕尽在你掌中'),
    ('The eye still flinches occasionaly.', '那只眼睛还偶尔抽动。'),
    ('The eyes have been ripped out.', '眼睛被挖掉了。'),
    ('The fan-shaped crystals from the basilisk\'s head and limbs.', '蜥蜴头部与四肢的扇形水晶。'),
    ('The fel energies seething off of the spear\'s tip make your stomach turn.', '矛尖渗出的邪能令你胃里翻腾。'),
    ('The final, blood-stained page has been added.', '最后一页血迹斑斑的书页已被添上。'),
    ('The finest in Blood Elf jewelry was always made of ruby.', '血精灵最精美的首饰向来都是红宝石打造。'),
    ('The fish around here have very strange taste in food.', '这附近的鱼在食物上口味很怪。'),
    ('The fish around here sure have strange taste.', '这附近的鱼口味真是古怪。'),
    ('The flames of the Legion never die.', '军团的火焰永不熄灭。'),
    ('The flower was wilting before it was even plucked.', '这朵花在被摘下之前就已枯萎了。'),
    ('The forelegs are mostly intact - besides the torn nails and blood stained fur that is.', '前腿基本完好——只要忽略那些撕裂的指甲和血迹斑斑的皮毛。'),
    ('The fragment pulses with a life of its own.', '碎片像个活物一样脉动着。'),
    ('The frame alone is solid gold...', '光是框架就是纯金的……'),
    ('The freshest ingredients of the day!', '当日最新鲜的食材！'),
    ('The fruit inside is long rotten.', '里面的果子早就烂了。'),
    ('The future looks cataclysmic.', '未来一片灾变。'),
    ('The future of the black dragonflight may lie within this shell.', '黑龙军团的未来或许就在这枚卵里。'),
    ('The gems within this ring constantly shift, leaving you wondering which is truly at the top.', '这枚戒指内的宝石不断变换，让你难以分辨哪一颗才真正在最上方。'),
    ('The gnomecorder crackles and whirs.', '侏儒录音机噼啪作响、嗡嗡运转。'),
    ('The goblin\'s hand still clutches tightly to the orb.', '地精的手仍死死抓着那颗宝珠。'),
    ('The greatest glory in living lies not in never falling, but in rising every time we fall.', '人生最大的荣耀不在于从不跌倒，而在于每次跌倒后都能重新站起。'),
    ('The hairs in your nose start to shrivel and your stomache begins to churn.', '你鼻子里的毛开始卷曲，胃里也开始翻腾。'),
    ('The hands remain fixed at the time Darkshore was fractured.', '黑海岸碎裂之时，这些手就定格在那里。'),
    ('The head and base are missing.', '头部与底座都不见了。'),
    ('The head is intact and doesn\'t seem to have any visible deformaties.', '头部完好，看不出任何明显的变形。'),
    ('The head of Salanor, the exploration overseer.', '探索监督者萨拉诺尔的头颅。'),
    ('The head of a Naga Explorer.', '一个纳迦探险者的头颅。'),
    ('The head of an immense carnivorous plant, its roots reaching something that should never have been disturbed. Until the malevolent seed that serves as its profane heart is torn out, the fearsome Carnivaruz will continue to sprout and thrive.', '一株巨大食肉植物的头部，其根系触及了本不该被打扰的东西。除非作为它污秽之心的邪恶种子被拔除，否则可怕的卡尼瓦鲁兹将不断萌芽、肆意滋长。'),
    ('The head of the Black Dragonflight\'s Brood Mother - Horde Head', '黑龙军团的母巢首领之头颅——部落版'),
    ('The head of the great Zanzrakka, Hexed Scourge of Zul\'Gurub.', '伟大的赞扎卡拉——祖尔格拉布的被施咒天灾——的头颅。'),
    ('The hideous result of fusing the living plague of the Plaguelands with the bog beasts of Azeroth.', '瘟疫之地活体瘟疫与艾泽拉斯沼泽兽融合而成的丑陋产物。'),
    ('The hindlegs are strong and have a good amount of muscle still on them.', '后腿结实，上面的肉还有不少。'),
    ('The hip bone\'s connected to the...um...', '髋骨连着……嗯……'),
    ('The horn curves slightly to the left.', '号角略微向左弯曲。'),
    ('The hunter and raid members within  yards take on the aspects of a pack of cheetahs, increasing movement speed by   If you are struck under the effect of this aspect, you will be dazed for   Only one Aspect can be active at a time.', '猎人与  码内的团队成员化身为猎豹群，移动速度提高  若在此守护状态下受到攻击，你会眩晕  同时只能激活一种守护。'),
    ('The hunter takes on the aspect of the viper, causing ranged and melee attacks to regenerate mana but reducing your total damage done by   In addition, you gain  of maximum mana every  sec.  Mana gained is based on the speed of your ranged weapon. Requires a ranged weapon. Only one Aspect can be active at a time.', '猎人化身为蝰蛇守护，使远程与近战攻击恢复法力值，但你造成的总伤害降低  。此外，你每  秒获得  点最大法力值。所获法力值取决于你远程武器的速度。需要远程武器。同时只能激活一种守护。'),
    ('The hunter takes on the aspects of a beast, becoming untrackable and increasing melee attack power of the hunter and the hunter\'s pet by   Only one Aspect can be active at a time.', '猎人化身为野兽的形貌，变得无法被追踪，并使猎人与猎人宠物的近战攻击强度提高   同时只能激活一种守护。'),
    ('The hunter takes on the aspects of a cheetah, increasing movement speed by   If the hunter is struck, :she', '猎人进入猎豹形态，移动速度提高  如果猎人被击中， :she'),
    ('The hunter takes on the aspects of a monkey, increasing chance to dodge by   Only one Aspect can be active at a time.', '猎人进入猴子形态，闪避几率提高  同一时间只能激活一种外观。'),
    ('The illest of ill-gotten gains.', '不义之财中最病的那份。'),
    ('The initials A.L. are etched on the hilt.', '剑柄上刻着首字母 A.L.。'),
    ('The inscription reads: "Tessie\'s Perfect Pair"', '铭文写着：「泰西的完美一对」'),
    ('The intense flame brings you a sense of strength, and a sense of safety.', '这炽烈的火焰带给你力量感，也带给你安全感。'),
    ('The intials J.H. are inscribed on the inside of the ring.', '戒指内侧刻着姓名的首字母 J.H.。'),
    ('The jar\'s mouth will fit a fish, or a Hozu hand, but not both...', '罐口能塞进一条鱼，或一只豪族的手，但不能两样都塞……'),
    ('The label reads: Maximize your manliness by showing her you\'re worth nothing less than true gold.', '标签上写着：向她展示你的价值绝不亚于真正的黄金，以此彰显你的男子气概。'),
    ('The last rations left.  All the rest seem to have been eaten.', '最后的口粮。其余似乎都已被吃掉。'),
    ('The last souvenir from the Azzar Faire. A bit tacky as a gift, but colorful after all.', '来自阿扎尔集市的最后一件纪念品。作为礼物有点俗气，但终归花哨。'),
    ('The latest invention in wand technology. Property of Krakmon Incorporated', '魔杖技术的最新发明。克拉蒙公司财产'),
    ('The leathery vellum shows a map of the northeastern Kun-Lai mountains. Ancient symbols of power, drawn in dark red ink, radiate outward from the map\'s center.', '这张皮质羊皮纸上绘着昆莱山北部的舆图。以暗红色墨迹绘成的古老力量符号自图心向外散发。'),
    ('The leaves on this clover are mysteriously pristine.', '这株三叶草的叶片莫名地完好无损。'),
    ('The legendary uncatchable fish of Ironforge.  Just holding this scaly old monster makes you feel tough.', '铁炉堡传说中无法捕到的大鱼。  光是抱着这条鳞片斑斑的老怪物就让你觉得自己很壮。'),
    ('The limp hair and sagging flesh do little to diminish the sense of power once held by this trophy, severed from the gronn overlord Slaag.', '它取自格隆霸主斯拉格，干枯的毛发与松弛的皮肉并未削弱这件战利品曾有的威势。'),
    ('The magic has faded from this glyph, but the inscription is still beautiful.', '这枚符文石的魔力已经消散，但刻纹依然优美。'),
    ('The map seems to have been damp before being burried under the soft dirt. It is badly stained, but barely legible.', '这张地图在被埋入软土前似乎已经受潮。污渍严重，但仍勉强可辨。'),
    ('The mark of Baine Bloodhoof, High Chieftain of Thunder Bluff.', '雷霆崖大酋长贝恩·血蹄的印记。'),
    ('The material is identical to the scraps you found at the Furlbrow murder scene.', '这种材料与你在弗尔布罗谋杀现场找到的碎片完全相同。'),
    ('The most important part of a dwarf\'s diet.', '矮人饮食中最重要的部分。'),
    ('The naga plan to attack Southshore!', '纳迦打算进攻南海镇！'),
    ('The names of influencial nobility in Vashj\'ir in times long past.', '远古时期瓦丝琪尔有影响力的贵族名单。'),
    ('The negotiations appear to be planned down to the minute, including a dinner menu.', '这场谈判的安排精确到分钟，连晚餐菜单都定好了。'),
    ('The nicks and scratches on this axe tell the tale of its many errant swings.', '这柄斧头上的缺口与划痕，讲述着它多少次挥空的往事。'),
    ('The notched tip glows faintly. This looks like it is meant to be inserted into something.', '有缺口的尖端微微发光。看起来它本该被插入某个东西里。'),
    ('The oddly-shaped key is carved from a hard, dark stone.', '这把形状古怪的钥匙由坚硬的暗色石头雕成。'),
    ('The odds of finding this here must be one in a million.', '在这里找到它的几率必然是百万分之一。'),
    ('The official coin of the Azzar Faire to access the mini-games!', '阿扎尔集市的官方货币，用于参加小游戏！'),
    ('The once powerful elemental is little more than a knot of air in your fist.', '这个曾经强大的元素生物，如今在你手中不过是一团空气之结。'),
    ('The once-raging elemental has been rendered into a searing hot coal of anger.', '这曾经狂暴的元素生物，已被炼成一枚炽热的愤怒之炭。'),
    ('The operative word being "semi." These look like rocks.', '关键词是「半」。这些看起来就是石头。'),
    ('The orb is completely devoid of color. The longer you stare into it, the harder it becomes to look away.', '这颗宝珠完全没有颜色。你越是凝视，就越难移开视线。'),
    ('The pages are slowly turning to ash.', '书页正在慢慢化作灰烬。'),
    ('The pages are too heavily smudged with oil to read.', '这些书页浸满了油，实在看不清。'),
    ('The painting has seen better days. The woman it depicts, reclining on a bed of cushions, appears to suffer from a strange psoriasis. In truth, it is only the canvas cracked with age. Yet something about the portrait unsettles you. You cannot shake the feeling that her eyes follow your every move.', '这幅画已不复当年光景。画中斜倚在软垫上的女子似乎患有一种奇怪的皮肤病。事实上，那只是画布因年岁而龟裂。然而这幅肖像仍让你感到不安。你无法驱散那种她的目光始终追随你的感觉。'),
    ('The paladin sacrifices mself:herself', '圣骑士牺牲了自己'),
    ('The parchment is wet and sticky. Clearly the gnolls don\'t care for paperwork.', '羊皮纸又湿又黏。显然豺狼人并不在乎文书归档。'),
    ('The path of the faceroller is not the path to wisdom.', '脸滚键盘之道并非智慧之道。'),
    ('The perfect blend of spices and seasonings.', '香料与调味料的完美配比。'),
    ('The perfect skull.', '完美的头骨。'),
    ('The perfect, fresh-caught fish.', '完美的新鲜渔获。'),
    ('The perfect, fresh-hunted tallstrider.', '完美的新鲜猎物陆行鸟。'),
    ('The petals have a subtle smell that brings a sense of peace and calm.', '花瓣的淡淡香气带来一种平和宁静之感。'),
    ('The pollen from these flowers has a strangely acidic, citrusy smell.', '这些花的花粉有一股奇怪的酸涩柑橘味。'),
    ('The powder roils and sifts itself under its own power.', '粉末自行翻搅筛动。'),
    ('The power eminating from this seed marks it as a child of Nordrassil, twisted black by the flames of the Firelands.', '从这枚种子散发的气息可知它是诺达希尔的子嗣，却被火焰之地的烈焰扭曲成黑色。'),
    ('The power of creation courses through this weapon.', '创世之力流淌在这把武器之中。'),
    ('The power of voodoo!', '巫毒之力！'),
    ('The powers of the last black dragon are yours to wield.', '最后一条黑龙的力量任你驱使。'),
    ('The pulp in the juice gives it a unique thickness.', '果汁里的果肉赋予了它独特的浓稠感。'),
    ('The pumpkin is much heavier than you thought.', '这个南瓜比你想的要重得多。'),
    ('The reaped soul of a Ango\'rosh Stronghold Ogre. This item persists through death.', '一名安戈罗什要塞食人魔被收割的灵魂。此物品不因死亡而丢失。'),
    ('The reaped soul of a Area 52 Defender. This item persists through death.', '一名 52 区守卫被收割的灵魂。此物品不因死亡而丢失。'),
    ('The reaped soul of a Blade\'s Edge Outpost Defender. This item persists through death.', '一位刀锋山哨站守卫被收割的灵魂。此物品死亡后仍会保留。'),
    ('The reaped soul of a Hellfire Peninsula Outpost Defender. This item persists through death.', '一位地狱火半岛哨站守卫被收割的灵魂。此物品死亡后仍会保留。'),
    ('The reaped soul of a Mag\'har defender. This item persists through death.', '一名玛格汉守卫被收割的灵魂。此物品不因死亡而丢失。'),
    ('The reaped soul of a Nagrand Outpost Defender. This item persists through death.', '一名纳格兰哨站守卫被收割的灵魂。此物品不因死亡而丢失。'),
    ('The reaped soul of a Skettis Defender. This item persists through death.', '一名斯克提斯守卫被收割的灵魂。此物品不因死亡而丢失。'),
    ('The reaped soul of a Terokkar Forest Outpost Defender. This item persists through death.', '一位泰罗卡森林哨站守卫被收割的灵魂。此物品死亡后仍会保留。'),
    ('The reaped soul of a Zangarmarsh Outpost Defender. This item persists through death.', '一位赞加沼泽哨站守卫被收割的灵魂。此物品死亡后仍会保留。'),
    ('The remains of Loramus Thalipedes, the demon hunter.', '恶魔猎手洛拉姆斯·萨里比迪斯的遗骸。'),
    ('The remains of a Valiant Soldier', '一名勇武士兵的遗骸'),
    ('The resemblance is there.', '确实有点像。'),
    ('The ring becons to you.', '戒指在召唤你。'),
    ('The rituals for desecrating a fallen opponent are a well-established part of Mogu culture.', '亵渎败亡对手的仪式是魔古文化中根深蒂固的一部分。'),
    ('The road to Blackrock Mountain is paved with good intentions.', '通往黑石山的道路是由善意铺成的。'),
    ('The rogue\'s dodge chance will increase by  for', '盗贼的躲闪几率提高  ，持续'),
    ('The runes that make up this coded message continually shift.', '组成这条密文的符文不断变换。'),
    ('The rusted barbs on the net look especially painful.', '网上生锈的倒刺看起来格外疼。'),
    ('The same one she used to gather water every day.', '正是她每天用来打水的那一个。'),
    ('The sand keeps the teeth shiny.', '沙子让牙齿保持光洁。'),
    ('The scar of the mortal wound still blemishes the crown of this artifact.', '致命伤口的疤痕依然玷污着这件神器的顶端。'),
    ('The scraps fit together to form what was once a royal cloak.', '这些碎片拼起来曾是一件皇家斗篷。'),
    ('The seeds jump around in your bag, as if trying to escape.', '这些种子在包里乱跳，仿佛想逃跑。'),
    ('The seeds pulsate with a strange glow, ready to burst, given the right environment.', '这些种子脉动着奇异的光芒，只待环境适宜便会迸发。'),
    ('The seething flames of hatred.', '翻涌的仇恨之火。'),
    ('The shard of a powerful artifact used to apply Enchants from your Mystic collection', '一件强大神器的碎片，用于施加你秘法收藏中的附魔。'),
    ('The sheer quantity of coins makes this quite valuable.', '光是金币的数量就让它相当值钱。'),
    ('The sheer skill, you are a powerful adversary.', '如此精湛的技艺，你真是个强劲的对手。'),
    ('The shell seems to be intact... and moving?', '壳看起来还完好……但它怎么在动？'),
    ('The silk gleams with a soft brilliance.', '丝绸泛着柔和的光泽。'),
    ('The slightest noise causes this flower\'s petals to shiver.', '最轻微的声响都会让这朵花的花瓣颤动。'),
    ('The small coins only add up to a few gold, but a collector might find them worth something.', '这些小钱币加起来不过几枚金币，但收藏家或许会觉得它值点钱。'),
    ('The smell sends shivers up and down your spine.', '这股气味让你脊背发凉。'),
    ('The socket seethes, almost with an intelligence of its own.', '插槽翻涌着，几乎像有自己的意志。'),
    ('The soft sound of wind rings from the surface.', '轻微的风声从地面传来。'),
    ('The sorcerer king, Zian of the Endless Shadow used the light of this lantern to fuel his most powerful spells.', '无尽暗影的巫师王齐安曾用这盏灯笼的光芒为他的最强法术充能。'),
    ('The source of all monkey wisdom.', '所有猴子智慧的来源。'),
    ('The spearhead glows white hot.', '矛尖白热发光。'),
    ('The spirit refuses to leave the mortal plane, and will bind itself to items of great power.', '这缕灵魂拒绝离开凡间，会将自己束缚于强大的物品之上。'),
    ('The spoils of a seasoned brawler.', '一名老练斗士的战利品。'),
    ('The squirming cub refuses to leave the tree. It looks like you\'ll have to chuck it from the treetops.', '这只扭动的幼崽拒绝离开树木。看来你得把它从树梢上扔下去。'),
    ('The staff pulses with rushing tides.', '法杖脉动着奔涌的潮水。'),
    ('The stench from this tiny urn is sickly sweet and turns your stomach.', '这个小瓮散发出的臭味甜得发腻，让人反胃。'),
    ('The stench is unbearable.', '恶臭难当。'),
    ('The stitch that cures the itch!', '治愈瘙痒的缝线！'),
    ('The stone seems to breathe out a string of incomprehensible syllables.', '这块石头似乎在呼出一串难以理解的音节。'),
    ('The string appears to flicker, shifting between different states of time.', '弓弦似乎在闪烁，在不同时间状态间切换。'),
    ('The stunned body of a large, powerful crab.', '一只巨大而强壮的螃蟹被击晕的身体。'),
    ('The stunned body of a large, powerful crane.', '一只巨大而强壮的仙鹤被击晕的身体。'),
    ('The stunned body of a large, powerful tiger.', '一只巨大而强壮的猛虎被击晕的身体。'),
    ('The sun will shine tomorrow.', '明天太阳照常升起。'),
    ('The supplies that were gathered in the Sorrow Hill Crypt.', '在哀伤墓地中收集到的补给。'),
    ('The surface is clawed and bitten, but most of the supplies are intact.', '表面满是抓痕与咬痕，但大部分补给完好。'),
    ('The surface seems weathered and cloudy.', '表面看起来风化而浑浊。'),
    ('The swirling sap inside the orb is filled with what look like small, slow explosions.  Dropping this would be a bad idea.', '宝珠内翻涌的树液满是缓慢的小型爆炸。把它摔下去可不是好主意。'),
    ('The sword techniques of the Mantid are a carefully-guarded secret.', '螳螂妖的剑术是严守的秘密。'),
    ('The tablet is covered with undecipherable markings.', '石板上覆满了无法解读的标记。'),
    ('The tail seems perfectly preserved.', '尾巴保存得十分完好。'),
    ('The target becomes a Beacon of Light to all members of your party or raid within a 60 yard radius.  Any heals you cast on party or raid members will also heal the Beacon for  of the amount healed.  Only one target can be the Beacon of Light at a time. Lasts', '目标成为圣光道标，向 60 码内所有小队或团队成员提供指引。你对小队或团队成员施放的任何治疗也会治疗道标，治疗量为治疗量的  。同时只能有一个圣光道标目标。持续'),
    ('The targeted undead or demon enemy will be compelled to flee for up to   Damage caused may interrupt the effect.  Only one target can be turned at a time.', '被选中的亡灵或恶魔敌人将被强迫逃跑最多  造成的伤害可能打断该效果。  同时只能转化一个目标。'),
    ('The taurahe pictograms glow with magical incandescence.', '牛头人象形文字泛着魔法般的炽光。'),
    ('The teeth have all broken off.', '牙齿全都断了。'),
    ('The test has already begun.', '试炼早已开始。'),
    ('The text appears to be in an ancient language.', '这段文字似乎是用古老语言写成的。'),
    ('The three ministers\' spherules meld together to form an impressive gem.', '三位大臣的球体融合在一起，形成一颗令人惊叹的宝石。'),
    ('The tighter you hold, the more it tries to slip away.', '你握得越紧，它越想溜走。'),
    ('The twitching tentacle of a sea monster, taken down by a pirate ship with a bloody reputation.', '一只海怪抽搐的触须，由一艘声名狼藉的海盗船斩下。'),
    ('The ultimate fusion of vibration and cutting technology', '振动与切割技术的终极结合'),
    ('The ultimate prize for the ultimate brawler.', '给终极斗士的终极奖品。'),
    ('The unfortunate circumstances regarding the acquisition of this imprint are no longer documented.', '关于这份印记是如何获得的，其不幸的经过已不再被记载。'),
    ('The vial quivers with constrained energy.', '小瓶因受抑的能量而颤动。'),
    ('The warglaive lost all its power with its masters death. Combine the glaive with a Intact Vial of Lady Vashj or Kael\'thas Sunstrider to restore its power.', '这把战刃随着主人的死亡而失去全部力量。将其与瓦丝琪女士或凯尔萨斯·逐日者的完好小瓶结合，即可恢复其力量。'),
    ('The warm energy is filled with light, and you can hear someone\'s calling.', '那温暖的能量充满光芒，你能听到有人呼唤。'),
    ('The warning label depicts a dwarf kicking another dwarf in the privates.', '警示标签上画着一个矮人踢另一个矮人的要害。'),
    ('The warrior enters a berserker rage, removing and granting immunity to Fear, Sap and Incapacitate effects and generating extra rage when taking damage.  Lasts', '战士进入狂暴之怒，移除并免疫恐惧、闷棍与瘫痪效果，并在受到伤害时额外产生怒气。  持续'),
    ('The warrior shouts, causing up to  enemies within  yards to cower in fear.  The targeted enemy will be unable to move while cowering.  Lasts 6d.', '战士发出怒吼，使 码内最多  名敌人畏缩恐惧。  被选中的敌人在畏缩期间无法移动。  持续 6d。'),
    ('The weapon of the first Death Knight, Teron Gorefiend.', '第一位死亡骑士泰隆·血魔的武器。'),
    ('The whole is greater than the sum of its parts.', '整体大于各部分之和。'),
    ('The worms add flavor!', '虫子添了点风味！'),
    ('The worthless blade shattered to pieces. You doubt even the poor quality scrap metal is worth more than a copper piece.', '这把废铁刀刃碎成了一片片。你怀疑就连这劣质废铁也不值一枚铜币。'),
    ('There appears to be... \'mud\' in the firing mechanism, rendering the weapon useless.', '发射机关里似乎塞着……“泥巴”，让这把武器彻底无法使用。'),
    ('There are dings and dents all down the blade.', '整片刀刃上尽是凹痕与缺口。'),
    ('There is a bit of torn cloth attached to the pin.', '别针上还挂着一小片撕下的布。'),
    ('There is a faint etching across the blade.', '刀刃上有一道浅淡的蚀刻。'),
    ('There is a tiny note on the side: Wheeeeeeeeeee!', '侧面有一张小纸条：哇哦哦哦哦哦！'),
    ('There is an essence of evil surrounding you.', '你周围萦绕着一股邪恶的气息。'),
    ('There is no mention of the Forgemaster\'s whereabouts.  There is mention of a foreman\'s key in the tent nearby, however.', '文中没有提到锻造大师的下落。  不过，倒是提到了附近帐篷里的一把工头钥匙。'),
    ('There is something inside all that royal jelly...', '那么多蜂王浆里面有点东西……'),
    ('There might be something good inside!', '里面可能有好东西！'),
    ('There should be loot here, if you see me, message Sinstalis.', '这里应该有些战利品，如果你看到我，请联系辛斯塔利斯。'),
    ('There was tape holding it onto the claw...', '上面还粘着用来把它固定在爪子上的胶带……'),
    ('There were none so rapacious as the Bandit King, nor any whose bow proved so swift.', '论贪婪无人能及匪王，论弓法之迅捷也无人能出其右。'),
    ('There will be pain', '必将伴随痛苦'),
    ('There\'s a crack clean through it. You\'re not sure how much use it will be.', '上面有一道贯穿的裂缝。你不确定它还能用多久。'),
    ('There\'s a lengthy waiver inscribed on the inside of this belt. The writing is too small to read', '这条腰带内侧刻着一份冗长的免责声明。字太小，看不清'),
    ('There\'s blood on this patch that was torn from an SI:7 officer\'s uniform.', '这块从军情七处军官制服上撕下的布片上有血迹。'),
    ('There\'s just a bunch of gibberish scrawled on these pages!', '这些书页上只胡乱涂着一堆乱码！'),
    ('There\'s little left in these remains that resembles a wonka. Only its characteristic eyes confirm the species of the pieces.', '残骸中已几乎看不出旺卡的模样。只有它标志性的眼睛才能确认这些碎片的种族。'),
    ('These clever little devils burrow into Abyssal Clams and devour them from the inside.', '这些狡猾的小恶魔会钻进深渊蛤蜊体内，从内部将其吞噬殆尽。'),
    ('These don\'t look all that new or improved...', '这些看起来并不怎么新，也谈不上改进……'),
    ('These etched writings reveal certain secrets on the path to becoming a Demon Hunter.', '这些刻写的文字揭示了成为恶魔猎手之路上的某些秘密。'),
    ('These flowers grow up towards the sky, even in the darkest shadow.', '即便在最深的阴影里，这些花也向着天空生长。'),
    ('These keys are over-engineered. Must have been crafted by a gnome.', '这些钥匙设计过度精巧。准是侏儒造的。'),
    ('These leggings will guide you to the princely reign.', '这条护腿会指引你走向王者统治。'),
    ('These luscious berries are sweet and tangy. Only usable in the Molten Front.', '这些甘美的浆果又甜又酸。仅可在熔火前线上使用。'),
    ('These pandaren arrows are really sharp!', '这些熊猫人箭矢真的很锋利！'),
    ('These parchments seem to be written by Khadgar and directed to Bolvar Fordragon himself. These are invasion plans as well as the depictions of Khadgar\'s prayers to the Naaru and the Army of Light, even in absence they sent their guidance. You can feel a strange power emanating from this. A similar  faint signature seems to be nearby.', '这些羊皮纸似乎出自卡德加之手，收信人正是伯瓦尔·弗塔根本人。上面是入侵计划，也有卡德加向纳鲁与光之军团祈祷的描绘——即便他们不在场，也送来了指引。你能感到一股奇异的力量从中散发。附近似乎也有相似的微弱气息。'),
    ('These parchments seem to be written by Khadgar and directed to Warchief Thrall himself. These are invasion plans as well as the depictions of Khadgar\'s prayers to the Naaru and the Army of Light, even in absence they sent their guidance. You can feel a strange power emanating from this. A similar faint signature seems to be nearby.', '这些羊皮纸似乎出自卡德加之手，收信人正是酋长萨尔本人。上面是入侵计划，也有卡德加向纳鲁与光之军团祈祷的描绘——即便他们不在场，也送来了指引。你能感到一股奇异的力量从中散发。附近似乎也有相似的微弱气息。'),
    ('These pungent rags will halt bleeding... and possibly induce vomiting.', '这些刺鼻的破布能止住流血……也可能引发呕吐。'),
    ('These shards are pulsing with warm energy and resonate with each other.', '这些碎片脉动着温暖的能量，彼此共鸣。'),
    ('These shattered fragments contain immense Holy energy ready to be unleashed.', '这些碎裂的碎片蕴含着浩瀚的神圣能量，正待释放。'),
    ('These sturdy logs are dry and dense, ideal for stoking a magical flame. There\'s something ancient in their grain, as if they hold memories of countless fires.', '这些结实的木料干燥而致密，正适合助燃一团魔法火焰。木纹中透着某种古老气息，仿佛贮存着无数次火焰的记忆。'),
    ('These supplies were slightly damaged in the fighting, but Merchant Shi should have no problem selling them.', '这些补给品在战斗中略有损坏，但商人时应该不难把它们卖出去。'),
    ('These things are rock hard.  Literally.  Jojo may be getting in over his head.', '这些东西硬得像石头。字面意义上的。乔乔这下可能要吃瘪了。'),
    ('These unique inscriptions seem to resonate with your weapons! Channel the power of the Thunder!', '这些独特的铭文似乎与你的武器产生了共鸣！引导雷霆之力吧！'),
    ('These weapons were once crafted for powerful tol\'vir kings and generals.', '这些武器曾为强大的托维尔国王与将军打造。'),
    ('They make you look fat.', '它们让你显胖。'),
    ('They must go in that little jar at the bottom.', '它们必须放进最底下那个小罐子里。'),
    ('They seem to all involve killing and dismembering Troggs.  How long have these guys been down here?', '它们似乎都与杀害并肢解石腭怪有关。这些家伙到底在这儿待了多久？'),
    ('They shimmer with sadness and woe.', '它们闪着悲伤与哀愁。'),
    ('They slide right on down! Sometimes right back up, too.', '它们就这么滑下去！有时还会直接滑回来。'),
    ('They will fear you...', '他们会畏惧你……'),
    ('They won\'t hear you...', '他们听不见你……'),
    ('They won\'t see you...', '他们看不见你……'),
    ('They\'re going to be pretty pissed off when they wake up.', '等他们醒过来，一定会气得要命。'),
    ('They\'re starting to take you seriously.', '他们开始把你当回事了。'),
    ('They\'re surprisingly light.', '它们出乎意料地轻。'),
    ('Thick as molasses!', '稠得像糖蜜！'),
    ('Thick enough to reattach limbs.  Possibly heads.', '厚得足以接回四肢。可能还接得上头。'),
    ('Thick slabs of mouth-watering meat.', '厚厚几大块令人垂涎的肉。'),
    ('Thick, blood-soaked hair hides the map tattooed beneath.', '浓密浸血的头皮遮住了底下纹的地图。'),
    ('Thick, fragrant, and sweet.', '浓稠、芬芳而甜美。'),
    ('Thick, heavy scales cover the fish.', '厚厚的鳞片覆盖着这条鱼。'),
    ('Thick, sun-baked, and durable.', '厚实、经日晒、耐用。'),
    ('Thick, waxy and viscous.', '浓稠、蜡质、黏滑。'),
    ('This Cache contains Lesser Profane Essence and will award bloodforged relevant rewards based on your item level when the first raid is released.', '此宝箱内含有次级亵渎精华；在首个团队副本开放时，将根据你的物品等级给予血锻相关的奖励。'),
    ('This Cache gives you rewards based on your item level.', '这个宝箱会根据你的物品等级给出奖励。'),
    ('This Callboard Cache gives you rewards from Heroic Dungeons based on your item level.', '这个委托板宝箱会根据你的装备等级，给予英雄地下城的奖励。'),
    ('This Callboard Cache gives you rewards from Mythic Dungeons based on your item level.', '这个委托板宝箱会根据你的装备等级，给予神话地下城的奖励。'),
    ('This Carapace is extremely durable, perhaps someone may want to study it.', '这层甲壳极其坚韧，也许有人会想研究它。'),
    ('This Illidari Felstalker is lost on death.\nYou can earn a permanent Illidari Felstalker with Souls!', '这只伊利达雷恶魔犬会在死亡时丢失。\n你可以用灵魂换取永久的伊利达雷恶魔犬！'),
    ('This Insignia seems to be radiating with power, perhaps someone may want this.', '这枚徽记似乎在向外散发力量，也许有人会想要它。'),
    ('This Quest is only available at level 20. This item is not lost on death.', '此任务仅在 20 级可用。此物品不因死亡而丢失。'),
    ('This Relic of time is used to summon greater beings of Azeroth.\n\nJoin a party, and assemble at least 3 Heroes each with a Relic of Time and take them to Shrines of great beings to conjure them. This will summon the creature you wish to encounter!', '这件时间圣物可用于召唤艾泽拉斯的强大存在。\n\n组队并集齐至少 3 名各自持有时间圣物的英雄，带他们前往各强大存在的圣所即可将其召唤。这将召唤出你想要遭遇的生物！'),
    ('This Satchel Contains Purges and Scroll of Talent Unlearning.', '此挎包内含净化药水与天赋遗忘卷轴。'),
    ('This Token is a Global Token for Tier 1 Belt Slot items. This is Exchangeable at a Vendor found in Stormwind (Major Mattingly) or Orgrimmar (Overlord Runthak).', '此代币是用于 1 级腰部槽位物品的通用代币。可在以下商贩处兑换：暴风城（玛丁雷少校） or 奥格瑞玛（伦萨克）。'),
    ('This Token is a Global Token for Tier 1 Boots Slot items. This is Exchangeable at a Vendor found in Stormwind (Major Mattingly) or Orgrimmar (Overlord Runthak).', '此代币是用于 1 级Boots槽位物品的通用代币。可在以下商贩处兑换：暴风城（玛丁雷少校） or 奥格瑞玛（伦萨克）。'),
    ('This Token is a Global Token for Tier 1 Bracer Slot items. This is Exchangeable at a Vendor found in Stormwind (Major Mattingly) or Orgrimmar (Overlord Runthak).', '此代币是用于 1 级Bracer槽位物品的通用代币。可在以下商贩处兑换：暴风城（玛丁雷少校） or 奥格瑞玛（伦萨克）。'),
    ('This Token is a Global Token for Tier 1 Chest Slot items. This is Exchangeable at a Vendor found in Stormwind (Major Mattingly) or Orgrimmar (Overlord Runthak).', '此代币是用于 1 级胸部槽位物品的通用代币。可在以下商贩处兑换：暴风城（玛丁雷少校） or 奥格瑞玛（伦萨克）。'),
    ('This Token is a Global Token for Tier 1 Gloves Slot items. This is Exchangeable at a Vendor found in Stormwind (Major Mattingly) or Orgrimmar (Overlord Runthak).', '此代币是用于 1 级Gloves槽位物品的通用代币。可在以下商贩处兑换：暴风城（玛丁雷少校） or 奥格瑞玛（伦萨克）。'),
    ('This Token is a Global Token for Tier 1 Head Slot items. This is Exchangeable at a Vendor found in Stormwind (Major Mattingly) or Orgrimmar (Overlord Runthak).', '此代币是用于 1 级头部槽位物品的通用代币。可在以下商贩处兑换：暴风城（玛丁雷少校） or 奥格瑞玛（伦萨克）。'),
    ('This Token is a Global Token for Tier 1 Leg Slot items. This is Exchangeable at a Vendor found in Stormwind (Major Mattingly) or Orgrimmar (Overlord Runthak).', '此代币是用于 1 级腿部槽位物品的通用代币。可在以下商贩处兑换：暴风城（玛丁雷少校） or 奥格瑞玛（伦萨克）。'),
    ('This Token is a Global Token for Tier 1 Shoulder Slot items. This is Exchangeable at a Vendor found in Stormwind (Major Mattingly) or Orgrimmar (Overlord Runthak).', '此代币是用于 1 级肩部槽位物品的通用代币。可在以下商贩处兑换：暴风城（玛丁雷少校） or 奥格瑞玛（伦萨克）。'),
    ('This Token is a Global Token for Tier 2 Belt Slot items. This is Exchangeable at a Vendor found in Stormwind (Major Mattingly) or Orgrimmar (Overlord Runthak).', '此代币是用于 2 级腰部槽位物品的通用代币。可在以下商贩处兑换：暴风城（玛丁雷少校） or 奥格瑞玛（伦萨克）。'),
    ('This Token is a Global Token for Tier 2 Boots Slot items. This is Exchangeable at a Vendor found in Stormwind (Major Mattingly) or Orgrimmar (Overlord Runthak).', '此代币是用于 2 级Boots槽位物品的通用代币。可在以下商贩处兑换：暴风城（玛丁雷少校） or 奥格瑞玛（伦萨克）。'),
    ('This Token is a Global Token for Tier 2 Bracer Slot items. This is Exchangeable at a Vendor found in Stormwind (Major Mattingly) or Orgrimmar (Overlord Runthak).', '此代币是用于 2 级Bracer槽位物品的通用代币。可在以下商贩处兑换：暴风城（玛丁雷少校） or 奥格瑞玛（伦萨克）。'),
    ('This Token is a Global Token for Tier 2 Chest Slot items. This is Exchangeable at a Vendor found in Stormwind (Major Mattingly) or Orgrimmar (Overlord Runthak).', '此代币是用于 2 级胸部槽位物品的通用代币。可在以下商贩处兑换：暴风城（玛丁雷少校） or 奥格瑞玛（伦萨克）。'),
    ('This Token is a Global Token for Tier 2 Gloves Slot items. This is Exchangeable at a Vendor found in Stormwind (Major Mattingly) or Orgrimmar (Overlord Runthak).', '此代币是用于 2 级Gloves槽位物品的通用代币。可在以下商贩处兑换：暴风城（玛丁雷少校） or 奥格瑞玛（伦萨克）。'),
    ('This Token is a Global Token for Tier 2 Head Slot items. This is Exchangeable at a Vendor found in Stormwind (Major Mattingly) or Orgrimmar (Overlord Runthak).', '此代币是用于 2 级头部槽位物品的通用代币。可在以下商贩处兑换：暴风城（玛丁雷少校） or 奥格瑞玛（伦萨克）。'),
    ('This Token is a Global Token for Tier 2 Leg Slot items. This is Exchangeable at a Vendor found in Stormwind (Major Mattingly) or Orgrimmar (Overlord Runthak).', '此代币是用于 2 级腿部槽位物品的通用代币。可在以下商贩处兑换：暴风城（玛丁雷少校） or 奥格瑞玛（伦萨克）。'),
    ('This Token is a Global Token for Tier 2 Shoulder Slot items. This is Exchangeable at a Vendor found in Stormwind (Major Mattingly) or Orgrimmar (Overlord Runthak).', '此代币是用于 2 级肩部槽位物品的通用代币。可在以下商贩处兑换：暴风城（玛丁雷少校） or 奥格瑞玛（伦萨克）。'),
    ('This Token is a Global Token for Tier 2.5 Cloak Slot items. This is Exchangeable at a Vendor found in Stormwind (Major Mattingly) or Orgrimmar (Overlord Runthak).', '此代币是 2.5 阶披风部位物品的通用代币。可在暴风城（马廷利少校）或奥格瑞玛（伦萨克霸主）的商人处兑换。'),
    ('This Token is a Global Token for Tier 2.5 Neck Slot items. This is Exchangeable at a Vendor found in Stormwind (Major Mattingly) or Orgrimmar (Overlord Runthak).', '此代币是 2.5 阶项链部位物品的通用代币。可在暴风城（马廷利少校）或奥格瑞玛（伦萨克霸主）的商人处兑换。'),
    ('This Token is a Global Token for Tier 2.5 Ring Slot items. This is Exchangeable at a Vendor found in Stormwind (Major Mattingly) or Orgrimmar (Overlord Runthak).', '此代币是 2.5 阶戒指部位物品的通用代币。可在暴风城（马廷利少校）或奥格瑞玛（伦萨克霸主）的商人处兑换。'),
    ('This Token is a Global Token for Tier 3 Ring Slot items. This is Exchangeable at a Vendor found in Stormwind (Major Mattingly) or Orgrimmar (Overlord Runthak).', '此代币是用于 3 级Ring槽位物品的通用代币。可在以下商贩处兑换：暴风城（玛丁雷少校） or 奥格瑞玛（伦萨克）。'),
    ('This addictive substance will drive even the toughest fel addict into an intense, exhilarating rage.', '这种成瘾物质甚至能让最坚强的邪能成瘾者陷入强烈而狂喜的暴怒。'),
    ('This ancient Zandalari axe hums as if it\'s calling the spirit of its owner.', '这柄古老的赞达拉战斧低鸣着，仿佛在呼唤它主人的灵魂。'),
    ('This baby packs a kick!', '这小家伙劲儿可足了！'),
    ('This bag contains Loaded Starter Dice, which will allow you to reroll individual level 1 abilities at level 1 and will become available to all of your characters on this realm via your vanity collections.', '此包内装有已装填的起始骰子，可让你在 1 级时重掷单个 1 级技能；该物品会通过幻化收藏，对本服你的所有角色开放。'),
    ('This bill of sale, heavily worn and crumpled, is written in purple ink.', '这份磨损揉皱的卖据是用紫色墨水写的。'),
    ('This blood thrums with the combined fel essence of countless demons of the Burning Legion. Even in this small dose, the cosmic corruption permeates reality around it.', '这血液中搏动着燃烧军团无数恶魔的邪能精华。即便只是这一小份，宇宙的腐化仍渗透着它周围的现实。'),
    ('This bone is easily over 3 feet long.', '这根骨头足有三英尺多长。'),
    ('This book appears to be a racy romance novel.  The cover reveals a pastoral scene involving a muscular blonde man and a young woman wearing a tight bodice.', '这本书看起来像一部艳情小说。  封面描绘着一幅田园景象：一名肌肉发达的金发男子与一位身着紧身胸衣的年轻女子。'),
    ('This bow has no real variance.', '这把弓没有任何浮动。'),
    ('This box only contains the armor set. The Sanguine Embrace of the Hexflame Coven Spell Visual is sold as a seperate item. \n\nA Cosmetic set meant to be used with Transmogrification. You can see what Cosmetic Sets look like in the Vanity Collection. These can be obtained from other players, the auctionhouse, or the Ascension shop.', '此箱仅包含护甲套装。咒焰集会「血之拥抱」法术视觉效果作为独立物品出售。\n\n用于幻化的外观套装。你可以在幻化收藏中查看外观套装的样子。可从其他玩家、拍卖行或飞升商城获得。'),
    ('This bundle contains mostly intact trade goods of various origin.', '这一捆主要是保存完好的各类贸易货物。'),
    ('This burnt wood gives off an unmistakable smell. It\'s no wonder the gryphons respond to it so easily.', '这块烧焦的木头散发出一种无法辨错的气味。难怪狮鹫如此轻易就响应它。'),
    ('This cask looks like it hasn\'t been touched in quite a while.', '这个桶看起来已经很久没人碰过了。'),
    ('This cat\'s definitely seen better days.', '这只猫显然见过好日子。'),
    ('This coin has seen many journeys with Ji-Lu, but is almost unrecognizable due to tarnish.', '这枚硬币曾随吉鲁走过许多旅程，但因锈蚀已几乎辨认不出。'),
    ('This crude stone idol emanates a unique energy, you can feel the Great Hunter\'s power.', '这尊粗糙的石像散发着独特的能量，你能感受到伟大猎手的力量。'),
    ('This crystal is never exactly when you expect it, but it\'s always where it\'s going to be.', '这块水晶从不在你期待的时候出现，却总在它该在的地方。'),
    ('This delicious fruit is both juicy and tantalizing. Only usable in the Molten Front.', '这种美味水果多汁而诱人。仅可在熔火前线使用。'),
    ('This diary lovingly recounts Jack\'s time with the wild wolves of Azeroth.', '这本日记深情地记述了杰克与艾泽拉斯野狼共处的时光。'),
    ('This doesn\'t seem to be magical at all...', '这看起来根本不带魔法……'),
    ('This egg is hatching into something.', '这枚蛋即将孵出什么。'),
    ('This elaborate set of well-tied ropes seems to have been barely used.', '这套打结讲究的绳子看起来几乎没用过。'),
    ('This elemental\'s heart still burns with malice.', '这个元素生物的心脏仍在燃烧着恶意。'),
    ('This elixir is rumored to transform it\'s owner into a small water elemental. Usable by Syndicate\'s members only.', '据说这瓶药剂能把它的主人变成一个小型水元素。仅限辛迪加成员使用。'),
    ('This fancy contraption was invented by Big Bao.', '这台花哨的装置由大宝发明。'),
    ('This fish is no longer edible after having been wielded in combat.', '这把鱼被拿来当武器打过架，已经不能吃了。'),
    ('This fishing rod seems to have the number \'13\' engraved in it, along with numerous warnings to it\'s from it\'s past owners... What could go wrong?', '这根钓竿上似乎刻着数字「13」，以及历任主人留下的许多警告……能出什么问题呢？'),
    ('This flower seems out of place in the swamp, perhaps the flower is connected to some strange legend. Some priests who study such things may be able to tell you more.', '这朵花在沼泽中显得格格不入，也许它与某个奇怪的传说有关。研究此类事物的牧师或许能告诉你更多。'),
    ('This gunpowder stained cloak belonged to an uncommonly good-looking hunter.', '这件沾满火药痕迹的斗篷属于一位格外英俊的猎人。'),
    ('This half-beaten, leather-bound notebook has seen better days.', '这本半旧的皮革笔记本已经饱经沧桑。'),
    ('This hammer is heavy! The man that wielded it must have been strong indeed.', '这柄锤子真沉！能挥动它的人必定力大无穷。'),
    ('This hammer may appear holy, but its history is draped in sin...', '这把锤子看似神圣，但它的过往却尽是罪孽……'),
    ('This healing potion is only usable in Battlegrounds and its strength increases with your level. It can be used any amount of times.', '这瓶治疗药水仅可在战场中使用，其效力随你的等级提升。可无限次使用。'),
    ('This horn is the size of an orc!', '这号角有兽人那么大！'),
    ('This indecipherable stone tablet must mean something to somebody.', '这块无法解读的石板对某人必然意义重大。'),
    ('This is Muckgill\'s flipper or something.', '这是泥鳃的鳍之类的东西。'),
    ('This is a crystal shard of pure and warm radiant light.', '这是一块纯净温暖、光芒四射的水晶碎片。'),
    ('This is a legacy chest piece worn by Frostwolf chieftans for eleven generations.', '这是一件霜狼酋长们穿了十一代的传家胸甲。'),
    ('This is a lot of moolah!', '这可是一大笔钱！'),
    ('This is a measure of your participation and progress in this season. \n\nAccumulating these will unlock nodes on your seasonal UI granting you Seasonal Points!', '这衡量你在本赛季的参与度与进度。 \n\n积累这些将解锁你赛季界面上的节点，为你提供赛季点数！'),
    ('This is a very valuable gem', '这是一颗非常珍贵的宝石'),
    ('This is definitely a good souvenir for children.', '这绝对是送给孩子们的好纪念品。'),
    ('This is one big pillow.', '好大一个枕头。'),
    ('This is probably worth more than it looks like...', '这大概比它看起来更值钱……'),
    ('This is unusually heavy...', '这东西异常沉重……'),
    ('This is what a night elf looks like? The naga DO look better than them!', '暗夜精灵就长这样？纳迦确实比他们好看！'),
    ('This item can be used to unlock additional bank slots.', '此物品可用于解锁额外的银行栏位。'),
    ('This item is filled to the brim with arcane magic.', '这件物品充满了奥术魔法。'),
    ('This item is no longer in use.', '此物品已不再使用。'),
    ('This item is no longer used and can be safely sold to a vendor.', '此物品已不再使用，可安全卖给商人。'),
    ('This item starts a Quest, Requires Level-8', '此物品可开启任务，需要等级 8'),
    ('This item unlocks one Guild Bank slot.', '此物品可解锁一个公会银行栏位。'),
    ('This just brings you to a whole new level of disgusting.', '这东西把你的恶心程度提到了全新高度。'),
    ('This key is used to grant you access to a Fel Gateway to Escape the Apocalypse', '这把钥匙可让你进入逃离天启的邪能传送门。'),
    ('This key must be pretty tasty.', '这把钥匙一定很好吃。'),
    ('This key will unlock Drizle\'s chains.', '这把钥匙能打开德丽兹的锁链。'),
    ('This letter doesn\'t seem to be meant for you, but its intended recipient may want to see it.', '这封信似乎不是写给你们的，但它原本的收信人或许想看看。'),
    ('This living steel shifts between armor piercing spikes and defensive plates.', '这活钢在破甲尖刺与防御护板之间不断变换。'),
    ('This looks incredibly unsafe.', '这看起来极其不安全。'),
    ('This looks like it was once part of some kind of ornate naga weapon.', '这看起来曾是某种华丽纳迦武器的一部分。'),
    ('This looks like it\'s worth a coin or two...', '这看起来能值一两个银币……'),
    ('This looks quite valuable...', '这看起来挺值钱……'),
    ('This magical fire is cold to the touch. Nevermind that it burns underwater.', '这团魔法火焰触手冰凉。别管它在水下照样燃烧的事了。'),
    ('This makes me feel like a badass.', '这让我觉得自己很厉害。'),
    ('This mana potion is only usable in Battlegrounds and its strength increases with your level. It can be used any amount of times.', '这瓶法力药水仅可在战场中使用，其效力随你的等级提升。可无限次使用。'),
    ('This map indicates that something of value was buried near a giant anchor...', '这张地图显示，某样贵重物品被埋在了一只巨型船锚附近……'),
    ('This massive severed head once sat atop the shoulders of Grulloc, the most brutish of Gruul\'s sons. Its vacant cyclops stare still exudes primal ferocity.', '这颗巨大的断首曾安放在格鲁尔最残暴的儿子格鲁洛克肩上。它那空洞的独眼凝视仍散发着原始的凶性。'),
    ('This metal is unlike any you have seen.', '这种金属你从未见过。'),
    ('This might be real. It might not.', '这可能是真的，也可能不是。'),
    ('This must be the one!', '一定是这个！'),
    ('This must have slipped off of while someone was making a wish.', '这准是有人在许愿时掉下来的。'),
    ('This naaru crystal contains immense power.', '这颗纳鲁水晶蕴含着巨大的力量。'),
    ('This note contains a checklist of vital locations inside the city.', '这张便条上有城中的要害地点清单。'),
    ('This once-beautiful mirror is now tarnished, cracked and old.', '这面曾经美丽的镜子如今晦暗、开裂、老旧。'),
    ('This one looks mostly intact.', '这个看起来基本完好。'),
    ('This only affects the character using it.', '这只对使用者本人生效。'),
    ('This pie will make you very, very plump. In front of all your relatives.', '这块馅饼会让你变得非常非常丰满。当着你所有亲戚的面。'),
    ('This pole has a strangely alluring smell...', '这根钓竿散发着奇怪的诱人气息……'),
    ('This pompous Alliance leader is now a head shorter.', '这位傲慢的联盟领袖现在矮了一个头。'),
    ('This poor guy may have accidentally found Blingtron\'s power supply.', '这可怜的家伙大概是不小心找到了闪烁的能量源。'),
    ('This powerful consumable can be purchased from Beezlebub.', '这种强效消耗品可从别西卜处购买。'),
    ('This powerful pendant might come in handy some day. Try to not lose it.', '这枚强力吊坠也许哪天能派上用场。尽量别弄丢它。'),
    ('This projector is loaded with adolescent gnome fantasies.  This should be interesting.', '这台投影仪里装满了青春期侏儒的幻想。这下可有意思了。'),
    ('This report is soaked in dried blood. Its contents are barely legible.', '这份报告浸透了干涸的血。内容几乎无法辨认。'),
    ('This report was balled up and stomped on, but it can still be read.', '这份报告被揉成团还被踩过，但仍能读出内容。'),
    ('This ring appears to have eaten the 3 and 4 rings.', '这枚戒指似乎吃掉了 3 号和 4 号戒指。'),
    ('This ring was empowered by the princess of the blue dragonflight.', '这枚戒指被蓝龙军团公主赋予了力量。'),
    ('This rubbing is particularly illegible, save the name "Sargeras."', '这张拓本模糊难辨，除了一处：「萨格拉斯」。'),
    ('This runeblade\'s bearer suffered an unfortunate fall.', '这把符文剑的持有者曾遭遇了一次不幸的坠落。'),
    ('This rusty old yak shoe doesn\'t feel very lucky...', '这只生锈的旧牦牛蹄铁感觉不太幸运……'),
    ('This sample continues to shift and stir.', '这份样本仍在变化翻动。'),
    ('This satchel contains all things purging!\nOpening this satchel contains both a Talent and Ability Purge, as well as three Scrolls of Unlearning!', '这个小包满是净化之物！\n打开后可获得一份天赋与技能净化道具，以及三张遗忘卷轴！'),
    ('This scroll will teach you how to Dual Wield', '这卷轴会教你如何双持'),
    ('This scroll will teach you how to use 2 two-handed weapons , remember you should have dual wield learned to make it work', '此卷轴将教你如何使用两把双手武器，记住你需先学会双持才能生效'),
    ('This seems like the sort of the thing the Legion would NOT want to end up in prying hands.', '这种东西显然是军团绝不希望落入旁人手中的。'),
    ('This seems very old and unique but has lost its power, maybe there\'s a way to restore it.', '它看起来非常古老而独特，却已失去力量，也许有办法恢复它。'),
    ('This shard looks like it was once part of a trident.', '这块碎片看起来曾是一柄三叉戟的一部分。'),
    ('This shell is huge! And it sounds like something is chittering inside.... Teaches you how to summon Il\'ixx the Terrible.\n\nThis is a non-combat companion.', '这枚卵好大！里面似乎还有什么东西在窸窣作响……教你召唤可怕的伊尔伊克斯。\n\n这是非战斗伙伴。'),
    ('This shiny metal key will free Bold Karasshi and Admiral Taylor.', '这把闪亮的金属钥匙能救出勇者卡拉希与泰勒上将。'),
    ('This short staff groans and creaks in your hand, as if the wood is alive and still growing.', '这根短杖在你手中吱嘎作响，仿佛木头还活着、仍在生长。'),
    ('This should only be used in a safe place!', '只应在安全的地方使用！'),
    ('This sickeningly sweet incense seems to cast shadows when lit.', '这种甜得发腻的香点燃时似乎会投下阴影。'),
    ('This silver ore gives off a faint glow in the dark.', '这块银矿石在黑暗中发出微光。'),
    ('This slightly singed missive contains notes from a recent meeting.', '这份略有焦痕的函件记着一次近日会议的笔记。'),
    ('This small insignia marks the bearer as a member of the Dark Shaman.', '这枚小徽记表明持有者是黑暗萨满的一员。'),
    ('This smells rather nice.', '闻起来挺不错。'),
    ('This stone is added to your collection and usable on all characters with the Enslave Demon ability.', '这块石头会被加入你的收藏，可供所有拥有奴役恶魔能力的角色使用。'),
    ('This strange coin is emblazoned with Millhouse\'s manic grin. It is awarded for first completion of levels in the Manastorm. You can exchange these for great items at Millhouse Manastorm in your Capital City!', '这枚奇特的硬币上刻着米尔豪斯疯狂的笑容。首次通关法力风暴关卡时授予。你可在主城的米尔豪斯·法力风暴处用它兑换精良物品！'),
    ('This stuff looks serious.', '这东西看起来挺厉害。'),
    ('This succulent pome is bursting with sweet flavor. Only usable in the Molten Front.', '这颗多汁的果实满溢甜香。仅可在熔火前线使用。'),
    ('This tabard belongs to the current Arena 2v2 Champion.', '这面战旗属于当前竞技场 2v2 冠军。'),
    ('This thing is huge!', '这东西真大！'),
    ('This thing reeks of charred fish and moves of its own accord.', '这东西散发着焦鱼味，还会自己动。'),
    ('This tiny dark chunk of rock is so heavy, it takes all of your might to lift it!', '这块小小的深色岩石重得惊人，你得使出全身力气才抬得起来！'),
    ('This token is a Global Progression 0 Boots Token. This is Exchangeable at a Vendor found in Stormwind (Quartermaster Hadwin), Orgrimmar (Warbringer Krogash) or Booty Bay (Zazzle Refitwick)', '此代币是第 0 阶段Boots代币。可在以下商贩处兑换：暴风城（Quartermaster Hadwin）, 奥格瑞玛（Warbringer Krogash） or Booty Bay (Zazzle Refitwick)。'),
    ('This token is a Global Progression 0 Chest Token. This is Exchangeable at a Vendor found in Stormwind (Quartermaster Hadwin), Orgrimmar (Warbringer Krogash) or Booty Bay (Zazzle Refitwick)', '此代币是第 0 阶段胸部代币。可在以下商贩处兑换：暴风城（Quartermaster Hadwin）, 奥格瑞玛（Warbringer Krogash） or Booty Bay (Zazzle Refitwick)。'),
    ('This token is a Global Progression 0 Hands Token. This is Exchangeable at a Vendor found in Stormwind (Quartermaster Hadwin), Orgrimmar (Warbringer Krogash) or Booty Bay (Zazzle Refitwick)', '此代币是第 0 阶段手部代币。可在以下商贩处兑换：暴风城（Quartermaster Hadwin）, 奥格瑞玛（Warbringer Krogash） or Booty Bay (Zazzle Refitwick)。'),
    ('This token is a Global Progression 0 Helmet Token. This is Exchangeable at a Vendor found in Stormwind (Quartermaster Hadwin), Orgrimmar (Warbringer Krogash) or Booty Bay (Zazzle Refitwick)', '此代币是第 0 阶段Helmet代币。可在以下商贩处兑换：暴风城（Quartermaster Hadwin）, 奥格瑞玛（Warbringer Krogash） or Booty Bay (Zazzle Refitwick)。'),
    ('This token is a Global Progression 0 Legs Token. This is Exchangeable at a Vendor found in Stormwind (Quartermaster Hadwin), Orgrimmar (Warbringer Krogash) or Booty Bay (Zazzle Refitwick)', '此代币是第 0 阶段腿部代币。可在以下商贩处兑换：暴风城（Quartermaster Hadwin）, 奥格瑞玛（Warbringer Krogash） or Booty Bay (Zazzle Refitwick)。'),
    ('This token is a Global Progression 0 Shoulder Token. This is Exchangeable at a Vendor found in Stormwind (Quartermaster Hadwin), Orgrimmar (Warbringer Krogash) or Booty Bay (Zazzle Refitwick)', '此代币是第 0 阶段肩部代币。可在以下商贩处兑换：暴风城（Quartermaster Hadwin）, 奥格瑞玛（Warbringer Krogash） or Booty Bay (Zazzle Refitwick)。'),
    ('This token is a Global Progression 1 Boots Token. This is Exchangeable at a Vendor found in Stormwind (Quartermaster Hadwin), Orgrimmar (Warbringer Krogash) or Booty Bay (Zazzle Refitwick)', '此代币是第 1 阶段Boots代币。可在以下商贩处兑换：暴风城（Quartermaster Hadwin）, 奥格瑞玛（Warbringer Krogash） or Booty Bay (Zazzle Refitwick)。'),
    ('This token is a Global Progression 1 Chest Token. This is Exchangeable at a Vendor found in Stormwind (Quartermaster Hadwin), Orgrimmar (Warbringer Krogash) or Booty Bay (Zazzle Refitwick)', '此代币是第 1 阶段胸部代币。可在以下商贩处兑换：暴风城（Quartermaster Hadwin）, 奥格瑞玛（Warbringer Krogash） or Booty Bay (Zazzle Refitwick)。'),
