    ('This token is awarded to players whom survive the plague.', '此徽记授予在瘟疫中幸存的玩家。'),
    ('This totem represents Air, Earth, Fire, and Water.', '这个图腾代表着风、土、火、水。'),
    ('This troll\'s blood is thick enough to hold in your hand...', '这只巨魔的血浓稠得能在手里捧住……'),
    ('This unlocks Mystic Extracts. \n\nMystic Extracts are also obtained by reforging equipment using the Mystic Enchanting Altar.', '可解锁秘法萃取物。\n\n在秘法附魔祭坛上重铸装备也可获得秘法萃取物。'),
    ('This virmen foot has seen better days. The fur is worn and stained.', '这只兔妖的脚已经饱经沧桑。毛磨损发污。'),
    ('This visceral chunk of Blazerunner burns on, fueled by his hatred for you.', '布莱泽纳的这块血肉仍在燃烧，燃料是他对你的仇恨。'),
    ('This was a bear of very little brain.', '这是一头脑子很小的熊。'),
    ('This was left behind by the shade.', '这是那幽影留下的。'),
    ('This was unbelievably hard to find.', '这玩意的寻找难度简直难以置信。'),
    ('This waterlogged book tells you nothing.', '这本泡水的书什么也没告诉你。'),
    ('This will allow you to choose from a variety of full level 60 PvP sets.', '这将允许你从多种全套 60 级 PvP 套装中挑选。'),
    ('This will do just fine.', '这个正合适。'),
    ('This will have to do...', '只能凑合了……'),
    ('This will probably come in handy later...', '以后大概会派上用场……'),
    ('This would probably sell well to a real Death Knight.', '这东西应该能卖给真正的死亡骑士。'),
    ('This would\'a been a cool Northrend green, but you\'re at BlizzCon...', '这本该是件不错的诺森德绿装，但你在暴雪嘉年华……'),
    ('This would\'a been an awesome world drop, but you\'re at BlizzCon...', '这本该是世界掉落的极品，但你在暴雪嘉年华……'),
    ('This\'ll probably calm down any minute now.', '这大概过一会儿就消停了。'),
    ('Thoroughly clawed and pinched.', '被彻底抓挠和钳扯过。'),
    ('Though tempting, you know better than to steal what\'s inside.', '虽然诱人，但你知道不该偷里面的东西。'),
    ('Throw an Empty Heart Container! Whoever picks it up will have their maximum heart points increased by 0 hearts.', '投出一个空心生命容器！捡到它的人最大生命点将提高 0 颗心。'),
    ('Throws a distraction, attracting the attention of all nearby monsters for  seconds.  Does not break stealth.', '制造干扰，吸引附近所有怪物注意，持续 秒。  不会解除潜行。'),
    ('Throws your weapon at the enemy causing  damage (based on attack power), reducing the armor on the target by  for  or removing any invulnerabilities.', '向敌人投掷武器，造成  点伤害（基于攻击强度），使目标的护甲降低 ，持续 ，或移除其任何无敌效果。'),
    ('Throws your weapon at the enemy causing  damage (based on attack power).  This ability causes high threat.', '向敌人投掷武器，造成 点伤害（基于攻击强度）。  该技能会产生大量威胁值。'),
    ('Thunder. Thunder. Thunder Stones!', '雷。雷。雷石！'),
    ('Tight!', '紧绷！'),
    ('Tightly-sealed.  You can\'t find a way to open it.', '封得极紧。你找不到打开它的办法。'),
    ('Timing belt.', '正时皮带。'),
    ('Tingly to the touch.', '摸起来有刺痛感。'),
    ('Tiny blades meant for brutal arterial strikes.', '用于凶残地切断动脉的细小刀刃。'),
    ('Tiny holes in the hard shell are secreting some kind of caustic substance.', '硬壳上的小孔正渗出某种腐蚀性物质。'),
    ('Titan\'s Grip ?', '泰坦之握？'),
    ('To each his own.', '各有所好。'),
    ('To gaze into its depths is to witness the roiling madness of the Burning Legion condensed, screaming for release.', '凝视其深处，便能看到燃烧军团浓缩翻涌的疯狂，尖叫着渴望释放。'),
    ('Together for this life, and eternity beyond.', '此生相守，永生相伴。'),
    ('Tomalin\'s Seasoning Crystal', '托马林的调味水晶'),
    ('Too scared..', '太害怕了……'),
    ('Tormentor\'s Manacled Backplate', '折磨者的镣铐背甲'),
    ('Torn from a soldier\'s sash.', '从士兵的绶带上撕下来的。'),
    ('Torn from the grasp of a powerful alliance admiral.', '从一名强大的联盟上将手中撕下。'),
    ('Torn from the grip of a powerful horde warleader.', '从一名强大的部落战争首领手中撕下。'),
    ('Tortured Highborne souls bound within faint strands of magic.', '受尽折磨的上层精灵灵魂被束缚在微弱的魔法丝线中。'),
    ('Tosses the enemy target into the air, preventing all action but making them invulnerable for up to   Only one target can be affected by your Cyclone at a time.', '将敌方目标抛向空中，使其无法行动，但同时使其无敌，最多持续  你的龙卷风同时只能影响一个目标。'),
    ('Touched by the Divine', '受神眷顾'),
    ('Touching it makes your blood run cold.', '触碰它会让你的血都凉了。'),
    ('Transfers  of target\'s maximum mana every  sec from the target to the caster (up to a maximum of  of the caster\'s maximum mana every  sec).  Lasts', '每  秒从目标身上转移其最大法力值的  到施法者身上（每  秒最多为施法者最大法力值的 ）。  持续'),
    ('Transform into a Baby Monkey!\nThis is a rare and exclusive item.', '变成一只小猴子！\n这是一件稀有而独特的物品。'),
    ('Transformed beyond Recognition, a shadow of your former self.', '面目全非，你只剩从前的影子。'),
    ('Transforms the enemy into a frog. While hexed, the target cannot attack or cast spells. Damage caused may interrupt the effect. Lasts  Only one target can be hexed at a time.  Only works on Humanoids and Beasts.', '将敌人变成青蛙。被妖术影响期间，目标无法攻击或施法。造成的伤害可能打断该效果。持续  同时只能妖术一个目标。  仅对类人生物与野兽有效。'),
    ('Transforms the enemy into a frogduck, forcing it to wander around for up to 50 seconds. While wandering, the frogduck cannot attack or cast spells but will regenerate very quickly. Any damage will transform the target back into its normal form. Only one target can be polymorphed at a time. Only works on Beasts, Humanoids and Critters.\n\nDoes not consume on use. Only usable in the Manastorm.\n\n|cFF33FFF0Manastorm Utility|r', '将敌人变成一只蛙鸭，使其四处游荡最多 50 秒。游荡期间，蛙鸭无法攻击或施法，但会极快地恢复生命。任何伤害都会使目标恢复原形。同时只能变形一个目标。仅对野兽、类人生物与小动物有效。\n\n使用时不会被消耗。仅在法力风暴中可用。\n\n|cFF33FFF0法力风暴实用道具|r'),
    ('Transforms the enemy into a harmless Turkey, forcing it to waddle around for up to   While waddling, the turkey cannot attack or cast spells but will regenerate very quickly.  Any damage will transform the target back into its normal form.  Only one target can be polymorphed at a time.  Only works on Beasts, Humanoids and Critters.', '将敌人变成一只无害的火鸡，使其摇摇摆摆地走动最多  。游荡期间，火鸡无法攻击或施法，但会极快地恢复生命。任何伤害都会使目标恢复原形。同时只能变形一个目标。仅对野兽、类人生物与小动物有效。'),
    ('Transforms the enemy into a harmless black cat, forcing it to pussyfoot around for up to   While wandering, the cat cannot attack or cast spells but will regenerate very quickly.  Any damage will transform the target back into its normal form.  Only one target can be polymorphed at a time.  Only works on Beasts, Humanoids and Critters.', '将敌人变成一只无害的黑猫，使其悄步游走最多  。游荡期间，猫无法攻击或施法，但会极快地恢复生命。任何伤害都会使目标恢复原形。同时只能变形一个目标。仅对野兽、类人生物与小动物有效。'),
    ('Transforms the enemy into a harmless rabbit, forcing it to scamper around for up to   While wandering, the rabbit cannot attack or cast spells but will regenerate very quickly.  Any damage will transform the target back into its normal form.  Only one target can be polymorphed at a time.  Only works on Beasts, Humanoids and Critters.', '将敌人变成一只无害的兔子，使其四处蹦跳最多  。游荡期间，兔子无法攻击或施法，但会极快地恢复生命。任何伤害都会使目标恢复原形。同时只能变形一个目标。仅对野兽、类人生物与小动物有效。'),
    ('Transforms the enemy into a harmless serpent, forcing it to slither around for up to   While wandering, the serpent cannot attack or cast spells but will regenerate very quickly.  Any damage will transform the target back into its normal form.  Only one target can be polymorphed at a time.  Only works on Beasts, Humanoids and Critters.', '将敌人变成一条无害的蛇，使其蜿蜒爬行最多  。游荡期间，蛇无法攻击或施法，但会极快地恢复生命。任何伤害都会使目标恢复原形。同时只能变形一个目标。仅对野兽、类人生物与小动物有效。'),
    ('Transforms the enemy into a pig, forcing it to wander around for up to   While wandering, the pig cannot attack or cast spells but will regenerate very quickly.  Any damage will transform the target back into its normal form.  Only one target can be polymorphed at a time.  Only works on Beasts, Humanoids and Critters.', '将敌人变成一头猪，使其四处游荡最多  。游荡期间，猪无法攻击或施法，但会极快地恢复生命。任何伤害都会使目标恢复原形。同时只能变形一个目标。仅对野兽、类人生物与小动物有效。'),
    ('Transforms the enemy into a turtle, forcing it to wander around for up to   While wandering, the turtle cannot attack or cast spells but will regenerate very quickly.  Any damage will transform the target back into its normal form.  Only one target can be polymorphed at a time.  Only works on Beasts, Humanoids and Critters.', '将敌人变成一只乌龟，使其四处爬行最多  。游荡期间，乌龟无法攻击或施法，但会极快地恢复生命。任何伤害都会使目标恢复原形。同时只能变形一个目标。仅对野兽、类人生物与小动物有效。'),
    ('Transforms the target into something spooky.', '把目标变成某种阴森的东西。'),
    ('Troll relic that still holds remnants of ancient magic. Love and remorse, when intertwined, weave spells capable of moving the very stars. Upon the lofty peaks of the mountains of Dawnrise Island, where the ruins of the ancient City of Azdalar rise, a purpose for it may yet be found.', '一件仍残留古老魔法余韵的巨魔圣物。当爱与悔恨交织，便能织出足以移动星辰的法术。在黎明岛群山的峻峭之巅，古老的阿兹达拉城废墟矗立之处，或许还能为它找到用途。'),
    ('Troll-STYLE tartare, that is, my dear. Hee-hee!', '是巨魔风味的鞑靼肉，亲爱的。嘿嘿！'),
    ('Trophy of the Reborn Bonelord', '重生骨王的战利品'),
    ('True to form, it rattles with the unearthly sound of bones from within.', '它名副其实地摇响着体内骨头那般诡异的声响。'),
    ('Truly beautiful, wildly exotic.', '真正美丽，狂野而异域。'),
    ('Trust in the Light, but watch your mount.', '信仰圣光，但也看好你的坐骑。'),
    ('Try as you might, you find the inscriptions too faded to make out...', '无论你怎么努力，铭文都已褪色到无法辨认……'),
    ('Try not to get any in your eyes.', '尽量别弄进眼睛。'),
    ('Try to walk softly...', '尽量轻手轻脚……'),
    ('Turn autoloot on. Do not open without at least 13 Bag Slots free.', '开启自动拾取。没有至少 13 个空背包栏位时请勿打开。'),
    ('Turn autoloot on. Do not open without at least 4 Bag Slots free.', '开启自动拾取。没有至少 4 个空背包栏位时请勿打开。'),
    ('Turn in this reward token to Nix Winncket at the Azzar Faire.', '把这枚奖励代币交给阿扎尔集市的尼克斯·温克特。'),
    ('Turns the Shaman into a Ghost Wolf, increasing speed by  and regenerating  of your maximum health every 5 sec][]. As a Ghost Wolf, the Shaman is less hindered by effects that would reduce movement speed. Only useable outdoors.', '将萨满变为幽魂之狼，使速度提高 ，并每 5 秒恢复你最大生命值的 ][]. 作为幽魂之狼，萨满受减速效果的影响更小。仅可在户外使用。'),
    ('Ugh, what a mess!', '呃，真是一团糟！'),
    ('Uncommon High-Risk Materials are not lost on death!\n\nObtained from Disenchanting Bloodforged Gear.', '罕见的高风险材料不会因死亡而丢失！\n\n可通过分解血铸装备获得。'),
    ('Uncommon High-Risk Materials are not lost on death!\n\nObtained from Mining Nodes in Tier 1, 2 and 3 High-Risk zones.', '罕见的高风险材料不会因死亡而丢失！\n\n可通过高风险 1、2、3 级区域的矿脉获得。'),
    ('Uncommon High-Risk Materials are not lost on death!\n\nObtained from Skinning Beasts in Tier 1, 2 and 3 High-Risk zones.', '罕见的高风险材料不会因死亡而丢失！\n\n可通过在高风险 1、2、3 级区域剥皮野兽获得。'),
    ('Uncommon High-Risk Materials are not lost on death!\n\nObtained from Tier 2 & 3 High-Risk zones.', '罕见的高风险材料不会因死亡而丢失！\n\n可通过高风险 2 级与 3 级区域获得。'),
    ('Uncommon High-Risk Materials are not lost on death!\n\nObtained from gathering Herbs Nodes in Tier 1, 2 and 3 High-Risk zones.', '罕见的高风险材料不会因死亡而丢失！\n\n可通过在高风险 1、2、3 级区域采集草药节点获得。'),
    ('Uncommon High-Risk Materials are not lost on death!\n\nObtained from herb nodes in High-Risk tier zones.', '罕见的高风险材料不会因死亡而丢失！\n\n可通过高风险等级区域的草药节点获得。'),
    ('Uncommon High-Risk Materials are not lost on death!\n\nObtained from mining nodes in High-Risk Tier zones.', '罕见的高风险材料不会因死亡而丢失！\n\n可通过高风险等级区域的矿脉获得。'),
    ('Uncommon High-Risk Materials are not lost on death!\n\nObtained from skinning beasts in High-Risk Tier zones.', '罕见的高风险材料不会因死亡而丢失！\n\n可通过在高风险等级区域剥皮野兽获得。'),
    ('Uncommon High-Risk Materials are not lost on death!\n\nObtained from slaying Beasts in High-Risk Tier zones.', '罕见的高风险材料不会因死亡而丢失！\n\n可通过在高风险等级区域杀死野兽获得。'),
    ('Uncommon High-Risk Materials are not lost on death!\n\nObtained from slaying Beasts in Tier 1, 2 and 3 High-Risk zones.', '罕见的高风险材料不会因死亡而丢失！\n\n可通过在高风险 1、2、3 级区域杀死野兽获得。'),
    ('Uncommon High-Risk Materials are not lost on death!\n\nObtained from slaying Humanoids in Tier 1, 2 and 3 High-Risk zones.', '罕见的高风险材料不会因死亡而丢失！\n\n可通过在高风险 1、2、3 级区域杀死人形生物获得。'),
    ('Uncommon High-Risk Materials are not lost on death!\n\nObtained from slaying humanoids in High-Risk Tier zones.', '罕见的高风险材料不会因死亡而丢失！\n\n可通过在高风险等级区域杀死人形生物获得。'),
    ('Uncommon High-Risk Materials are not lost on death!\n\nShared High-Risk Party Loot!', '罕见的高风险材料不会因死亡而丢失！\n\n高风险小队共享战利品！'),
    ('Uncommon High-Risk Materials are not lost on death!\n\nShared High-Risk Party Loot!\nObtained from Tier 2 & 3 High-Risk zones.', '罕见高风险材料不会因死亡而丢失！\n\n高风险队伍共享拾取！\n从高风险 2 级与 3 级区域获得。'),
    ('Uncover 5 Golden Sealed Cards you can use at level 20 to guarantee future spell rolls.\nThese Skillcards apply to all specializations, persist through death, and will apply to your next run.', '发现 5 张金色密封卡，可在 20 级时使用以保证未来的法术抽取。\n这些技能卡适用于所有专精，可跨死亡保留，并将应用于你的下一次闯关。'),
    ('Uncover a Skill Card used to help your future heroes.', '发现一张技能卡，可用来帮助你的未来英雄。'),
    ('Unfamiliar markings form a mesmerizing pattern across this parchment.', '陌生的标记在这张羊皮纸上形成令人着迷的图案。'),
    ('Unfortunately for the user, it didn\'t work.', '遗憾的是，对使用者来说它没起作用。'),
    ('Unfortunately, this is just a map to a local bar where sailors like to drink when they\'re in town.', '不幸的是，这只是本地一家水手们爱在进城时光顾的酒馆地图。'),
    ('Unharmed and food-safe.', '完好无损，且符合食品安全。'),
    ('Unknown symbols are etched on its surface.', '表面刻着未知的符号。'),
    ('Unleash the fruit from the harvest!', '释放采收的果实！'),
    ('Unleash the power of the fragment and transform the user into a Void-Touched Goblin.', '释放碎片的能量，将使用者变为一名虚空触碰的地精。'),
    ('Unleash the wings of the Void', '释放虚空之翼'),
    ('Unleashes the energy of a Seal spell to judge an enemy for d, giving each attack a chance to restore  of the attacker\'s base mana.  Refer to individual Seals for additional Judgement effect.  Only one Judgement per Paladin can be active at any one time.', '释放圣印的能量审判一名敌人，持续 d，使每次攻击都有几率恢复攻击者基础法力值的  。各圣印的审判效果参见对应圣印说明。每名圣骑士同时只能有一个审判效果。'),
    ('Unleashes the energy of a Seal spell to judge an enemy for d, granting attacks made against the judged enemy a chance of healing the attacker for  of their maximum health.  Refer to individual Seals for additional Judgement effect.  Only one Judgement per Paladin can be active at any one time.', '释放圣印的能量审判一名敌人，持续 d，使针对被审判敌人的攻击有几率治疗攻击者，治疗量为攻击者最大生命值的  。各圣印的审判效果参见对应圣印说明。每名圣骑士同时只能有一个审判效果。'),
    ('Unleashes the energy of a Seal spell to judge an enemy for d, preventing them from fleeing and limiting their movement speed.  Refer to individual Seals for additional Judgement effect.  Only one Judgement per Paladin can be active at any one time.', '释放圣印的能量审判一名敌人，持续 d，使其无法逃跑并限制其移动速度。各圣印的审判效果参见对应圣印说明。每名圣骑士同时只能有一个审判效果。'),
    ('Unlike most casters, a Death Knight\'s spells cause double damage on critical hits.', '与大多数施法者不同，死亡骑士的法术暴击时会造成双倍伤害。'),
    ('Unlock the Pure Potential of Arcane Energy!', '释放奥术能量的纯粹潜能！'),
    ('Unlocks the Horde spy\'s arcane shackles.', '解锁部落间谍的奥术镣铐。'),
    ('Unlocks the opportunity to switch between specialization I and specialization II and unlocks an additional Mystic Enchanting Specialization.\n\nAvailable from the Auction House, Honor, Bazaar Tokens or from the shop.', '解锁在专精 I 与专精 II 之间切换的机会，并解锁一个额外的神秘附魔专精。\n\n可从拍卖行、荣誉、集市代币或商城获得。'),
    ('Unlocks the opportunity to switch to specialization III and unlocks an additional Mystic Enchanting Specialization.\n\nAvailable from the Auction House, Honor, Bazaar Tokens or from the shop.', '解锁切换至专精 III 的机会，并解锁一个额外的神秘附魔专精。\n\n可从拍卖行、荣誉、集市代币或商城获得。'),
    ('Unlocks the opportunity to switch to specialization IV and unlocks an additional Mystic Enchanting Specialization.\n\nAvailable from the Auction House, Honor, Bazaar Tokens or from the shop.', '解锁切换至专精 IV 的机会，并解锁一个额外的神秘附魔专精。\n\n可从拍卖行、荣誉、集市代币或商城获得。'),
    ('Unlocks the opportunity to switch to specialization V and unlocks an additional Mystic Enchanting Specialization.\n\nAvailable from the Auction House, Honor, Bazaar Tokens or from the shop.', '解锁切换至专精 V 的机会，并解锁一个额外的神秘附魔专精。\n\n可从拍卖行、荣誉、集市代币或商城获得。'),
    ('Unlocks the opportunity to switch to specialization VI and unlocks an additional Mystic Enchanting Specialization.\n\nAvailable from the Auction House, Honor, Bazaar Tokens or from the shop.', '解锁切换至专精 VI 的机会，并解锁一个额外的神秘附魔专精。\n\n可从拍卖行、荣誉、集市代币或商城获得。'),
    ('Unnaturally cold to the touch.', '摸起来异常冰冷。'),
    ('Upon coming in contact with the Amulet, a smooth, chilling breeze brushes by..', '一接触这枚护符，便有柔和的寒意拂过……'),
    ('Upon shattering the Frozen Throne, he donned the helm and inherited the Lich King\'s powers.', '击碎冰封王座后，他戴上了头盔，继承了巫妖王的力量。'),
    ('Upon this iron disk are stamped the words: "Footman Malakai Stone"', '这块铁盘上压印着：「步兵 玛拉凯·斯通」'),
    ('Usable at Refer-a-tron 1000.', '可在推荐机 1000 上使用。'),
    ('Use me!\n\nContains a Random Mystic Scroll for any |cff0070ddRare|r or |cffa335eeEpic|r Mystic enchantment', '使用我！\n\n内含一份随机秘法卷轴，对应任意 |cff0070dd稀有|r 或 |cffa335ee史诗|r 秘法附魔'),
    ('Use on a cow to collect fresh milk.', '对一头奶牛使用以收集鲜奶。'),
    ('Use the Master\'s Tome of Specialization to unlock the next unknown Specialization between 8 to 20. Consume multiple tomes to progressively unlock new Specializations up to 20.', '使用专精大师的法典，解锁 8 至 20 之间的下一个未知专精。多次使用法典可逐步解锁新的专精，最多至 20。'),
    ('Use this item to instantly create a guild!', '使用此物品可立即创建公会！'),
