    ('Useable materials salvaged from the ruins of Dalaran. Give three of these to Dalaran Workers to help them rebuild the city.', '从达拉然废墟中回收的可用材料。给达拉然工人三份以帮助他们重建城市。'),
    ('Used at Mystic Altars found in the world or summoned in capital cities to apply Mystic Enchants.\n\nYou can learn more about Mystic Orbs by using a Mystic Altar or following the Path to Ascension: Seeking Power and Mystic Extracts at level 60.', '用于世界上或主城召唤的神秘祭坛，以施加神秘附魔。\n\n你可以在 60 级通过使用神秘祭坛或完成「飞升之路：追寻力量与神秘萃取物」了解更多神秘宝珠的信息。'),
    ('Used by Blacksmiths in the creation of powerful items.', '被铁匠用于制作强大的物品。'),
    ('Used by Engineers in the creation of marvelous items.', '被工程师用于制作神奇物品。'),
    ('Used by High Coil seamen.', '高等盘蛇海员常用。'),
    ('Used by Rangers to craft various augments.', '游侠用来制作各种强化的材料。'),
    ('Used by Scribes in the creation of powerful objects.', '被抄写员用于制作强大的物品。'),
    ('Used by Yaungol medicine men to detect changes in the weather.', '野牛人医师用来探测天气变化。'),
    ('Used by cultists to control the ziggurats that circle the Fungal Vale.', '被教徒用于控制环绕真菌谷的通灵塔。'),
    ('Used by mantid amberweavers to spin structures of hardened amber.', '螳螂妖琥珀织者用来纺造硬化琥珀结构的工具。'),
    ('Used by scribes to make quills.', '抄写员用来制作羽毛笔。'),
    ('Used for crafting powerful items.', '用于制作强力的物品。'),
    ('Used in Cooking.', '用于烹饪。'),
    ('Used to call upon a companion', '用于召唤一名同伴'),
    ('Used to call upon the spirit of Frederick Thomas', '用于召唤弗雷德里克·托马斯的灵魂'),
    ('Used to dispel Ranial\'s curse.', '用于驱散拉尼尔的诅咒。'),
    ('Used to fuel the Zoram\'gar Lighthouse.', '用于为佐拉姆加灯塔供能。'),
    ('Used to grant levels as part of the Recruit-a-Friend feature.', '作为招募好友功能的一部分，用于授予等级。'),
    ('Used to learn a new 3 Ability Essence talent by clicking on its icon in Character Advancement, this will unlearn a 3 Ability Essence talent you already have.', '用于在角色成长界面点击图标学习一个新的 3 技能精华天赋；这会遗忘你已有的一个 3 技能精华天赋。'),
