    ('You attempt to disengage from combat, leaping backwards. Can only be used while in combat.', '你尝试脱离战斗向后跃开。仅可在战斗中使用。'),
    ('You become as hard to stop as death itself.  The duration of all Stun and Fear effects used against you is reduced by 10%, and your mounted speed is increased by 10%.  This does not stack with other movement speed increasing effects.', '你变得如死亡本身般不可阻挡。所有针对你的昏迷与恐惧效果持续时间缩短 10%，坐骑速度提高 10%。此效果不与其它移动速度提高效果叠加。'),
    ('You become as hard to stop as death itself.  The duration of all Stun and Fear effects used against you is reduced by 20%, and your mounted speed is increased by 20%.  This does not stack with other movement speed increasing effects.', '你变得如死亡本身般不可阻挡。所有针对你的昏迷与恐惧效果持续时间缩短 20%，坐骑速度提高 20%。此效果不与其它移动速度提高效果叠加。'),
    ('You become encased in a block of ice, protecting you from all physical attacks and spells for d, but during that time you cannot attack, move or cast spells.  Also causes Hypothermia, preventing you from recasting Ice Block for 25d.', '你被封入一块寒冰之中，d 内免疫所有物理攻击与法术，但在此期间无法攻击、移动或施法。同时使你陷入失温状态，25d 内无法再次施放寒冰屏障。'),
    ('You can almost see yourself reflected on the surface.', '你几乎能在表面看到自己的倒影。'),
    ('You can barely make out the markings on this parchment.', '你勉强能辨认出这张羊皮纸上的标记。'),
    ('You can feel Anger, Suffering, and even Desire.', '你能感受到愤怒、苦难，甚至欲望。'),
    ('You can feel it silently howling with conflicting energies.', '你能听到它在冲突能量中无声地嚎叫。'),
    ('You can feel the Nature\'s energy pulsating in your palm.', '你能感觉到自然能量在掌心搏动。'),
    ('You can feel the energy within and it\'s almost as if it\'s dragging you somewhere... It\'s so faint and it\'s disappearing rapidly but you can sense there\'s more nearby.', '你能感觉到其中的能量，几乎像是它在拖拽你去某个地方……如此微弱，又消失得飞快，但你能察觉到附近还有更多。'),
    ('You can feel the key crumbling away beneath your fingers.', '你能感觉到钥匙在指间一点点碎裂。'),
    ('You can feel the key crumbling beneath your fingertips.', '你能感觉到钥匙在指尖下碎裂。'),
    ('You can make out the words with some difficulty.', '你费了些力气才辨认出这些字。'),
    ('You can only hope this meat is what Arnith stocked.', '你只能指望这块肉就是阿尼斯囤的那种。'),
    ('You can reroll your starter spells through Character Advancement (Hotkey N) before reaching level 10.', '在达到 10 级前，你可以通过角色进阶（快捷键 N）重投初始法术。'),
    ('You can target Enchanting Vellum instead of a armor to store the enchantment for later use.', '你可以将附魔目标设为附魔羊皮纸而非护甲，以便日后使用。'),
    ('You can target Enchanting Vellum instead of a weapon to store the enchantment for later use.', '你可以将附魔目标设为附魔羊皮纸而非武器，以便日后使用。'),
    ('You can\'t imagine how much force it would take to compress this as a spring.', '你无法想象要把它压成一根弹簧需要多大力量。'),
    ('You cannot contain the Darkness.', '你无法容纳黑暗。'),
    ('You cannot help but admire the quality of this gear.', '你不禁要赞叹这身装备的做工。'),
    ('You charge your off-hand weapon with lava, instantly dealing  off-hand Weapon damage. Damage is increased by  if your off-hand weapon is enchanted with Flametongue.', '以熔岩灌注你的副手武器，立即造成  点副手武器伤害。若你的副手武器附有火舌效果，伤害会提高 。'),
    ('You could cover an entire wagon with this thing!', '这东西够盖住一整辆马车！'),
    ('You deal  weapon damage, refreshing the current Sting on your target and triggering an effect:\n\nSerpent Sting - Instantly deals 40% of the damage done by your Serpent Sting.\n\nViper Sting - Instantly restores mana to you equal to 60% of the total amount drained by your Viper Sting.\n\nScorpid Sting - Attempts to Disarm the target for 10 sec. This effect cannot occur more than once per 1 minute.', '你造成  点武器伤害，刷新目标身上的当前钉刺并触发效果：\n\n毒蛇钉刺 - 立即造成你毒蛇钉刺所造成伤害的 40%。\n\n蝰蛇钉刺 - 立即为你恢复相当于蝰蛇钉刺总吸取量 60% 的法力值。\n\n蝎刺 - 尝试缴械目标 10 秒。此效果每 1 分钟最多触发一次。'),
