    ('You do not think anything you could attempt would destroy this ring.', '你认为无论做什么都无法摧毁这枚戒指。'),
    ('You feel the crate\'s contents sloshing around inside.', '你能感觉到箱子里的东西在晃荡。'),
    ('You gain  of your total mana over d, but the amount healed by your Flash of Light, Holy Light, and Holy Shock spells is reduced by .', '你在 d 内获得 点总法力，但你圣光闪现、圣光术与神圣震击法术的治疗量降低 。'),
