    ('You have a  chance after dodging, parrying or taking  direct damage to gain the Scent of Blood effect, causing your next melee hit to generate 10 runic power.', '你在躲闪、招架或受到  点直接伤害后，有  的几率获得鲜血气息效果，使你下一次近战命中产生 10 点符文能量。'),
