    ('Your finishing moves can no longer be dodged, and the damage dealt by your Sinister Strike, Backstab, Shiv, Hemorrhage and Gouge abilities is increased by .', '你的终结技不再能被躲闪，且你的邪恶攻击、背刺、毒伤、出血与凿击造成的伤害提高 。'),
