    ('Zooms in the hunter\'s vision.  Only usable outdoors.  Lasts', '放大猎人的视野。仅在户外可用。持续'),
    ('an Immolate or Shadowflame effect on the enemy target to instantly deal damage equal to  of your Immolate or Shadowflame, and causes an additional  damage over', '消耗敌方目标身上的献祭或暗影烈焰效果，立即造成相当于你献祭或暗影烈焰  的伤害，并在  内额外造成  点伤害'),
    ('become smaller', '变小'),
    ('beer', '啤酒'),
    ('fter Arthas left for Northrend, Rivendare sent a shipment of food to a village of Lordaeron where Thomas Thomson happened to be. When the villagers turned into mindless zombies, Thomas understood that Rivendare is a traitor. Baron Rivendare was notorious for carrying this pocket during that encounter. For that matter, with him all of the time. . . get it?', '阿尔萨斯前往诺森德后，瑞文戴尔将一批食物运往洛丹伦的一个村庄，托马斯·汤姆森恰好在那里。当村民们变成无意识的僵尸时，托马斯明白了瑞文戴尔是个叛徒。瑞文戴尔男爵在那次遭遇中以携带此口袋而臭名昭著。就此而言，他始终带着它……明白了吗？'),
    ('made a pact, long ago, to fight against the forces of chaos using its own terrible powers against it. These mysterious warriors ritually blind themselves so that they develop \'spectral sight\' that enables them to see demons and undead with greater clarity', '很久以前立下契约，以自身可怖的力量对抗混沌势力。这些神秘战士通过仪式自毁双目，从而获得「幽灵视觉」，使他们能更清晰地看见恶魔与亡灵'),
    ('makes the caster invisible, reducing all threat.][Fades the caster to invisibility over d, reducing threat each second.]  The effect is cancelled if you perform any actions.  While invisible, you can only see other invisible targets and those who can see invisible.  Lasts 12d.', '使施法者隐形，并降低所有威胁值。][使施法者在 d 内渐隐，每秒降低威胁值。]  若你执行任何操作，效果将被取消。隐形期间，你只能看见其它隐形目标以及能看见隐形的人。持续 12d。'),
    ('of all damage taken by party members within  yards is redirected to the Paladin (up to a maximum of  of the Paladin\'s health times the number of party members).  Damage which reduces the Paladin below  health will break the effect.  Lasts', '码内小队成员所受伤害的  会转移给圣骑士（上限为圣骑士生命值的  乘以小队成员人数）。若转移的伤害使圣骑士生命值降至  以下，该效果将被击破。  持续'),
    ('|cFF00FF00Use: EXPERIENCE GO BRR!|r', '|cFF00FF00使用：经验起飞！|r'),
    ('|cFF00FF00Use: Instantly levels the user to 60!|r', '|cFF00FF00使用：立即将使用者提升到 60 级！|r'),
    ('|cFF00FF00Use: Instantly levels the user to 70! Requires level 60.|r', '|cFF00FF00使用：立即将使用者提升到 70 级！需要 60 级。|r'),
    ('|cFF00FF00Use: Uncovers the hidden areas of the world on your map.|r', '|cFF00FF00使用：在地图上揭示世界的隐藏区域。|r'),
    ('|cFFFF0000THIS ITEM IS TEMPORARY AND WILL DESTROY ITSELF|r|n|n The Mystic Altar is a powerful tool used to forge your gear with powerful enchants to change the way your Hero plays. These enchants range from changing how certain abilities work, to teaching you brand new abilities! You can obtain permanent Mystic Altars and find Mystic Altars hidden throughout the world.', '|cFFFF0000此物品为临时物品，将自行摧毁|r|n|n 神秘祭坛是为你装备锻造强力附魔的强大工具，可改变你的英雄玩法。这些附魔既能改变某些技能的运作方式，也能教你全新的技能！你可以获得永久神秘祭坛，也能在世界各处找到隐藏的神秘祭坛。'),
    ('|cff00ff00Converts an item to its Bloodforged Equivalent|r\n|cffff0000\nBloodforging your equipment will remove the PvE power and replace it with PvP Power. If you are Bloodforging higher difficulty items, the stats will be downgraded!\n\nEntering Heroic or Ascended raids with Bloodforged will give you a Bloodstained Debuff. \nThis will reduce your damage and healing done by 20% and increase the damage you take by 20%.\n\nBe careful Heroes, this is IRREVERSIBLE. |r', '|cff00ff00将物品转化为其熔血等价物|r\n|cffff0000\n熔血你的装备会移除 PvE 属性并替换为 PvP 属性。若你熔血的是更高难度的物品，属性将会降级！\n\n带着熔血装备进入英雄或飞升突袭将获得「血污」减益。\n这会使你造成的伤害与治疗降低 20%，受到伤害提高 20%。\n\n请小心，英雄们，此操作不可逆。|r'),
    ('|cff00ffff This will allow you to choose from a variety of item level 105 pvp sets.\n\nThis item is a consumable granting 1 gear set per Outlandish Felforged Provisions|r', '|cff00ffff 你可以从中选择多种物品等级 105 的 PvP 套装。\n\n此物品为消耗品，每份外域邪铸物资可提供 1 套装备|r'),
    ('|r|cff00FFFFThis case contains an attuned keystone used to enter the Karazhan Crypts. Opening this container will add it to your collection.\n|r', '|r|cff00FFFF此箱中装有一枚用于进入卡拉赞地下墓穴的调谐钥石。打开此容器会将其加入你的收藏。\n|r');
